/* 初中词汇的例句（第六十二次优化），按词条编号 i 存，并进 IELTS_RICH（rich() 先查它，编号和单词都对得上才用）。
   一部分沿用高中 / 四级书里同一个词的例句，其余是整理时按初中难度新写的，见 src/cz/Lxx.tsv。 */
window.IELTS_RICH=window.IELTS_RICH||{};Object.assign(window.IELTS_RICH,{
51001:{"w":"junior","e":"She started as a junior clerk and became the manager of the bank ten years later.","t":"她从一名**资历较浅的**职员做起，十年后当上了银行经理。"},
51002:{"w":"season","e":"Winter is the coldest season of the year in our city.","t":"冬天是我们城市一年中最冷的**季节**。"},
51003:{"w":"dentist","e":"I have to see the dentist tomorrow because my tooth hurts.","t":"我明天得去看**牙科医生**，因为我牙疼。"},
51004:{"w":"worth","e":"This old book is worth a lot of money.","t":"这本旧书**值**很多钱。"},
51005:{"w":"bleed","e":"My nose began to bleed after I was hit by the ball during the game.","t":"比赛中我被球砸到后，鼻子开始**流血**。"},
51006:{"w":"see","e":"From the top of the hill, we could see the whole town and the river.","t":"从山顶上，我们能**看见**整个小镇和那条河。"},
51007:{"w":"area","e":"This area of the city is famous for its old streets and small shops.","t":"这座城市的这个**地区**以老街和小店而闻名。"},
51008:{"w":"lend","e":"Could you lend me your pen? I forgot to bring mine today.","t":"你能**借给**我你的钢笔吗？我今天忘带了。"},
51009:{"w":"tourist","e":"Many tourists visit the old town in summer to see its famous bridge.","t":"夏天很多**游客**来这座古镇参观它著名的桥。"},
51010:{"w":"scientist","e":"The scientist spent many years studying how birds find their way home.","t":"这位**科学家**花了很多年研究鸟是怎么找到回家的路的。"},
51011:{"w":"mile","e":"It is about two miles from my home to the school.","t":"我家到学校大约有两**英里**。"},
51012:{"w":"example","e":"Can you give me an example of how to use this word?","t":"你能给我举一个这个词的用法**例子**吗？"},
51013:{"w":"aim","e":"The main aim of this project is to protect local wildlife.","t":"这个项目的主要**目的**是保护当地的野生动物。"},
51014:{"w":"blood","e":"The nurse took a little blood from my arm for the test.","t":"护士从我的胳膊上抽了一点**血**做检查。"},
51015:{"w":"scare","e":"The loud thunder scared the little girl, and she ran to her mother.","t":"响亮的雷声把小女孩**吓坏**了，她跑向了妈妈。"},
51016:{"w":"reply","e":"He asked me a question, but I didn't know how to reply.","t":"他问了我一个问题，可我不知道怎么**回答**。"},
51017:{"w":"achieve","e":"After two years of hard work, our team achieved great success.","t":"经过两年的努力，我们的团队**取得**了巨大的成功。"},
51018:{"w":"die","e":"The flowers will die if you forget to give them water.","t":"如果你忘了浇水，这些花就会**死掉**。"},
51019:{"w":"fresh","e":"We bought fresh fish and vegetables at the market this morning.","t":"今天早上我们在市场买了**新鲜**的鱼和蔬菜。"},
51020:{"w":"top","e":"We climbed to the top of the hill and enjoyed the view.","t":"我们爬到山**顶**，欣赏了风景。"},
51021:{"w":"nothing","e":"There is nothing in the fridge, so we have to go shopping.","t":"冰箱里**什么都没有**，我们只好去买东西了。"},
51022:{"w":"boss","e":"My boss is kind, but he wants us to finish work on time.","t":"我的**上司**人很好，但他要我们按时完成工作。"},
51023:{"w":"depend","e":"Young children depend on their parents for food and care.","t":"年幼的孩子**依靠**父母获得食物和照顾。"},
51024:{"w":"silent","e":"She stayed silent when the teacher asked her why she was late.","t":"老师问她为什么迟到，她一直**沉默**。"},
51025:{"w":"honour","e":"It is a great honour for our school to welcome the famous writer.","t":"对我们学校来说，欢迎这位著名作家是莫大的**荣誉**。"},
51026:{"w":"weight","e":"The weight of the box is about five kilograms, so I can carry it easily.","t":"这个箱子的**重量**大约是五公斤，所以我拿得动。"},
51027:{"w":"think","e":"I think we should finish the project before the weekend.","t":"我**认为**我们应该在周末前完成这个项目。"},
51028:{"w":"activity","e":"The school offers many after-class activities, such as music, painting and basketball.","t":"学校提供许多课外**活动**，比如音乐、绘画和篮球。"},
51029:{"w":"brave","e":"The brave young man jumped into the river to save a child who was drowning.","t":"那个**勇敢的**年轻人跳进河里，救起了一个溺水的孩子。"},
51030:{"w":"still","e":"It is already midnight, but my brother is still doing his homework.","t":"已经半夜了，我哥哥**还**在做作业。"},
51031:{"w":"hang","e":"The waiter did me a favor by hanging my coat up on the hook.","t":"服务员帮我将外衣**挂**在了衣钩上面。"},
51032:{"w":"happen","e":"Nobody knows exactly what happened on the night the old bridge fell down.","t":"没人确切知道老桥倒塌那晚**发生**了什么。"},
51033:{"w":"oven","e":"Bake the bread in a hot oven for about thirty minutes until it turns brown.","t":"把面包放进高温的**烤箱**里烤三十分钟左右，直到变成棕色。"},
51034:{"w":"judge","e":"You should not judge a person only by his clothes.","t":"你不应该只凭衣着去**判断**一个人。"},
51035:{"w":"empty","e":"Please empty your pockets before you put your jeans in the washing machine.","t":"把牛仔裤放进洗衣机之前，请把口袋里的东西**倒空**。"},
51036:{"w":"neither","e":"Neither of my parents can drive, so we usually take the bus.","t":"我父母**都不**会开车，所以我们通常坐公交。"},
51037:{"w":"sky","e":"A few white clouds were floating slowly across the blue sky.","t":"几朵白云在蓝色的**天空**中缓缓飘过。"},
51038:{"w":"towards","e":"The little boy ran towards his mother with a big smile.","t":"小男孩笑着**朝**妈妈跑去。"},
51039:{"w":"a.m.","e":"The first class starts at eight a.m. every day.","t":"每天**上午**八点开始上第一节课。"},
51040:{"w":"newspaper","e":"My grandfather reads the newspaper at the breakfast table every morning.","t":"我爷爷每天早上在早餐桌前看**报纸**。"},
51041:{"w":"volleyball","e":"We play volleyball on the beach every Sunday afternoon with our friends.","t":"每个星期天下午我们都和朋友们在海滩上打**排球**。"},
51042:{"w":"fantastic","e":"The film was fantastic, and we all wanted to see it again.","t":"这部电影**棒极了**，我们都想再看一遍。"},
51043:{"w":"treat","e":"Our teacher treats all the students fairly.","t":"我们的老师**对待**所有学生都很公平。"},
51044:{"w":"us","e":"Our teacher gave us a lot of homework before the holiday.","t":"假期前老师给了**我们**很多作业。"},
51045:{"w":"should","e":"You should drink more water and sleep earlier.","t":"你**应该**多喝水，早点睡觉。"},
51046:{"w":"engineer","e":"My aunt is an engineer who designs bridges for the city.","t":"我姨妈是一名为城市设计桥梁的**工程师**。"},
51047:{"w":"connect","e":"What special food and activities are connected with this festival?","t":"有什么特别的食物和活动与这个节日**相关**？"},
51048:{"w":"hobby","e":"My father's hobby is growing vegetables in the small garden behind our house.","t":"我爸爸的**业余爱好**是在屋后的小菜园里种菜。"},
51049:{"w":"wear","e":"You should wear a warm coat because it is very cold outside.","t":"外面很冷，你应该**穿**一件暖和的外套。"},
51050:{"w":"click","e":"To open the file, just click on the small blue button at the top of the page.","t":"要打开文件，只要**点击**页面顶部那个蓝色小按钮就行。"},
51051:{"w":"scared","e":"She felt scared when she heard strange noises outside her bedroom window.","t":"听到卧室窗外有奇怪的声音，她感到**惊恐**。"},
51052:{"w":"uncomfortable","e":"The old wooden chair was so uncomfortable that I could not sit still for long.","t":"那把旧木椅太**不舒服**了，我没法久坐。"},
51053:{"w":"chew","e":"Rats like to chew on something hard.","t":"老鼠喜欢**咀嚼**硬物。"},
51054:{"w":"rude","e":"It is rude to talk loudly on your phone while others are reading in the library.","t":"别人在图书馆看书时大声打电话是很**不礼貌**的。"},
51055:{"w":"thief","e":"The thief climbed through the window and stole my mother's gold ring.","t":"**小偷**从窗户爬进来，偷走了妈妈的金戒指。"},
51056:{"w":"junk","e":"Our garage is full of old junk that nobody has used for years.","t":"我们的车库里堆满了**无用的东西**，好几年都没人用过了。"},
51057:{"w":"captain","e":"Our football captain scored two goals in the last ten minutes.","t":"我们的足球**队长**在最后十分钟进了两个球。"},
51058:{"w":"pupil","e":"Every pupil in the class must hand in their homework by Friday.","t":"班里的每个**学生**都必须在星期五前交作业。"},
51059:{"w":"dish","e":"My mother cooked six different dishes for dinner last night.","t":"昨晚妈妈做了六道不同的**菜**当晚饭。"},
51060:{"w":"include","e":"The price of the ticket includes lunch and a visit to the museum.","t":"门票价格**包含**午餐和参观博物馆。"},
51061:{"w":"race","e":"Our class won the relay race at the school sports meeting last week.","t":"上周的校运会上，我们班赢得了接力**比赛**。"},
51062:{"w":"tonight","e":"We are going to watch a football match on TV tonight.","t":"我们**今晚**要在电视上看一场足球赛。"},
51063:{"w":"map","e":"I drew a simple map to show him the way to our school.","t":"我画了一张简单的**地图**，给他指去我们学校的路。"},
51064:{"w":"step","e":"Take one step back, and you will see the whole painting.","t":"往后退一**步**，你就能看到整幅画了。"},
51065:{"w":"refuse","e":"She refused to give up even after she failed the exam twice.","t":"即使考试失败了两次，她也**不愿**放弃。"},
51066:{"w":"difference","e":"I can't see any difference between these two photos.","t":"我看不出这两张照片有什么**不同**。"},
51067:{"w":"teamwork","e":"Good teamwork helped our class win the basketball game.","t":"良好的**团队合作**帮助我们班赢得了这场篮球赛。"},
51068:{"w":"uncle","e":"My uncle lives in Hangzhou and often takes me fishing in summer.","t":"我**叔叔**住在杭州，夏天常带我去钓鱼。"},
51069:{"w":"green","e":"The grass in the park turns green when spring comes.","t":"春天一到，公园里的草就变**绿**了。"},
51070:{"w":"bike","e":"I ride my bike to school every day because it is not far.","t":"我每天骑**自行车**上学，因为不远。"},
51071:{"w":"effort","e":"Henry has put a lot of effort into communicating with new friends.","t":"亨利非常**努力**地与新朋友进行交流。"},
51072:{"w":"grammar","e":"Reading English books every day helps me learn new words and improve my grammar.","t":"每天读英文书帮我学到新单词，也提高了我的**语法**水平。"},
51073:{"w":"pancake","e":"We had pancakes with honey for breakfast this morning.","t":"今天早上我们早餐吃了蜂蜜**薄煎饼**。"},
51074:{"w":"abroad","e":"More and more Chinese students choose to study abroad after they finish high school.","t":"越来越多的中国学生高中毕业后选择**出国**留学。"},
51075:{"w":"cough","e":"The smoke made everyone in the room cough.","t":"烟让房间里的每个人都**咳嗽**起来。"},
51076:{"w":"like","e":"She sings like a bird, and everyone loves to hear her.","t":"她唱歌**像**小鸟一样好听，大家都爱听。"},
51077:{"w":"join","e":"I want to join the school music club because I love singing.","t":"我想**加入**学校音乐社团，因为我热爱唱歌。"},
51078:{"w":"without","e":"He left the house without his umbrella.","t":"他出门**没**带伞。"},
51079:{"w":"nervous","e":"I always feel nervous before I speak in front of the class.","t":"在全班同学面前发言之前，我总是感到**紧张**。"},
51080:{"w":"soon","e":"Please be patient, because the doctor will see you soon.","t":"请耐心等待，医生**很快**就会来看你。"},
51081:{"w":"only","e":"She is the only student in our class who can speak Spanish.","t":"她是我们班**唯一**会说西班牙语的学生。"},
51082:{"w":"restaurant","e":"We had dinner in a small restaurant near the station last night.","t":"昨晚我们在车站附近的一家小**餐馆**吃了晚饭。"},
51083:{"w":"finish","e":"I will go out to play football after I finish my homework.","t":"我**做完**作业后就出去踢足球。"},
51084:{"w":"deep","e":"The river is very deep here, so don't swim.","t":"这里的河水很**深**，不要游泳。"},
51085:{"w":"elder","e":"The elders of the village met to discuss the problem of the old bridge.","t":"村里的**长者**们聚在一起商量那座旧桥的问题。"},
51086:{"w":"photo","e":"She took a photo of the beautiful lake with her new phone.","t":"她用新手机拍了一张美丽的湖的**照片**。"},
51087:{"w":"weekday","e":"I get up at six thirty on every weekday, but later on Sundays.","t":"我每个**工作日**六点半起床，星期天则晚一点。"},
51088:{"w":"wind","e":"A cold wind blew across the playground, so we all put on our coats.","t":"一阵冷**风**吹过操场，所以我们都穿上了外套。"},
51089:{"w":"fox","e":"The fox is a clever animal, and it often hunts at night.","t":"**狐狸**是一种聪明的动物，常在夜间捕猎。"},
51090:{"w":"grape","e":"My grandfather grows grapes in his garden and makes juice from them every autumn.","t":"我爷爷在园子里种**葡萄**，每年秋天都用它们榨汁。"},
51091:{"w":"new","e":"I got a new schoolbag for my birthday, and it is bright red.","t":"生日时我得到一个**新**书包，是鲜红色的。"},
51092:{"w":"divide","e":"All the students will be divided into groups of 12 to 15 students.","t":"所有的学生将被**分成**小组，每组12到15人。"},
51093:{"w":"company","e":"My uncle works for a small computer company in the north of the city.","t":"我叔叔在城北一家小型电脑**公司**工作。"},
51094:{"w":"listen","e":"Please listen carefully, because I will only explain the rules once.","t":"请仔细**听**，因为规则我只讲一遍。"},
51095:{"w":"want","e":"I want to be a doctor when I grow up, because I like helping people.","t":"我长大后**想**当医生，因为我喜欢帮助别人。"},
51096:{"w":"can","e":"My little sister can ride a bike without any help now.","t":"我妹妹现在**能**不用任何帮助骑自行车了。"},
51097:{"w":"kilometre","e":"The nearest bus stop is only one kilometre away from our house.","t":"最近的公交站离我们家只有一**公里**。"},
51098:{"w":"fruit","e":"You should eat more fresh fruit and vegetables every day.","t":"你每天应该多吃新鲜的**水果**和蔬菜。"},
51099:{"w":"environment","e":"We should all do something to protect the environment, such as using less plastic.","t":"我们都应该为保护**环境**做点事，比如少用塑料。"},
51100:{"w":"app","e":"I use a free app on my phone to learn English words.","t":"我用手机上的一个免费**应用程序**学英语单词。"},
51101:{"w":"lesson","e":"We have two English lessons on Tuesday and one on Thursday every week.","t":"我们每周二有两节英语**课**，周四有一节。"},
51102:{"w":"attention","e":"Please pay attention to the teacher when she is speaking.","t":"老师讲话时，请**注意**听。"},
51103:{"w":"I","e":"I usually do my homework after dinner and then read for half an hour.","t":"**我**通常晚饭后做作业，然后读半小时书。"},
51104:{"w":"within","e":"The bus will arrive within ten minutes, so please wait here.","t":"公共汽车十分钟**之内**就会到，请在这里等一下。"},
51105:{"w":"cloudy","e":"It was cloudy all morning, but the sun came out in the afternoon.","t":"上午一直是**多云**天气，但下午太阳出来了。"},
51106:{"w":"actually","e":"He looks calm, but actually he is very nervous about the match.","t":"他看起来很平静，但**实际上**他对这场比赛非常紧张。"},
51107:{"w":"memory","e":"I have happy memories of my childhood in the countryside.","t":"我对在乡下度过的童年有着快乐的**回忆**。"},
51108:{"w":"strategy","e":"Our teacher taught us a good strategy for learning new words.","t":"老师教了我们一个学新单词的好**策略**。"},
51109:{"w":"complain","e":"Tom always complains that there is too much homework.","t":"汤姆总是**抱怨**作业太多。"},
51110:{"w":"essay","e":"Please write an essay about your best friend for tomorrow's class.","t":"请为明天的课写一篇关于你最好朋友的**短文**。"},
51111:{"w":"poster","e":"There is a poster for the school concert on the wall.","t":"墙上贴着一张学校音乐会的**海报**。"},
51112:{"w":"destroy","e":"The big fire destroyed more than fifty houses in the small mountain village.","t":"这场大火**毁掉**了这个小山村里的五十多所房子。"},
51113:{"w":"bush","e":"A small bird was hiding in the bush behind the house.","t":"一只小鸟躲在房子后面的**灌木丛**里。"},
51114:{"w":"iron","e":"It will take me about half an hour to iron that dress.","t":"**烫平**那条连衣裙，我大概要花上半个小时的时间。"},
51115:{"w":"cigarette","e":"Smoking cigarettes is bad for your health, so you should never start.","t":"吸**香烟**对健康有害，所以你千万不要开始。"},
51116:{"w":"anymore","e":"My grandfather is old, so he does not drive anymore.","t":"我爷爷年纪大了，所以他**不再**开车了。"},
51117:{"w":"dare","e":"She didn't dare to tell her parents about the broken window.","t":"她不**敢**把打破窗户的事告诉父母。"},
51118:{"w":"documentary","e":"We watched a documentary about wild animals in Africa in class today.","t":"今天课上我们看了一部关于非洲野生动物的**纪录片**。"},
51119:{"w":"survive","e":"Only a few plants can survive in the hot, dry desert.","t":"只有少数植物能在炎热干燥的沙漠里**活下来**。"},
51120:{"w":"shake","e":"He shook his head and said he did not agree with the plan.","t":"他**摇**了摇头，说他不同意这个计划。"},
51121:{"w":"correct","e":"Please correct the mistakes in your essay before you hand it in.","t":"交作文之前，请**改正**文中的错误。"},
51122:{"w":"next","e":"The next train to Beijing leaves at half past nine tomorrow morning.","t":"去北京的**下一**班火车明天上午九点半开出。"},
51123:{"w":"early","e":"I get up early every morning to read English for half an hour.","t":"我每天早上**早**起，读半小时英语。"},
51124:{"w":"shine","e":"The stars shine brightly in the clear night sky over the mountains.","t":"群山上空晴朗的夜空中，星星**闪闪发光**。"},
51125:{"w":"value","e":"This old painting has great value, so it is kept in a safe.","t":"这幅古画很有**价值**，所以被锁在保险柜里。"},
51126:{"w":"review","e":"Before going to bed, please review the day's classes.","t":"睡觉前，请**复习**一下白天的课程内容。"},
51127:{"w":"outside","e":"The children are playing outside the classroom while they wait for the bell to ring.","t":"孩子们在教室**外面**玩，等着铃声响起。"},
51128:{"w":"or","e":"Would you like tea or coffee with your breakfast?","t":"早餐你想喝茶**还是**咖啡？"},
51129:{"w":"outside","e":"It was raining outside, so we stayed in and played cards.","t":"**外面**在下雨，所以我们待在屋里打牌。"},
51130:{"w":"board","e":"The exam results are on the notice board outside the office.","t":"考试成绩贴在办公室外面的**布告栏**上。"},
51131:{"w":"sandwich","e":"I made a cheese sandwich and took it to school for lunch.","t":"我做了一个奶酪**三明治**带到学校当午饭。"},
51132:{"w":"design","e":"She wants to design clothes when she grows up.","t":"她长大后想**设计**服装。"},
51133:{"w":"worse","e":"My cold got worse last night, so I stayed home today.","t":"我的感冒昨晚变得**更糟**了，所以今天我待在家里。"},
51134:{"w":"finger","e":"I cut my finger while I was cooking dinner for the family.","t":"我给家人做晚饭时割伤了**手指**。"},
51135:{"w":"everywhere","e":"There were books everywhere in his room, on the bed and even on the floor.","t":"他的房间里**到处**都是书，床上甚至地板上都有。"},
51136:{"w":"daughter","e":"Their daughter is ten years old and she loves playing the piano.","t":"他们的**女儿**十岁了，喜欢弹钢琴。"},
51137:{"w":"impossible","e":"This kind of research would be impossible without computers.","t":"没有计算机就**无法**进行这种研究。"},
51138:{"w":"negative","e":"Don't be so negative; you can do better next time.","t":"别这么**消极**，你下次能做得更好。"},
51139:{"w":"meet","e":"I will meet you outside the school gate at seven o'clock.","t":"我七点在校门外和你**会面**。"},
51140:{"w":"size","e":"These shoes are the wrong size, so I want to change them.","t":"这双鞋**尺码**不对，所以我想换一双。"},
51141:{"w":"child","e":"Every child in the village goes to school by bus.","t":"村里的每个**小孩**都坐公共汽车去上学。"},
51142:{"w":"university","e":"My cousin studies at a famous university in Shanghai.","t":"我表哥在上海一所著名的**大学**读书。"},
51143:{"w":"this","e":"This is my new classmate, and she comes from Ningbo.","t":"**这**是我的新同学，她来自宁波。"},
51144:{"w":"view","e":"From my window, I have a beautiful view of the lake.","t":"从我的窗户可以看到湖的美丽**景色**。"},
51145:{"w":"parent","e":"My parents always ask me to call them when I get home.","t":"我**父母**总是让我到家后给他们打电话。"},
51146:{"w":"sugar","e":"Please put two spoons of sugar in my tea.","t":"请往我的茶里放两勺**糖**。"},
51147:{"w":"wall","e":"There is a big map of China on the wall of our classroom.","t":"我们教室的**墙**上挂着一张中国大地图。"},
51148:{"w":"youth","e":"Many people spend their youth studying hard for the college entrance exam.","t":"许多人把**青春**都花在为高考努力学习上。"},
51149:{"w":"fact","e":"It is a fact that the earth goes around the sun.","t":"地球围绕太阳转是一个**事实**。"},
51150:{"w":"course","e":"You can sign up for this training course in advance.","t":"你可以提前报名参加这门培训**课程**。"},
51151:{"w":"repeat","e":"Could you repeat the question, please? I did not hear it clearly.","t":"你能把问题**重说**一遍吗？我没听清楚。"},
51152:{"w":"tooth","e":"I lost a tooth when I bit into an apple.","t":"我咬苹果时掉了一颗**牙**。"},
51153:{"w":"move","e":"We will move to a bigger house next month.","t":"下个月我们要**搬**到一所更大的房子里。"},
51154:{"w":"beside","e":"A small garden beside our school is a popular place for evening walks.","t":"我们学校**旁边**有个小花园，是晚上散步的热门去处。"},
51155:{"w":"suggest","e":"I suggest that we visit the science museum on Saturday morning.","t":"我**建议**我们星期六上午去参观科技馆。"},
51156:{"w":"its","e":"The bird built its nest in the old tree behind our house.","t":"那只鸟在我们房子后面的老树上筑了**它的**巢。"},
51157:{"w":"recent","e":"The school has changed a lot in recent years, with a new library and sports hall.","t":"这所学校**近年来**变化很大，新建了图书馆和体育馆。"},
51158:{"w":"push","e":"He pushed the heavy door open and walked into the room.","t":"他把沉重的门**推**开，走进了房间。"},
51159:{"w":"sit","e":"Please sit down and wait here for a moment.","t":"请在这儿**坐**下稍等一会儿。"},
51160:{"w":"again","e":"Please read the text again and then answer the questions.","t":"请把课文**再**读一遍，然后回答问题。"},
51161:{"w":"bright","e":"The classroom is bright and warm because the sun shines through the big windows.","t":"阳光透过大窗户照进来，教室里**明亮**又温暖。"},
51162:{"w":"pink","e":"She wore a pink dress to her cousin's birthday party.","t":"她穿着一条**粉红色**的连衣裙去参加表妹的生日聚会。"},
51163:{"w":"late","e":"We were late for the first class because the bus broke down.","t":"我们因为公共汽车抛锚，第一节课**迟到**了。"},
51164:{"w":"clock","e":"The clock on the wall shows that it is already half past ten.","t":"墙上的**时钟**显示已经十点半了。"},
51165:{"w":"event","e":"The school sports meeting is a big event for all of us.","t":"学校运动会对我们所有人来说是一件**大事**。"},
51166:{"w":"most","e":"Most students in our class walk to school because it is close.","t":"我们班**大多数**学生步行上学，因为学校很近。"},
51167:{"w":"horse","e":"The farmer rode his horse across the field to the river.","t":"农夫骑着**马**穿过田野来到河边。"},
51168:{"w":"soil","e":"Plants need good soil, clean water and plenty of sunlight to grow.","t":"植物需要好的**土壤**、清洁的水和充足的阳光才能生长。"},
51169:{"w":"blouse","e":"She bought a white blouse to wear with her blue skirt.","t":"她买了一件白色**衬衫**，配她的蓝裙子穿。"},
51170:{"w":"friendly","e":"Our new neighbours are very friendly to us.","t":"我们的新邻居对我们非常**友好**。"},
51171:{"w":"lap","e":"The little girl sat on her grandmother's lap and listened to a story.","t":"小女孩坐在奶奶的**膝上**听故事。"},
51172:{"w":"eastern","e":"Shanghai is a big city in eastern China.","t":"上海是中国**东部**的一座大城市。"},
51173:{"w":"tutor","e":"Jane tutored this little girl in English.","t":"简给这个小女孩当英文**家教**。"},
51174:{"w":"comment","e":"The teacher wrote a kind comment at the bottom of my essay.","t":"老师在我作文的末尾写了一条友善的**评论**。"},
51175:{"w":"furry","e":"The little rabbit is soft and furry, and the children love it.","t":"这只小兔子又软又**毛茸茸**，孩子们都很喜欢它。"},
51176:{"w":"heel","e":"My new shoes are too tight and have hurt the back of my heel.","t":"我的新鞋太紧了，把**脚后跟**磨疼了。"},
51177:{"w":"slide","e":"The children took turns to go down the slide in the park.","t":"孩子们轮流从公园的**滑梯**上滑下来。"},
51178:{"w":"pronoun","e":"In English, a pronoun such as \"he\" or \"it\" is often used in place of a noun.","t":"在英语中，像 he 或 it 这样的**代词**常用来代替名词。"},
51179:{"w":"topic","e":"The weather is always a safe topic when you talk with people you have just met.","t":"和刚认识的人聊天时，天气总是个安全的**话题**。"},
51180:{"w":"infinitive","e":"Our English teacher explained how to use an infinitive after a verb.","t":"英语老师讲解了动词后面怎样使用**不定式**。"},
51181:{"w":"teenager","e":"Many teenagers spend more than three hours a day on their phones.","t":"许多**青少年**每天花三个多小时在手机上。"},
51182:{"w":"skin","e":"Her skin turned red after she spent all day in the sun.","t":"在阳光下待了一整天后，她的**皮肤**变红了。"},
51183:{"w":"shampoo","e":"Use some shampoo to wash your hair, and then dry it with a towel.","t":"用一点**洗发剂**洗头，然后用毛巾擦干。"},
51184:{"w":"admire","e":"I really admire my mother for raising three children while working full time.","t":"我真心**钦佩**妈妈，她一边全职工作一边养大了三个孩子。"},
51185:{"w":"mum","e":"My mum makes delicious noodles every Sunday for the whole family.","t":"我**妈妈**每个星期天都给全家人做好吃的面条。"},
51186:{"w":"standard","e":"The school sets a high standard for every student's homework.","t":"学校对每个学生的作业都有很高的**标准**。"},
51187:{"w":"wise","e":"It was wise of you to take an umbrella today.","t":"你今天带伞真**明智**。"},
51188:{"w":"spread","e":"The news of their victory spread quickly through the whole school.","t":"他们获胜的消息很快就在全校**传播**开来。"},
51189:{"w":"strawberry","e":"We picked fresh strawberries in the field and ate them with cream.","t":"我们在地里摘了新鲜的**草莓**，蘸着奶油吃。"},
51190:{"w":"ache","e":"After the long walk up the mountain, my legs ached for two days.","t":"爬了很长一段山路之后，我的双腿**疼痛**了两天。"},
51191:{"w":"queen","e":"The queen lived in a beautiful castle by the sea.","t":"**女王**住在海边一座美丽的城堡里。"},
51192:{"w":"skirt","e":"I want to buy a red skirt for the school party.","t":"我想买一条红色的**裙子**去参加学校的聚会。"},
51193:{"w":"fear","e":"Many children have a fear of the dark and cannot sleep alone.","t":"许多孩子对黑暗心怀**恐惧**，不敢一个人睡。"},
51194:{"w":"warn","e":"The sign warns drivers to slow down near the school.","t":"标牌**提醒**司机在学校附近减速。"},
51195:{"w":"hurry","e":"We must hurry, or we will miss the last bus home.","t":"我们得**赶快**，否则就赶不上回家的末班车了。"},
51196:{"w":"business","e":"Her family runs a small business that sells tea.","t":"她家经营着一家卖茶叶的小**企业**。"},
51197:{"w":"soldier","e":"The young soldier wrote a long letter to his mother every week.","t":"这位年轻的**士兵**每周都给母亲写一封长信。"},
51198:{"w":"way","e":"Is there a better way to learn English words quickly?","t":"有没有更好的**方法**能快速记住英语单词？"},
51199:{"w":"industry","e":"The tourist industry gives jobs to thousands of people in this small town.","t":"旅游**产业**为这个小镇上数千人提供了工作。"},
51200:{"w":"bottom","e":"There is a small hole at the bottom of the bag.","t":"包的**底部**有一个小洞。"},
51201:{"w":"alone","e":"She lives alone in a small flat near the university.","t":"她**独自**住在大学附近的一套小公寓里。"},
51202:{"w":"whale","e":"We took a boat out to sea and saw a huge whale jumping out of the water.","t":"我们乘船出海，看到一头巨大的**鲸鱼**跃出水面。"},
51203:{"w":"cow","e":"The farmer gets up early every day to milk his cows.","t":"农夫每天早起给他的**奶牛**挤奶。"},
51204:{"w":"ask","e":"I asked the shop assistant where the bus station was.","t":"我**询问**了售货员汽车站在哪里。"},
51205:{"w":"sudden","e":"The sudden noise made everyone in the room jump.","t":"**突然**的响声把屋里的人都吓了一跳。"},
51206:{"w":"mark","e":"There is a dirty mark on your white shirt.","t":"你的白衬衫上有一处**污渍**。"},
51207:{"w":"since","e":"I have lived in this city since I was five.","t":"我五岁**以来**一直住在这座城市。"},
51208:{"w":"belong","e":"This pen does not belong to me, so I will give it back.","t":"这支笔不**属于**我，所以我要把它还回去。"},
51209:{"w":"shark","e":"A shark can smell blood from a long way away in the sea.","t":"**鲨鱼**能在很远的地方就闻到海里的血腥味。"},
51210:{"w":"everyday","e":"She uses simple everyday English when she talks to her friends.","t":"她和朋友聊天时用简单的**日常**英语。"},
51211:{"w":"above","e":"A bright star shone above the mountain in the clear night sky.","t":"晴朗的夜空中，一颗明亮的星星在山的**上方**闪耀。"},
51212:{"w":"every","e":"Every student in our class must hand in the homework by Friday.","t":"我们班**每个**学生都必须在周五前交作业。"},
51213:{"w":"face","e":"She had a big smile on her face when she saw the gift.","t":"看到礼物时，她**脸**上带着灿烂的笑容。"},
51214:{"w":"soup","e":"My grandmother makes hot chicken soup when someone in the family has a cold.","t":"家里有人感冒时，奶奶会煮热腾腾的鸡**汤**。"},
51215:{"w":"double","e":"The price of the ticket has doubled since last year.","t":"票价比去年**翻了一倍**。"},
51216:{"w":"east","e":"The windows of our classroom face east, so it is bright in the morning.","t":"我们教室的窗户朝**东**，所以早上很明亮。"},
51217:{"w":"proud","e":"My parents are proud of me because I won the speech contest.","t":"我赢得了演讲比赛，父母为我感到**自豪**。"},
51218:{"w":"shy","e":"She is too shy to speak in front of so many people.","t":"她太**害羞**了，不敢在这么多人面前讲话。"},
51219:{"w":"ever","e":"Have you ever seen snow in your hometown?","t":"你在家乡**曾经**见过雪吗？"},
51220:{"w":"small","e":"We live in a small town with only one school and one park.","t":"我们住在一个只有一所学校和一个公园的**小**镇上。"},
51221:{"w":"west","e":"The sun goes down in the west, and the sky turns red.","t":"太阳在**西**边落下，天空变成了红色。"},
51222:{"w":"space","e":"There is not enough space in this room for a piano.","t":"这个房间里没有足够的**空间**放钢琴。"},
51223:{"w":"key","e":"I lost my house key on the way home, so I had to wait for my mother.","t":"我在回家的路上弄丢了房门**钥匙**，只好等妈妈回来。"},
51224:{"w":"old","e":"My grandfather has an old radio that he still listens to every day.","t":"爷爷有一台**旧**收音机，他每天仍在听。"},
51225:{"w":"game","e":"We played a computer game together after we finished our homework.","t":"做完作业后，我们一起玩了一个电脑**游戏**。"},
51226:{"w":"harm","e":"Too much sugar can harm your teeth, so try to eat fewer sweets.","t":"吃太多糖会**损害**牙齿，所以尽量少吃甜食。"},
51227:{"w":"one","e":"She has two brothers, and one of them lives in London.","t":"她有两个兄弟，其中**一个**住在伦敦。"},
51228:{"w":"enjoy","e":"My grandfather enjoys listening to old songs while he sits in the garden.","t":"我爷爷坐在花园里时**喜欢**听老歌。"},
51229:{"w":"ours","e":"This is not your seat; the seat by the window is ours.","t":"这不是你的座位，靠窗的那个座位是**我们的**。"},
51230:{"w":"ugly","e":"Everyone said the old building was ugly, but I liked its strange shape.","t":"大家都说那栋老楼很**丑陋**，但我喜欢它奇特的形状。"},
51231:{"w":"sheep","e":"The farmer's sheep eat grass on the hill all day.","t":"农夫的**羊**整天在山坡上吃草。"},
51232:{"w":"people","e":"Many people go to the park on weekends to take a walk.","t":"很多**人**周末去公园散步。"},
51233:{"w":"bird","e":"A small bird sang in the tree outside my window this morning.","t":"今天早上，窗外树上有一只小**鸟**在唱歌。"},
51234:{"w":"eagle","e":"We watched an eagle fly high above the mountains, looking for food below.","t":"我们看着一只**老鹰**在群山上空高高飞翔，寻找下方的食物。"},
51235:{"w":"instance","e":"This is just one instance of how the Internet has changed our lives.","t":"这只是互联网改变我们生活的一个**例子**。"},
51236:{"w":"girlfriend","e":"He bought a small gift for his girlfriend on her birthday.","t":"他在**女朋友**生日那天给她买了一份小礼物。"},
51237:{"w":"march","e":"The soldiers began to march across the bridge at dawn.","t":"黎明时分，士兵们开始**行军**过桥。"},
51238:{"w":"conference","e":"I'm going to a conference in London.","t":"我要去伦敦参加一个**会议**。"},
51239:{"w":"represent","e":"In this famous painting, the white bird represents peace and hope for the future.","t":"在这幅名画中，白鸟**象征**着和平和对未来的希望。"},
51240:{"w":"impolite","e":"It is impolite to talk with your mouth full of food.","t":"嘴里塞满食物说话是**不礼貌**的。"},
51241:{"w":"schoolwork","e":"I always finish my schoolwork before I watch TV in the evening.","t":"晚上看电视之前，我总是先做完**家庭作业**。"},
51242:{"w":"labour","e":"The farmer was tired after a day of hard labour in the field.","t":"农夫在地里辛苦**劳动**了一天，累坏了。"},
51243:{"w":"upstairs","e":"Please go upstairs and ask your brother to come down for dinner.","t":"请到**楼上**去叫你哥哥下来吃晚饭。"},
51244:{"w":"universe","e":"Scientists believe that the universe began with a huge explosion billions of years ago.","t":"科学家相信**宇宙**起源于数十亿年前的一次大爆炸。"},
51245:{"w":"AI","e":"Many people use AI to help them learn new languages.","t":"许多人用**人工智能**帮助自己学习新语言。"},
51246:{"w":"trouble","e":"I had some trouble finding the way to the station, but a kind man helped me.","t":"我找去车站的路时遇到了些**麻烦**，不过一位好心人帮了我。"},
51247:{"w":"fight","e":"The two boys had a fight over a football, but the teacher stopped them.","t":"两个男孩为一个足球**打架**，老师及时制止了他们。"},
51248:{"w":"duck","e":"A duck swam across the pond, followed by five small ducklings.","t":"一只**鸭子**游过池塘，后面跟着五只小鸭。"},
51249:{"w":"fast","e":"The fast train takes only two hours to get from Hangzhou to Shanghai.","t":"这趟**快**车从杭州到上海只需两个小时。"},
51250:{"w":"theirs","e":"This classroom is ours, and that one over there is theirs.","t":"这间教室是我们的，那边那间是**他们的**。"},
51251:{"w":"pronounce","e":"How do you pronounce this word?","t":"这个单词你怎么**发音**？"},
51252:{"w":"foot","e":"The little boy hurt his foot when he fell off his bike yesterday.","t":"那个小男孩昨天从自行车上摔下来，伤了**脚**。"},
51253:{"w":"international","e":"The school welcomes international students from more than thirty countries.","t":"这所学校欢迎来自三十多个国家的**国际**学生。"},
51254:{"w":"open","e":"Could you open the window? It is very hot in here.","t":"你能把窗户**打开**吗？这里太热了。"},
51255:{"w":"second","e":"This is the second time I have read this book, and I like it more.","t":"这是我**第二**次读这本书，我更喜欢它了。"},
51256:{"w":"birthday","e":"Tomorrow is my birthday, and my friends are coming to a party.","t":"明天是我的**生日**，朋友们要来参加聚会。"},
51257:{"w":"million","e":"More than one million people visit this beautiful city every year.","t":"每年有超过**一百万**人参观这座美丽的城市。"},
51258:{"w":"everybody","e":"Everybody in our class was surprised when the teacher told us the news.","t":"老师告诉我们那个消息时，我们班**每个人**都很惊讶。"},
51259:{"w":"station","e":"We waited at the station for almost twenty minutes, but the bus never came.","t":"我们在**车站**等了将近二十分钟，可公共汽车一直没来。"},
51260:{"w":"nice","e":"It was nice of you to help me with my homework last night.","t":"你昨晚帮我做作业，你真**好心**。"},
51261:{"w":"tree","e":"There is a big old tree behind our school, and birds live in it.","t":"我们学校后面有一棵老**树**，鸟儿住在上面。"},
51262:{"w":"breath","e":"You can see your breath on a cold morning.","t":"在寒冷的早晨，你能看见自己呼出的**气息**。"},
51263:{"w":"capital","e":"Beijing is the capital of China and a very large city.","t":"北京是中国的**首都**，也是一座很大的城市。"},
51264:{"w":"make","e":"My father likes to make breakfast for the whole family on Sundays.","t":"爸爸星期天喜欢为全家人**做**早饭。"},
51265:{"w":"packet","e":"He bought a packet of biscuits and a bottle of water at the station.","t":"他在车站买了**一小包**饼干和一瓶水。"},
51266:{"w":"elephant","e":"The elephant is the biggest animal on land, but it only eats plants.","t":"**大象**是陆地上最大的动物，却只吃植物。"},
51267:{"w":"or","e":"You can take the bus or ride a bike to school.","t":"你可以坐公共汽车**或**骑自行车去学校。"},
51268:{"w":"block","e":"Our school is just two blocks away from the station.","t":"我们学校离车站只有两个**街区**。"},
51269:{"w":"let","e":"My parents let me watch TV for one hour every evening.","t":"父母每天晚上**让**我看一个小时电视。"},
51270:{"w":"pound","e":"The ticket costs ten pounds, and children pay half price.","t":"门票十**英镑**，儿童半价。"},
51271:{"w":"maybe","e":"Maybe we can meet at the library after class and finish the project together.","t":"**也许**我们可以下课后在图书馆碰面，一起完成这个项目。"},
51272:{"w":"lose","e":"Be careful not to lose your keys on the way home.","t":"回家的路上小心别**丢**了钥匙。"},
51273:{"w":"cup","e":"She poured a cup of hot milk for her little brother before bed.","t":"睡前，她给弟弟倒了一**杯**热牛奶。"},
51274:{"w":"on","e":"There is a map on the wall of our classroom.","t":"我们教室的墙**上**有一张地图。"},
51275:{"w":"rich","e":"She comes from a rich family, but she never shows off.","t":"她出身于**富有**的家庭，却从不炫耀。"},
51276:{"w":"woman","e":"The woman at the next table is reading a newspaper and drinking tea.","t":"邻桌那位**女子**正在看报，喝着茶。"},
51277:{"w":"line","e":"The children stood in a line outside the classroom door.","t":"孩子们在教室门外站成一**排**。"},
51278:{"w":"exercise","e":"Doing exercise every morning helps me wake up and feel full of energy.","t":"每天早晨**锻炼**能让我清醒过来，精力充沛。"},
51279:{"w":"improve","e":"I read English stories every day to improve my reading skills.","t":"我每天读英语故事来**提高**阅读能力。"},
51280:{"w":"absent","e":"Why were you absent from my birthday party yesterday?","t":"你昨天怎么**没来**参加我的生日派对呢？"},
51281:{"w":"own","e":"Every student should do their own homework instead of copying from others.","t":"每个学生都应该做**自己的**作业，而不是抄别人的。"},
51282:{"w":"p.m.","e":"The shop closes at 5 p.m. every day, so come before then.","t":"这家商店每天**下午**5点关门，所以请在那之前来。"},
51283:{"w":"spend","e":"We spent the whole afternoon at the beach and went home tired but happy.","t":"我们在海滩上**度过**了整个下午，回家时又累又开心。"},
51284:{"w":"actor","e":"My uncle is a famous actor, and he often appears on television.","t":"我叔叔是一位著名的**演员**，经常出现在电视上。"},
51285:{"w":"actress","e":"The actress smiled and waved to the crowd outside the theatre.","t":"那位**女演员**朝剧院外的人群微笑并挥手。"},
51286:{"w":"sense","e":"She had a strange sense that someone was watching her.","t":"她有种奇怪的**感觉**，好像有人在看着她。"},
51287:{"w":"so","e":"It was raining hard, so we stayed at home and played cards.","t":"雨下得很大，**所以**我们待在家里打牌。"},
51288:{"w":"loss","e":"The loss of his job made life very difficult for the whole family.","t":"**失去**工作让全家人的生活变得很艰难。"},
51289:{"w":"lost","e":"We were lost in the forest, and it was getting dark.","t":"我们在森林里**迷了路**，天也快黑了。"},
51290:{"w":"according to","e":"According to the weather report, it will rain tomorrow.","t":"**根据**天气预报，明天会下雨。"},
51291:{"w":"suppose","e":"I suppose he is late because of the heavy rain.","t":"我**猜**他迟到是因为雨太大。"},
51292:{"w":"where","e":"Where did you leave your bike when you came to school this morning?","t":"今天早上你来学校时，把自行车停在**哪里**了？"},
51293:{"w":"oneself","e":"It is important to be kind to others and to oneself.","t":"善待他人，也要善待**自己**。"},
51294:{"w":"slice","e":"I brought you a slice of pizza.","t":"我给你带了**一块**比萨。"},
51295:{"w":"amount","e":"A large amount of rain fell last night, and the river rose quickly.","t":"昨晚下了**大量**的雨，河水涨得很快。"},
51296:{"w":"sail","e":"The ship will sail for Shanghai at noon.","t":"这艘船中午**开航**驶往上海。"},
51297:{"w":"guidebook","e":"Before our trip to Beijing, we bought a guidebook to find good places to visit.","t":"去北京旅行前，我们买了一本**旅行指南**，好找些值得参观的地方。"},
51298:{"w":"owner","e":"The owner of the lost dog offered a reward to anyone who could find it.","t":"走失小狗的**主人**表示，谁能找到它就给谁报酬。"},
51299:{"w":"specially","e":"This cake was made specially for my grandmother's birthday.","t":"这个蛋糕是**专门**为奶奶的生日做的。"},
51300:{"w":"queue","e":"There was a long queue outside the cinema because everyone wanted to see the new film.","t":"电影院外排起了**长队**，因为大家都想看这部新电影。"},
51301:{"w":"equipment","e":"Last week we talked about buying camping equipment.","t":"上周我们讨论了有关购买露营**装备**的事情。"},
51302:{"w":"waste","e":"Don't waste water, because many places in the world do not have enough.","t":"不要**浪费**水，因为世界上很多地方都缺水。"},
51303:{"w":"desert","e":"Camels can cross the desert without drinking for many days.","t":"骆驼可以很多天不喝水，穿越**沙漠**。"},
51304:{"w":"programme","e":"They had a meeting to set up the programme.","t":"他们开会启动了**项目**。"},
51305:{"w":"alarm","e":"My alarm rang at six, but I turned it off and went back to sleep.","t":"我的**闹钟**六点响了，可我关掉它又睡着了。"},
51306:{"w":"down","e":"Please sit down and open your books to page ten.","t":"请**坐下**，把书翻到第十页。"},
51307:{"w":"love","e":"Their love for each other grew stronger over the years.","t":"多年来，他们对彼此的**爱**越来越深。"},
51308:{"w":"library","e":"I borrow two books from the school library every week.","t":"我每周从学校**图书馆**借两本书。"},
51309:{"w":"twice","e":"I have been to Beijing twice, and I want to go again.","t":"我去过北京**两次**，还想再去。"},
51310:{"w":"star","e":"We lay on the grass and counted the stars in the night sky.","t":"我们躺在草地上，数着夜空中的**星星**。"},
51311:{"w":"danger","e":"The sign warns people about the danger of swimming in the river.","t":"这块牌子提醒人们在河里游泳的**危险**。"},
51312:{"w":"succeed","e":"If you work hard, you will succeed in the end.","t":"只要你努力，最终会**成功**的。"},
51313:{"w":"blackboard","e":"The teacher wrote the new words on the blackboard in big letters.","t":"老师把新单词用大字写在**黑板**上。"},
51314:{"w":"avoid","e":"We left early to avoid the heavy traffic on the way to the airport.","t":"我们早早出发，以**避开**去机场路上的交通高峰。"},
51315:{"w":"subject","e":"Which subject do you like best, English or science?","t":"你最喜欢哪门**学科**，英语还是科学？"},
51316:{"w":"tape","e":"She used some tape to fix the torn page of her book.","t":"她用一些**胶带**把书上撕破的那页粘好。"},
51317:{"w":"about","e":"This book is about a boy who lives on a small island.","t":"这本书是**关于**一个住在小岛上的男孩的。"},
51318:{"w":"narrow","e":"The path up the mountain is so narrow that only one person can pass.","t":"上山的小路非常**狭窄**，一次只能过一个人。"},
51319:{"w":"month","e":"We will go to Shanghai next month to visit my uncle.","t":"我们下个**月**要去上海看望叔叔。"},
51320:{"w":"remain","e":"Please remain seated until the plane has come to a complete stop.","t":"飞机完全停稳之前，请大家**保持**坐姿。"},
51321:{"w":"wound","e":"The soldier had a deep wound in his arm, so he was taken to hospital.","t":"那名士兵手臂上有一处很深的**伤口**，被送进了医院。"},
51322:{"w":"advice","e":"I was told to come here for advice about math courses.","t":"有人告诉我到这里来咨询一些关于数学课程的**建议**。"},
51323:{"w":"rabbit","e":"The rabbit ate a carrot and then ran back into its hole.","t":"**兔子**吃了一根胡萝卜，然后跑回了洞里。"},
51324:{"w":"know","e":"Do you know the girl who is talking to our English teacher?","t":"你**认识**正在和我们英语老师说话的那个女孩吗？"},
51325:{"w":"arm","e":"He broke his arm when he fell off the bike.","t":"他从自行车上摔下来，摔断了**手臂**。"},
51326:{"w":"quick","e":"Let's take a quick walk in the park before dinner.","t":"晚饭前我们去公园**短暂**散个步吧。"},
51327:{"w":"care","e":"Doctors and nurses care about every patient in this hospital.","t":"这家医院里的医生和护士**关心**每一位病人。"},
51328:{"w":"budget","e":"We have a small budget, so we cannot buy a new car.","t":"我们**预算**不多，所以买不起新车。"},
51329:{"w":"guest","e":"Every guest at the wedding received a small gift.","t":"婚礼上的每位**客人**都收到了一份小礼物。"},
51330:{"w":"dog","e":"Our dog barks loudly whenever a stranger comes to the door.","t":"每当陌生人来到门口，我们的**狗**就大声吠叫。"},
51331:{"w":"silk","e":"She wore a beautiful silk dress to her cousin's wedding.","t":"她穿着一件漂亮的**丝绸**连衣裙去参加表姐的婚礼。"},
51332:{"w":"band","e":"The drum band will be appearing on stage in the next show.","t":"下一个节目将是鼓**乐队**表演。"},
51333:{"w":"produce","e":"This factory produces about ten thousand cars every year.","t":"这家工厂每年**生产**大约一万辆汽车。"},
51334:{"w":"champion","e":"She trained hard for years and finally became the national swimming champion.","t":"她刻苦训练多年，终于成了全国游泳**冠军**。"},
51335:{"w":"local","e":"We had lunch at a small local restaurant near the old town square.","t":"我们在老城广场附近一家小小的**本地**餐馆吃了午饭。"},
51336:{"w":"her","e":"I called her last night, but she did not answer the phone.","t":"我昨晚给**她**打了电话，但她没接。"},
51337:{"w":"probably","e":"It will probably rain this afternoon, so take an umbrella with you.","t":"今天下午**很可能**会下雨，所以带把伞吧。"},
51338:{"w":"river","e":"We walked along the river and watched the boats go by.","t":"我们沿着**河**边散步，看船只驶过。"},
51339:{"w":"group","e":"Our class is divided into five groups for the science project.","t":"为了做科学项目，我们班被分成五个**组**。"},
51340:{"w":"up","e":"The children looked up and saw a bright rainbow in the sky.","t":"孩子们**向上**看，发现天空中有一道明亮的彩虹。"},
51341:{"w":"member","e":"Every member of the school band must come to practice on Friday.","t":"校乐队的每一位**成员**周五都必须来参加排练。"},
51342:{"w":"especially","e":"I love fruit, especially oranges and strawberries.","t":"我喜欢水果，**尤其**是橙子和草莓。"},
51343:{"w":"material","e":"Glass is the great building material of the future.","t":"玻璃是未来重要的建筑**材料**。"},
51344:{"w":"speech","e":"The principal gave a short speech at the opening of the new library.","t":"校长在新图书馆的开馆仪式上发表了简短的**演讲**。"},
51345:{"w":"classic","e":"The film is a classic love story that people still enjoy today.","t":"这部电影是一个**经典**的爱情故事，人们至今仍然喜爱。"},
51346:{"w":"cross","e":"Always look both ways before you cross the road.","t":"**穿过**马路之前，一定要先看看两边。"},
51347:{"w":"thank","e":"I want to thank you for helping me with my English.","t":"我想**感谢**你帮助我学英语。"},
51348:{"w":"army","e":"The army marched across the bridge early in the morning.","t":"**军队**一大早就列队走过了那座桥。"},
51349:{"w":"coast","e":"We drove along the coast and stopped at a small fishing village.","t":"我们沿着**海岸**开车，在一个小渔村停了下来。"},
51350:{"w":"litter","e":"Please do not litter in the park; use the bins instead.","t":"请不要在公园里**乱丢杂物**，要用垃圾桶。"},
51351:{"w":"yesterday","e":"Yesterday I met my old friend on the way to school.","t":"**昨天**我在上学的路上遇到了老朋友。"},
51352:{"w":"guy","e":"The guy who sits next to me in class is really funny and friendly.","t":"班上坐我旁边的那个**家伙**又风趣又友善。"},
51353:{"w":"flee","e":"When the fire spread, everyone fled from the building in a panic.","t":"大火蔓延时，所有人都惊慌地**逃离**了大楼。"},
51354:{"w":"restroom","e":"Excuse me, could you tell me where the restroom is?","t":"打扰一下，请问**洗手间**在哪里？"},
51355:{"w":"supper","e":"We had fish and rice for supper after my father came home.","t":"爸爸回家后，我们**晚餐**吃了鱼和米饭。"},
51356:{"w":"outstanding","e":"She was given a prize for her outstanding work in helping poor children.","t":"她因在帮助贫困儿童方面的**杰出**工作而获奖。"},
51357:{"w":"specific","e":"Please give me a specific time and place for the meeting.","t":"请告诉我会议**明确的**时间和地点。"},
51358:{"w":"distance","e":"The distance between my home and the school is about two kilometres.","t":"我家和学校之间的**距离**大约有两公里。"},
51359:{"w":"servant","e":"The rich family had three servants who cooked, cleaned and drove the car.","t":"这个富裕的家庭有三个**仆人**，负责做饭、打扫和开车。"},
51360:{"w":"immediately","e":"Please call me immediately if you have any trouble with the new computer.","t":"如果你在使用新电脑时遇到任何麻烦，请**立即**给我打电话。"},
51361:{"w":"phrase","e":"The teacher asked us to write a sentence with the phrase \"take care of\".","t":"老师要我们用\"take care of\"这个**短语**造句。"},
51362:{"w":"latest","e":"Have you seen the latest film about the space journey?","t":"你看过那部关于太空旅行的**最新**电影吗？"},
51363:{"w":"string","e":"She tied the box with a piece of red string and wrote her friend's name on it.","t":"她用一根红色的**细绳**把盒子捆好，在上面写上了朋友的名字。"},
51364:{"w":"emotion","e":"She could not hide her emotion when she saw her old friend.","t":"看到老朋友时，她无法掩饰自己的**情感**。"},
51365:{"w":"extra","e":"Please bring some extra paper to the exam in case you need more.","t":"请带些**额外**的纸去考场，以防不够用。"},
51366:{"w":"wet","e":"Don't sit on the grass, because it is still wet after the rain.","t":"别坐在草地上，雨后那里还是**湿**的。"},
51367:{"w":"suit","e":"That blue dress really suits you, and it matches your eyes.","t":"那条蓝裙子真**适合**你，和你的眼睛也很相配。"},
51368:{"w":"bank","e":"I keep my pocket money in the bank near our school.","t":"我把零花钱存在学校附近的**银行**里。"},
51369:{"w":"dinner","e":"We usually have dinner at half past six in the evening.","t":"我们通常晚上六点半吃**晚餐**。"},
51370:{"w":"fly","e":"Birds fly south in winter to find warmer weather.","t":"鸟儿冬天**飞**往南方，寻找更暖和的天气。"},
51371:{"w":"travel","e":"I would love to travel around the world after I finish university.","t":"大学毕业后，我很想去世界各地**旅行**。"},
51372:{"w":"flood","e":"The heavy rain caused a flood that cut off several villages for days.","t":"大雨引发了**洪水**，几个村子好几天与外界隔绝。"},
51373:{"w":"because","e":"We stayed at home all day because it was raining heavily outside.","t":"**因为**外面下着大雨，我们一整天都待在家里。"},
51374:{"w":"behind","e":"The cat is hiding behind the sofa, and nobody can find it.","t":"猫躲在沙发**后面**，没人能找到它。"},
51375:{"w":"false","e":"The news turned out to be false, and everyone felt relieved.","t":"这个消息最后证明是**假的**，大家都松了一口气。"},
51376:{"w":"calm","e":"Stay calm and walk slowly to the exit when the alarm sounds.","t":"警报响起时，要保持**镇静**，慢慢走向出口。"},
51377:{"w":"young","e":"The young girl sang a song in front of the whole class.","t":"那个**年幼**的女孩在全班同学面前唱了一首歌。"},
51378:{"w":"snack","e":"The sandwich shop for quick snacks is nearby.","t":"出售**快餐**的三明治店离这很近。"},
51379:{"w":"friendship","e":"Their friendship began when they sat next to each other in primary school.","t":"他们的**友谊**始于小学时坐在彼此旁边。"},
51380:{"w":"couple","e":"The young couple bought a small house near the school last year.","t":"这对年轻**夫妇**去年在学校附近买了一栋小房子。"},
51381:{"w":"symbol","e":"The red heart is a symbol of love in many countries.","t":"红心在许多国家都是爱的**象征**。"},
51382:{"w":"paragraph","e":"Read the first paragraph of the story and tell me what the main idea is.","t":"读一读故事的第一个**段落**，告诉我它的大意。"},
51383:{"w":"receive","e":"I received a letter from my pen friend in Canada this morning.","t":"今天早上我**收到**了加拿大笔友的一封信。"},
51384:{"w":"plate","e":"She put a piece of cake on a small plate for her son.","t":"她把一块蛋糕放在一只小**盘子**里，给儿子吃。"},
51385:{"w":"walk","e":"I walk to school with my best friend every morning.","t":"我每天早上和最好的朋友**步行**去上学。"},
51386:{"w":"zero","e":"The temperature fell to zero last night, and the lake froze.","t":"昨晚气温降到了**零度**，湖面结冰了。"},
51387:{"w":"hen","e":"Our hen lays an egg almost every morning in the box behind the house.","t":"我们家的**母鸡**几乎每天早上都在屋后的箱子里下一个蛋。"},
51388:{"w":"ear","e":"The little girl whispered a secret in her mother's ear.","t":"小女孩在妈妈的**耳**边小声说了一个秘密。"},
51389:{"w":"machine","e":"This machine can wash and dry our clothes in one hour.","t":"这台**机器**能在一小时内把我们的衣服洗好烘干。"},
51390:{"w":"wait","e":"We had to wait for half an hour before the doctor could see us.","t":"我们得**等**半小时，医生才能给我们看病。"},
51391:{"w":"laugh","e":"Everyone began to laugh when the clown fell off his tiny bike.","t":"小丑从他的小自行车上摔下来时，大家都**笑**了起来。"},
51392:{"w":"maths","e":"Our maths teacher gives us a short test every Friday.","t":"我们的**数学**老师每周五都给我们一次小测验。"},
51393:{"w":"recognise","e":"I had not seen her for ten years, but I recognised her as soon as she smiled.","t":"我十年没见过她了，但她一笑我就**认出**了她。"},
51394:{"w":"eat","e":"We eat breakfast together at seven o'clock every morning.","t":"我们每天早上七点一起**吃**早饭。"},
51395:{"w":"tofu","e":"Tofu is made from soybeans and is popular in China.","t":"**豆腐**是用大豆做成的，在中国很受欢迎。"},
51396:{"w":"asleep","e":"The baby was fast asleep in her mother's arms.","t":"婴儿在妈妈怀里**熟睡**着。"},
51397:{"w":"private","e":"May I ask you a private question?","t":"我能问你一个**私人**问题吗？"},
51398:{"w":"translate","e":"The name of the weapon was directly translated from Chinese.","t":"这种武器的名字是从汉语直接**翻译**过来的。"},
51399:{"w":"knife","e":"Be careful when you use a sharp knife to cut the vegetables.","t":"用锋利的**刀**切蔬菜时要小心。"},
51400:{"w":"milk","e":"I drink a glass of milk every morning before school.","t":"我每天早上上学前都喝一杯**牛奶**。"},
51401:{"w":"feel","e":"I feel much better after a good night's sleep.","t":"睡了个好觉后，我**觉得**好多了。"},
51402:{"w":"rush","e":"Students rushed out of the classroom as soon as the bell rang.","t":"铃声一响，学生们就**冲**出了教室。"},
51403:{"w":"teenage","e":"My teenage brother spends hours playing computer games every weekend.","t":"我**十几岁**的哥哥每个周末都花好几个小时玩电脑游戏。"},
51404:{"w":"it","e":"I found a small cat outside, and I gave it some milk.","t":"我在外面发现一只小猫，就给**它**喝了些牛奶。"},
51405:{"w":"drop","e":"Be careful not to drop the glass on the floor.","t":"小心别让玻璃杯**掉**到地上。"},
51406:{"w":"familiar","e":"The song sounded familiar, but I could not remember its name.","t":"这首歌听起来很**熟悉**，但我想不起它的名字了。"},
51407:{"w":"post","e":"I will post the letter to my pen friend on my way to school.","t":"我上学的路上会把信**寄**给笔友。"},
51408:{"w":"ski","e":"We go to the mountains to ski every winter holiday.","t":"每个寒假我们都去山里**滑雪**。"},
51409:{"w":"such","e":"I have never seen such a beautiful sunset in my whole life.","t":"我这辈子从没见过**如此**美丽的日落。"},
51410:{"w":"egg","e":"My mother boiled two eggs for my breakfast this morning.","t":"今天早上妈妈给我煮了两个**鸡蛋**当早餐。"},
51411:{"w":"cut","e":"Please cut the cake into eight equal pieces.","t":"请把蛋糕**切**成八块一样大的小块。"},
51412:{"w":"also","e":"She is good at math and also plays the violin very well.","t":"她数学很好，**也**把小提琴拉得很好。"},
51413:{"w":"method","e":"Drawing pictures is a good method for remembering new words.","t":"画图是记忆新单词的一个好**方法**。"},
51414:{"w":"cream","e":"She put some cream on her strawberries and ate them slowly.","t":"她在草莓上加了些**奶油**，慢慢地吃了起来。"},
51415:{"w":"scene","e":"The police arrived at the scene of the accident within five minutes.","t":"警察五分钟内就赶到了事故**现场**。"},
51416:{"w":"thrill","e":"The traveller thrilled us with his stories of adventure.","t":"这位旅行者的冒险经历令我们**激动不已**。"},
51417:{"w":"jungle","e":"Many kinds of wild animals and colorful birds live deep in the jungle.","t":"许多种野生动物和色彩艳丽的鸟儿生活在**丛林**深处。"},
51418:{"w":"dismiss","e":"The teacher dismissed us five minutes early today.","t":"今天老师提前五分钟**放我们走**了。"},
51419:{"w":"plain","e":"She wore a plain white dress and no jewellery.","t":"她穿着一条**普通的**白色连衣裙，没戴任何首饰。"},
51420:{"w":"unpleasant","e":"The medicine has an unpleasant taste, so the child will not drink it.","t":"这药的味道**令人不快**，所以孩子不肯喝。"},
51421:{"w":"natural","e":"It's natural for an old man of his age to be so calm.","t":"处于他这般年纪的老人如此镇静是很**自然**的。"},
51422:{"w":"indoors","e":"It rained all day, so the children had to stay indoors.","t":"下了一整天雨，孩子们只好待在**室内**。"},
51423:{"w":"type","e":"She can type more than sixty words a minute without looking at the keys.","t":"她能不看键盘，一分钟**打字**六十多个。"},
51424:{"w":"teen","e":"Many teens like to listen to music after finishing their homework.","t":"许多**青少年**喜欢在做完作业后听音乐。"},
51425:{"w":"dessert","e":"We had ice cream for dessert after a big dinner at my grandmother's house.","t":"在奶奶家吃完一顿丰盛的晚饭后，我们吃了冰淇淋作为**餐后甜食**。"},
51426:{"w":"easily","e":"She solved the math problem easily and handed in her paper first.","t":"她**轻松**地解出了这道数学题，第一个交了卷。"},
51427:{"w":"tail","e":"The dog wagged its tail when it saw its owner come home.","t":"狗一看到主人回家就摇起了**尾巴**。"},
51428:{"w":"hum","e":"My mother likes to hum a tune while she cooks dinner.","t":"妈妈做饭时喜欢**哼**着小曲。"},
51429:{"w":"jazz","e":"My father loves jazz and often plays old records on Sunday afternoons.","t":"爸爸很喜欢**爵士乐**，常在星期天下午放老唱片。"},
51430:{"w":"display","e":"The shop window displays many beautiful toys for children.","t":"商店橱窗里**陈列**着许多漂亮的儿童玩具。"},
51431:{"w":"province","e":"My parents came from a small town in another province to work in Shanghai.","t":"我父母来自另一个**省份**的小镇，后来到上海工作。"},
51432:{"w":"peel","e":"He peeled an orange and shared it with his little sister.","t":"他**剥**了一个橙子，和妹妹分着吃。"},
51433:{"w":"emperor","e":"The emperor lived in a huge palace with hundreds of servants around him.","t":"**皇帝**住在一座巨大的宫殿里，身边有数百名仆人。"},
51434:{"w":"empress","e":"The empress ruled the country wisely for more than thirty years.","t":"这位**女皇**明智地统治了这个国家三十多年。"},
51435:{"w":"perhaps","e":"Perhaps we should leave now, or we will miss the train.","t":"**也许**我们该走了，不然会赶不上火车。"},
51436:{"w":"huge","e":"A huge tree fell across the road after the storm last night.","t":"昨晚暴风雨后，一棵**巨大**的树倒在了路上。"},
51437:{"w":"degree","e":"The temperature dropped by ten degrees overnight, so we wore thick coats.","t":"夜里气温下降了十**度**，所以我们穿上了厚外套。"},
51438:{"w":"lie","e":"I like to lie on the grass and watch the clouds.","t":"我喜欢**躺**在草地上看云。"},
51439:{"w":"body","e":"Doing exercise regularly is good for both your body and your mind.","t":"经常锻炼对你的**身体**和心灵都有好处。"},
51440:{"w":"shoulder","e":"She carried a heavy bag on her shoulder all the way home.","t":"她把一个沉重的包扛在**肩**上，一路走回家。"},
51441:{"w":"hit","e":"The ball hit the window and the glass broke.","t":"球**撞到**了窗户，玻璃碎了。"},
51442:{"w":"hand","e":"Please raise your hand if you know the answer.","t":"如果你知道答案，请举**手**。"},
51443:{"w":"bat","e":"At night, bats fly out of the cave to look for insects to eat.","t":"夜里，**蝙蝠**飞出洞穴寻找昆虫吃。"},
51444:{"w":"organise","e":"Our class organised a trip to the mountains to celebrate the end of the exams.","t":"为庆祝考试结束，我们班**组织**了一次山区旅行。"},
51445:{"w":"stay","e":"We decided to stay at home because it rained heavily all afternoon.","t":"因为整个下午都下大雨，我们决定**留**在家里。"},
51446:{"w":"brother","e":"He treats his best friend like a brother.","t":"他把最好的朋友当作**兄弟**。"},
51447:{"w":"law","e":"Everyone in the country must obey the law, no matter how rich or famous they are.","t":"这个国家里的每个人，无论多么富有或出名，都必须遵守**法律**。"},
51448:{"w":"lawyer","e":"My aunt is a lawyer, and she works in a big city.","t":"我姨妈是一名**律师**，在一座大城市工作。"},
51449:{"w":"son","e":"Their son is learning to play the piano at school.","t":"他们的**儿子**正在学校学弹钢琴。"},
51450:{"w":"comfortable","e":"This sofa is so comfortable that I fell asleep on it after lunch.","t":"这张沙发太**舒服**了，午饭后我在上面睡着了。"},
51451:{"w":"hardly","e":"I could hardly hear the teacher because the students behind me were so noisy.","t":"我**几乎**听不见老师讲话，因为身后的学生太吵了。"},
51452:{"w":"store","e":"There is a small store at the corner that sells fresh bread.","t":"拐角处有一家卖新鲜面包的小**商店**。"},
51453:{"w":"noise","e":"The children made so much noise that I could not sleep.","t":"孩子们发出那么大的**噪音**，我根本睡不着。"},
51454:{"w":"fire","e":"We sat around the fire and sang songs until it was very late.","t":"我们围坐在**火**堆旁唱歌，直到很晚。"},
51455:{"w":"firework","e":"We watched the fireworks over the river on New Year's Eve.","t":"新年前夜，我们观看了河上的**烟花**。"},
51456:{"w":"drive","e":"My father drives me to school when it rains.","t":"下雨时，爸爸**开车**送我去学校。"},
51457:{"w":"stamp","e":"I bought some stamps at the post office and sent the letter to my aunt.","t":"我在邮局买了几张**邮票**，把信寄给了姑姑。"},
51458:{"w":"medal","e":"She proudly showed us the medal she won in the school swimming race.","t":"她自豪地给我们看她在学校游泳比赛中赢得的**奖牌**。"},
51459:{"w":"neighbour","e":"Our neighbour helped us carry the heavy box upstairs.","t":"我们的**邻居**帮我们把那个重箱子搬上了楼。"},
51460:{"w":"remember","e":"Do you remember the name of the girl we met at the party?","t":"你还**记得**我们在聚会上遇到的那个女孩的名字吗？"},
51461:{"w":"smart","e":"My sister is so smart that she could read at four.","t":"我妹妹**聪明**极了，四岁就会读书。"},
51462:{"w":"leg","e":"The little dog hurt its leg, so it could not run fast.","t":"那只小狗伤了**腿**，所以跑不快。"},
51463:{"w":"hello","e":"Hello, may I speak to Tom? This is his classmate Lily.","t":"**你好**，请问汤姆在吗？我是他的同学莉莉。"},
51464:{"w":"forever","e":"I will remember this wonderful summer forever.","t":"我会**永远**记住这个美好的夏天。"},
51465:{"w":"worry","e":"Don't worry about the exam, because you have studied very hard.","t":"别**担心**考试，因为你已经很努力地学习了。"},
51466:{"w":"bear","e":"I cannot bear the noise from the street any longer.","t":"我再也无法**忍受**街上的噪音了。"},
51467:{"w":"joy","e":"Her face filled with joy when she heard that she had won the prize.","t":"听说自己得了奖，她脸上充满了**喜悦**。"},
51468:{"w":"ton","e":"The truck can carry up to ten tons of rice at one time.","t":"这辆卡车一次最多能运十**吨**大米。"},
51469:{"w":"wealth","e":"He gained great wealth by running a small online shop for ten years.","t":"他经营一家小网店十年，积累了大量**财富**。"},
51470:{"w":"direct","e":"There is a direct train from Shanghai to Nanjing every hour.","t":"每小时都有一趟从上海到南京的**直达**火车。"},
51471:{"w":"class","e":"There are forty students in my class, and half of them are girls.","t":"我们**班**有四十名学生，其中一半是女生。"},
51472:{"w":"agree","e":"My parents agreed to let me go on the school trip.","t":"父母**同意**让我参加学校的旅行。"},
51473:{"w":"tiger","e":"The tiger is a strong and dangerous animal that lives in forests.","t":"**老虎**是生活在森林里的强壮而危险的动物。"},
51474:{"w":"life","e":"Life in the countryside is quiet, and the air is fresh.","t":"乡村**生活**很安静，空气也很清新。"},
51475:{"w":"dream","e":"I often dream about flying over the mountains and the sea.","t":"我常常**梦见**自己飞越群山和大海。"},
51476:{"w":"amazing","e":"The view from the top of the mountain was absolutely amazing.","t":"山顶上的景色美得**令人惊异**。"},
51477:{"w":"set","e":"She set the table for dinner while her brother cooked the rice.","t":"她**摆**好餐桌准备吃晚饭，弟弟则在煮饭。"},
51478:{"w":"television","e":"My grandfather watches the news on television every evening.","t":"我爷爷每天晚上看**电视**新闻。"},
51479:{"w":"tent","e":"We put up a tent by the lake and slept there for two nights.","t":"我们在湖边搭了一顶**帐篷**，在那里睡了两晚。"},
51480:{"w":"staff","e":"All the staff in this hotel are friendly and ready to help.","t":"这家酒店的全体**员工**都很友好，乐于助人。"},
51481:{"w":"dull","e":"We all think his tutorial topic is dull.","t":"我们都认为他的辅导主题令人**乏味**。"},
51482:{"w":"metal","e":"Iron is a hard metal that is used to make many tools.","t":"铁是一种坚硬的**金属**，可用来制造许多工具。"},
51483:{"w":"pretend","e":"Many people pretend that they understand modern art.","t":"很多人都**假装**自己懂得现代艺术。"},
51484:{"w":"tag","e":"Before you buy the jacket, check the price on the tag inside the collar.","t":"买这件夹克之前，先看看领子里**标签**上的价格。"},
51485:{"w":"homeless","e":"The city built a shelter to help homeless people in winter.","t":"这座城市建了一处收容所，帮助冬天**无家可归**的人。"},
51486:{"w":"rat","e":"We found a big rat in the kitchen and called someone to catch it.","t":"我们在厨房里发现了一只大**老鼠**，就找人来抓它。"},
51487:{"w":"particular","e":"Is there any particular reason why you chose to study French?","t":"你选择学法语有什么**特殊**原因吗？"},
51488:{"w":"raincoat","e":"Take your raincoat with you, because it may rain this afternoon.","t":"带上你的**雨衣**，今天下午可能会下雨。"},
51489:{"w":"edge","e":"Don't put the cup on the edge of the table.","t":"别把杯子放在桌子**边缘**。"},
51490:{"w":"relation","e":"The relation between students and teachers is generally good in this university.","t":"这所大学里师生间的**关系**总体来说很好。"},
51491:{"w":"yin","e":"In Chinese thought, yin and yang are two forces that work together.","t":"在中国思想中，**阴**与阳是共同起作用的两种力量。"},
51492:{"w":"authority","e":"Only the local authorities have the power to close the school during bad weather.","t":"只有当地**当局**有权在恶劣天气时关闭学校。"},
51493:{"w":"sausage","e":"For breakfast I had two eggs, a sausage and a glass of milk.","t":"早餐我吃了两个鸡蛋、一根**香肠**，喝了一杯牛奶。"},
51494:{"w":"humour","e":"Our English teacher has a good sense of humour and often makes the whole class laugh.","t":"我们的英语老师很有**幽默**感，常常逗得全班哈哈大笑。"},
51495:{"w":"helpful","e":"Thank you for your advice; it was really helpful when I was looking for a job.","t":"谢谢你的建议，我找工作时它真的很**有用**。"},
51496:{"w":"general","e":"The general opinion is that the new rule is a good one.","t":"**普遍的**看法是，这条新规定很好。"},
51497:{"w":"little","e":"There is little water left in the bottle.","t":"瓶子里只剩**很少**的水了。"},
51498:{"w":"hospital","e":"My dad took me to the hospital after I fell off my bike.","t":"我从自行车上摔下来后，爸爸带我去了**医院**。"},
51499:{"w":"throat","e":"I drank some warm water because my throat hurt this morning.","t":"今天早上我**喉咙**疼，就喝了些温水。"},
51500:{"w":"pity","e":"She felt great pity for the lost dog and took it home.","t":"她对那只走失的狗十分**同情**，就把它带回了家。"},
51501:{"w":"cool","e":"The air feels cool when we sit under this big tree.","t":"坐在这棵大树下，我们觉得空气很**凉爽**。"},
51502:{"w":"problem","e":"We have a problem because the door will not open.","t":"门打不开，我们遇到了一个**问题**。"},
51503:{"w":"apartment","e":"They live in a small apartment on the tenth floor of an old building.","t":"他们住在一栋旧楼十层的一套小**公寓**里。"},
51504:{"w":"person","e":"Only one person in our group knows how to make bread.","t":"我们组只有一个**人**会做面包。"},
51505:{"w":"virus","e":"Wash your hands often, because a cold virus can live on door handles for hours.","t":"要勤洗手，因为感冒**病毒**能在门把手上存活好几个小时。"},
51506:{"w":"aloud","e":"Our teacher asked me to read the poem aloud in front of the class.","t":"老师让我在全班面前**大声**朗读这首诗。"},
51507:{"w":"sleep","e":"I usually sleep for eight hours a night.","t":"我通常每晚**睡**八个小时。"},
51508:{"w":"dollar","e":"This pen costs only one dollar at the shop near school.","t":"这支笔在学校附近的商店只卖一**美元**。"},
51509:{"w":"support","e":"My parents have always supported my dream of becoming a doctor, even when it seemed hard.","t":"我父母一直**支持**我当医生的梦想，即使在看起来很难的时候。"},
51510:{"w":"wife","e":"My uncle and his wife live in a small village.","t":"我叔叔和他的**妻子**住在一个小村子里。"},
51511:{"w":"characteristic","e":"Long ears are a characteristic of many kinds of rabbits.","t":"耳朵长是许多种兔子的一个**特点**。"},
51512:{"w":"pretty","e":"The garden is full of pretty flowers in spring.","t":"春天花园里开满了**漂亮的**花。"},
51513:{"w":"sick","e":"She stayed at home yesterday because she felt sick and had a headache.","t":"她昨天待在家里，因为她觉得**不舒服**，还头疼。"},
51514:{"w":"fail","e":"If you fail the test, you can take it again next week.","t":"如果你这次考试**不及格**，下周还能再考。"},
51515:{"w":"lamp","e":"She switched on the lamp beside her bed and began to read.","t":"她打开床边的**灯**，开始读书。"},
51516:{"w":"silver","e":"My grandmother wears a ring made of silver on her left hand.","t":"我奶奶左手戴着一枚**银**戒指。"},
51517:{"w":"wood","e":"The old table in our kitchen is made of wood.","t":"我们厨房里的那张旧桌子是用**木头**做的。"},
51518:{"w":"cost","e":"The new phone cost me nearly two months of pocket money.","t":"这部新手机**花**了我将近两个月的零花钱。"},
51519:{"w":"argue","e":"My brother and I often argue about which TV programme to watch.","t":"我和哥哥常常为看哪个电视节目而**争吵**。"},
51520:{"w":"influence","e":"Good friends can influence the way we think and act.","t":"好朋友能**影响**我们思考和做事的方式。"},
51521:{"w":"Internet","e":"We use the Internet to find information for our school project.","t":"我们用**互联网**为学校布置的项目查资料。"},
51522:{"w":"chocolate","e":"I shared a bar of chocolate with my brother after lunch.","t":"午饭后，我和弟弟分吃了一块**巧克力**。"},
51523:{"w":"market","e":"My mother goes to the market every morning to buy fresh fruit and vegetables.","t":"我妈妈每天早上去**市场**买新鲜的水果和蔬菜。"},
51524:{"w":"kitchen","e":"My sister is making a cake in the kitchen this afternoon.","t":"今天下午，我姐姐在**厨房**做蛋糕。"},
51525:{"w":"state","e":"The house was in a poor state after years without repair.","t":"这房子多年没有修缮，**状态**很差。"},
51526:{"w":"task","e":"Our teacher gave us the task of writing a short story about our school.","t":"老师给我们布置了写一篇关于学校的短篇故事的**任务**。"},
51527:{"w":"cook","e":"My dad can cook a delicious meal with just a few things.","t":"我爸爸只用几样食材就能**做**出一顿美味的饭。"},
51528:{"w":"while","e":"My sister was cooking dinner while I was doing my homework.","t":"我写作业的**时候**，姐姐在做晚饭。"},
51529:{"w":"account","e":"I opened a bank account so that I could save my pocket money.","t":"我开了一个银行**账户**，好把零花钱存起来。"},
51530:{"w":"bring","e":"Please bring your homework to school tomorrow.","t":"明天请把你的作业**带**到学校来。"},
51531:{"w":"nurse","e":"The nurse helped me when I felt ill at school.","t":"我在学校不舒服时，是**护士**帮助了我。"},
51532:{"w":"stop","e":"The rain stopped, and we went out to play.","t":"雨**停**了，我们出去玩了。"},
51533:{"w":"father","e":"My father walks to work with our neighbour every morning.","t":"我**爸爸**每天早上都和邻居一起走路去上班。"},
51534:{"w":"very","e":"This is a very useful book for learning English.","t":"这是一本对学英语**非常**有用的书。"},
51535:{"w":"buy","e":"I went to the shop to buy milk for tomorrow's breakfast.","t":"我去商店**买**了明天早餐喝的牛奶。"},
51536:{"w":"something","e":"There is something in my shoe, and it hurts my foot.","t":"我的鞋里有**东西**，硌得我脚疼。"},
51537:{"w":"already","e":"I have already finished my homework, so I can watch TV now.","t":"我**已经**做完作业了，所以现在可以看电视。"},
51538:{"w":"potato","e":"We need three potatoes to make enough soup for everyone.","t":"我们需要三个**土豆**，这样煮出来的汤才够大家喝。"},
51539:{"w":"candy","e":"The children were given some candy after they finished cleaning the classroom.","t":"孩子们打扫完教室后，每人得到了一些**糖果**。"},
51540:{"w":"price","e":"The price of this coat is much lower than last week.","t":"这件外套的**价格**比上周低多了。"},
51541:{"w":"arrive","e":"The train will arrive at the station in ten minutes.","t":"火车十分钟后将**到达**车站。"},
51542:{"w":"war","e":"The war lasted for six years and changed the lives of millions of people.","t":"这场**战争**持续了六年，改变了数百万人的生活。"},
51543:{"w":"email","e":"I sent an email to my teacher to ask for help.","t":"我给老师发了一封**电子邮件**，向老师求助。"},
51544:{"w":"root","e":"The roots of this tree have grown under the garden wall.","t":"这棵树的**根**已经长到了花园围墙下面。"},
51545:{"w":"parrot","e":"The green parrot says hello whenever someone walks into the room.","t":"每当有人走进房间，那只绿色的**鹦鹉**就会打招呼。"},
51546:{"w":"drum","e":"My brother practices the drums in his room for an hour every evening.","t":"我弟弟每天晚上在房间里练一小时**架子鼓**。"},
51547:{"w":"pierce","e":"A sharp stone pierced my shoe as I crossed the river.","t":"我过河时，一块尖石头**刺穿**了我的鞋。"},
51548:{"w":"western","e":"She comes from the western part of the country, near the mountains.","t":"她来自这个国家的**西部**，靠近群山。"},
51549:{"w":"offend","e":"I didn't mean to offend you; I was only trying to give you some honest advice.","t":"我不是有意**冒犯**你，只是想给你一些诚恳的建议。"},
51550:{"w":"mystery","e":"It is still a mystery how the old ship disappeared.","t":"那艘旧船是怎么消失的，至今仍是个**谜**。"},
51551:{"w":"exchange","e":"Are you one of the exchange students?","t":"你是**交换**生之一吗？"},
51552:{"w":"beard","e":"My grandfather has a long white beard and looks like Father Christmas.","t":"我爷爷留着长长的白**胡子**，看起来像圣诞老人。"},
51553:{"w":"overseas","e":"My sister wants to study overseas after she finishes high school.","t":"我姐姐想在高中毕业后去**国外**读书。"},
51554:{"w":"beyond","e":"The small village lies beyond the mountains, about two hours from the city by car.","t":"那个小村庄在山的**那边**，离城市大约两小时车程。"},
51555:{"w":"confidence","e":"Winning the speech contest gave her the confidence to speak in front of large groups.","t":"赢得演讲比赛让她有了在众人面前讲话的**信心**。"},
51556:{"w":"imagine","e":"Can you imagine living on the moon, far away from everyone you know?","t":"你能**想象**住在月球上，远离所有你认识的人吗？"},
51557:{"w":"umbrella","e":"Don't forget to take an umbrella with you, because it may rain this afternoon.","t":"别忘了带把**雨伞**，今天下午可能会下雨。"},
51558:{"w":"fall","e":"The leaves begin to fall from the trees in October.","t":"十月，树叶开始从树上**落下**。"},
51559:{"w":"communicate","e":"We use our phones to communicate with friends far away.","t":"我们用手机和远方的朋友**联系**。"},
51560:{"w":"house","e":"Our house has a small garden where we grow flowers.","t":"我们的**房子**有个小花园，我们在那里种花。"},
51561:{"w":"chess","e":"I play chess with my grandfather every Sunday after lunch.","t":"我每周日午饭后都和爷爷下**国际象棋**。"},
51562:{"w":"salt","e":"Could you add a little salt to the soup, please?","t":"请你往汤里加一点**盐**，好吗？"},
51563:{"w":"head","e":"You should always wear a helmet to protect your head when cycling.","t":"骑自行车时，你应该始终戴头盔保护**头部**。"},
51564:{"w":"ahead","e":"Go straight ahead and you will see the bank on your left.","t":"一直**向前**走，你就会看到银行在你左边。"},
51565:{"w":"less","e":"I put less sugar in my tea than my sister does.","t":"我往茶里放的糖比姐姐放的**少**。"},
51566:{"w":"award","e":"She won an award for her excellent work in helping poor children.","t":"她因帮助贫困儿童的出色工作而获得了一个**奖项**。"},
51567:{"w":"pioneer","e":"She was a pioneer in teaching children to use computers.","t":"她是教孩子使用电脑的**先锋**。"},
51568:{"w":"balloon","e":"We filled the room with colorful balloons for my sister's tenth birthday party.","t":"我们用五颜六色的**气球**布置房间，给妹妹过十岁生日。"},
51569:{"w":"traffic","e":"There was so much traffic this morning that I was late for school.","t":"今天早上**交通**太拥挤，我上学迟到了。"},
51570:{"w":"cancel","e":"We had to cancel the picnic because of the heavy rain.","t":"因为下大雨，我们不得不**取消**了野餐。"},
51571:{"w":"forward","e":"The car moved slowly forward until it reached the red light.","t":"汽车缓缓**向前**行驶，直到红灯前。"},
51572:{"w":"oil","e":"Dad put some oil in the pan before adding the eggs.","t":"爸爸先往锅里倒了点**油**，然后打入鸡蛋。"},
51573:{"w":"themselves","e":"The children made the birthday cake themselves while we watched.","t":"孩子们**自己**做了生日蛋糕，我们在一旁看着。"},
51574:{"w":"village","e":"My grandparents live in a small village next to a river.","t":"我的祖父母住在河边的一个小**村庄**里。"},
51575:{"w":"sofa","e":"We sat on the sofa and watched a film together.","t":"我们坐在**沙发**上，一起看了一部电影。"},
51576:{"w":"speed","e":"The train travels at a speed of 300 kilometres an hour.","t":"这列火车以每小时300公里的**速度**行驶。"},
51577:{"w":"knock","e":"Please knock on the door before you come into my room.","t":"进我房间之前，请先**敲**门。"},
51578:{"w":"score","e":"She scored ninety-five points in the English test and was the top student in class.","t":"她英语考试**得了**九十五分，是班上第一名。"},
51579:{"w":"necessary","e":"It is necessary to wear a helmet when you ride a bike.","t":"骑自行车时戴头盔是**必要的**。"},
51580:{"w":"shirt","e":"He put on a clean shirt before going to the party.","t":"去参加聚会前，他换上了一件干净的**衬衫**。"},
51581:{"w":"eraser","e":"I used an eraser to remove the marks on my paper.","t":"我用**橡皮擦**擦掉了纸上的痕迹。"},
51582:{"w":"check","e":"The teacher has checked Kate's answers.","t":"老师**检查**了凯特的答案。"},
51583:{"w":"vegetable","e":"We grow several kinds of vegetables in our school garden.","t":"我们在学校的菜园里种了几种**蔬菜**。"},
51584:{"w":"article","e":"I read an interesting article about pandas in the school magazine.","t":"我在校刊上读到一篇关于大熊猫的有趣**文章**。"},
51585:{"w":"bamboo","e":"Pandas spend most of the day eating bamboo in the forests of Sichuan.","t":"大熊猫一天大部分时间都在四川的森林里吃**竹子**。"},
51586:{"w":"hot","e":"The soup is still too hot for me to eat.","t":"这碗汤还是太**烫**，我没法喝。"},
51587:{"w":"pot","e":"She made a big pot of soup for the whole family.","t":"她给全家煮了一大**锅**汤。"},
51588:{"w":"may","e":"It may rain this afternoon, so take an umbrella.","t":"今天下午**可能**会下雨，带上伞吧。"},
51589:{"w":"change","e":"The leaves change colour when the weather gets cold in autumn.","t":"秋天天气转冷时，树叶就会**变**色。"},
51590:{"w":"thousand","e":"More than a thousand people came to the school music show.","t":"有一**千**多人来看学校的音乐演出。"},
51591:{"w":"except","e":"Everyone in my class went on the trip except Tom, who was ill.","t":"我们班**除了**生病的汤姆，所有人都去参加了这次旅行。"},
51592:{"w":"music","e":"I often listen to music while I clean my room.","t":"我经常一边打扫房间，一边听**音乐**。"},
51593:{"w":"anywhere","e":"You can sit anywhere you like in the library.","t":"在图书馆里，你可以坐在你喜欢的**任何地方**。"},
51594:{"w":"forest","e":"We saw tall trees on both sides as we entered the forest.","t":"走进**森林**时，我们看见两边都是高高的树。"},
51595:{"w":"morning","e":"We went for a walk in the park this morning.","t":"今天**早上**，我们去公园散步了。"},
51596:{"w":"beautiful","e":"The sky was beautiful just before the sun went down.","t":"太阳快落山时，天空真**美**。"},
51597:{"w":"position","e":"He has been offered a position in a large company in Shanghai.","t":"他得到了上海一家大公司的一个**职位**。"},
51598:{"w":"into","e":"The little boy put all his toys into a big box.","t":"小男孩把所有玩具都放**进**了一个大盒子。"},
51599:{"w":"red","e":"She wore a red coat so we could find her easily.","t":"她穿了件**红色**外套，这样我们就容易找到她。"},
51600:{"w":"leave","e":"We have to leave home at seven to catch the first train.","t":"我们得在七点**离开**家，赶上第一班火车。"},
51601:{"w":"form","e":"You have to fill in a form, but it doesn't take long.","t":"你得填写一张**表格**，但不会耽误太久。"},
51602:{"w":"scarf","e":"I wore a thick scarf to keep warm on the way to school.","t":"我上学路上戴了条厚**围巾**保暖。"},
51603:{"w":"favorite","e":"Pizza is my favorite food, and I could eat it every day of the week.","t":"比萨是我**最喜欢**的食物，我可以一周七天天天吃。"},
51604:{"w":"always","e":"My brother always forgets his keys and has to knock on the door.","t":"弟弟**总是**忘带钥匙，只好敲门。"},
51605:{"w":"cage","e":"The bird in the cage started singing when the sun rose.","t":"太阳升起来的时候，**笼子**里的鸟开始唱歌了。"},
51606:{"w":"unfamiliar","e":"Ask your teacher if you find an unfamiliar word in the story.","t":"如果你在故事里看到**不熟悉**的单词，就问问老师。"},
51607:{"w":"examine","e":"The doctor examined my arm carefully after I fell down.","t":"我摔倒后，医生仔细**检查**了我的胳膊。"},
51608:{"w":"shell","e":"We found a small shell under a rock at the beach.","t":"我们在海滩的一块石头下找到了一个小**贝壳**。"},
51609:{"w":"pond","e":"The children like to feed the ducks in the pond near the school.","t":"孩子们喜欢在学校附近的**池塘**边喂鸭子。"},
51610:{"w":"etiquette","e":"Our teacher showed us some simple etiquette for eating with guests.","t":"老师教了我们几条和客人一起吃饭时要遵守的**礼节**。"},
51611:{"w":"ham","e":"I made a sandwich with ham and cheese for lunch.","t":"我午饭做了个**火腿**奶酪三明治。"},
51612:{"w":"unable","e":"I was unable to swim when I first joined the class.","t":"刚参加这个班时，我还**不会**游泳。"},
51613:{"w":"embarrassed","e":"He felt embarrassed when he forgot his friend's name in class.","t":"他上课时忘了朋友的名字，觉得很**尴尬**。"},
51614:{"w":"bother","e":"I'm sorry to bother you so early, Mrs Smith.","t":"史密斯女士，很抱歉这么早就来**打扰**您。"},
51615:{"w":"sort","e":"We need to sort the books by subject before putting them on the shelves.","t":"我们需要先把书按主题**分类**，再把它们放上书架。"},
51616:{"w":"attack","e":"The enemy planned to attack the city early in the morning.","t":"敌军计划在清晨**攻击**这座城市。"},
51617:{"w":"today","e":"We are going to visit the new library after school today.","t":"**今天**放学后，我们要去参观新图书馆。"},
51618:{"w":"family","e":"My family has dinner together every Sunday evening.","t":"我们**一家人**每周日晚上都一起吃晚饭。"},
51619:{"w":"lunch","e":"My friends and I usually have lunch in the school hall.","t":"我和朋友们通常在学校大厅吃**午饭**。"},
51620:{"w":"gentleman","e":"A true gentleman always holds the door open for others.","t":"真正的**绅士**总会为别人扶着门。"},
51621:{"w":"himself","e":"My little brother can tie his shoes by himself now.","t":"我弟弟现在可以**自己**系鞋带了。"},
51622:{"w":"who","e":"Who put these flowers on my desk before class today?","t":"今天上课前，是**谁**把这些花放在我桌上的？"},
51623:{"w":"sand","e":"We built a little castle out of sand on the beach.","t":"我们在海滩上用**沙子**堆了一座小城堡。"},
51624:{"w":"fit","e":"These shoes fit me well, so I will buy them.","t":"这双鞋我穿着很**合适**，所以我要买下来。"},
51625:{"w":"character","e":"The main character in this story is a brave young girl.","t":"这个故事的主要**人物**是个勇敢的小女孩。"},
51626:{"w":"study","e":"I study English with my sister for half an hour every evening.","t":"我每天晚上和姐姐一起**学**半小时英语。"},
51627:{"w":"turn","e":"Turn left at the next corner and you will see the post office on your right.","t":"在下一个路口向左**转弯**，你就会看到右边的邮局。"},
51628:{"w":"expect","e":"We expect the new library to open to students next September.","t":"我们**预计**新图书馆明年九月向学生开放。"},
51629:{"w":"pair","e":"I bought a new pair of shoes for the school trip.","t":"我为这次学校旅行买了**一双**新鞋。"},
51630:{"w":"video","e":"My little brother likes watching funny videos of cats on his phone after dinner.","t":"我弟弟晚饭后喜欢用手机看猫咪的搞笑**视频**。"},
51631:{"w":"just","e":"I have just finished my homework, so I can watch TV now.","t":"我**刚**做完作业，所以现在可以看电视了。"},
51632:{"w":"tomorrow","e":"I will bring my new book to school tomorrow morning.","t":"**明天**早上我会把新书带到学校。"},
51633:{"w":"boil","e":"Boil the water for ten minutes before you drink it.","t":"喝水前先把水**煮**十分钟。"},
51634:{"w":"noodle","e":"We ate a big bowl of noodles for dinner last night.","t":"昨晚我们吃了一大碗**面条**。"},
51635:{"w":"beat","e":"Our team beat the strongest team in the city yesterday.","t":"我们队昨天**击败**了全市最强的球队。"},
51636:{"w":"leaf","e":"A yellow leaf fell from the tree onto my book.","t":"一片黄**叶子**从树上落到了我的书上。"},
51637:{"w":"right","e":"You are right about the time, so we can wait here.","t":"你说的时间是**对**的，所以我们可以在这儿等。"},
51638:{"w":"excellent","e":"Her English is excellent, so she often wins speech contests.","t":"她的英语**好极了**，所以经常在演讲比赛中获奖。"},
51639:{"w":"heat","e":"The summer heat made it hard to sleep at night.","t":"夏天夜里天气**炎热**，让人难以入睡。"},
51640:{"w":"society","e":"Our society needs more people who are willing to help others.","t":"我们的**社会**需要更多乐于助人的人。"},
51641:{"w":"polite","e":"It is polite to say thank you when someone holds the door for you.","t":"别人为你扶门时说声谢谢是很**有礼貌**的。"},
51642:{"w":"shop","e":"We bought some bread from the shop across the street.","t":"我们从街对面的**商店**买了些面包。"},
51643:{"w":"chip","e":"We ordered fish and chips from the little shop near the park.","t":"我们在公园旁的小店点了炸鱼和**薯条**。"},
51644:{"w":"letter","e":"I wrote a letter to my aunt to thank her for the gift.","t":"我给姑姑写了一封**信**，谢谢她送我的礼物。"},
51645:{"w":"kung fu","e":"My sister has been learning kung fu at school since September.","t":"我妹妹从九月份起就在学校学**功夫**。"},
51646:{"w":"start","e":"We must start early tomorrow if we want to catch the first train.","t":"如果想赶上头班火车，我们明天必须早点**出发**。"},
51647:{"w":"date","e":"Please write today's date at the top of your paper.","t":"请在试卷顶部写上今天的**日期**。"},
51648:{"w":"although","e":"Although it was raining, we still went to the park to fly our kites.","t":"**虽然**下着雨，我们还是去公园放风筝了。"},
51649:{"w":"answer","e":"Nobody could answer the teacher's difficult question.","t":"没有人能**回答**老师提出的难题。"},
51650:{"w":"true","e":"Is it true that your cousin can speak four different languages?","t":"你表弟会说四种不同的语言，这是**真的**吗？"},
51651:{"w":"porridge","e":"I had a bowl of porridge with milk for breakfast.","t":"我早饭吃了一碗加了牛奶的**燕麦粥**。"},
51652:{"w":"style","e":"She has a simple style and likes to wear plain clothes.","t":"她的**风格**很简单，喜欢穿朴素的衣服。"},
51653:{"w":"flat","e":"We took the lift up to my friend's flat after school.","t":"放学后，我们坐电梯去了朋友的**公寓**。"},
51654:{"w":"ruler","e":"Use your ruler to draw a straight line across the page.","t":"用你的**尺子**在这一页上横着画一条直线。"},
51655:{"w":"whenever","e":"Whenever I visit my grandfather, he makes me a cup of tea.","t":"**每当**我去看爷爷，他都会给我泡一杯茶。"},
51656:{"w":"cousin","e":"My cousin is coming to stay with us during her holiday.","t":"我**表妹**放假时要来我们家住。"},
51657:{"w":"dumpling","e":"On New Year's Eve, my whole family sits together and makes dumplings.","t":"除夕夜，我们全家人坐在一起包**饺子**。"},
51658:{"w":"sock","e":"I found one sock under the bed and the other by the door.","t":"我在床底找到一只**袜子**，另一只在门边。"},
51659:{"w":"tired","e":"I was so tired after the long trip that I fell asleep at once.","t":"长途旅行之后我太**累**了，一下子就睡着了。"},
51660:{"w":"manage","e":"She managed to finish the report before the meeting started.","t":"她**设法**在会议开始前完成了报告。"},
51661:{"w":"then","e":"We had dinner and then watched a film together.","t":"我们吃了晚饭，**然后**一起看了一部电影。"},
51662:{"w":"disabled","e":"The school has a lift so disabled students can reach every floor.","t":"学校设有电梯，方便**残疾**学生到达每一层。"},
51663:{"w":"keen","e":"My brother is very keen to learn Japanese before his trip to Tokyo next year.","t":"我哥哥非常**渴望**在明年去东京旅行前学会日语。"},
51664:{"w":"semester","e":"We will have six courses and two important exams in the first semester.","t":"第一**学期**我们有六门课和两次重要考试。"},
51665:{"w":"theme","e":"The main theme of the film is the friendship between a boy and his dog.","t":"这部电影的**主题**是一个男孩和他的狗之间的友谊。"},
51666:{"w":"lifestyle","e":"I chose a healthier lifestyle, so now I walk to school.","t":"我选择了更健康的**生活方式**，现在都走路上学。"},
51667:{"w":"pop","e":"My parents and I listen to pop music in the car.","t":"我和爸妈在车里听**流行**音乐。"},
51668:{"w":"resolution","e":"My New Year's resolution is to read one book each month.","t":"新的一年，我下**决心**每个月读一本书。"},
51669:{"w":"predict","e":"It is hard to predict how many people will come tomorrow.","t":"很难**预计**明天会来多少人。"},
51670:{"w":"unusual","e":"It is unusual for snow to fall in this part of the country in April.","t":"在这个国家的这一地区，四月下雪是**不寻常**的。"},
51671:{"w":"attendant","e":"The flight attendant brought us some water during the flight.","t":"飞行途中，空中**乘务员**给我们送了些水。"},
51672:{"w":"traditional","e":"We wear traditional clothes and visit our grandparents during the holiday.","t":"节日期间，我们穿着**传统**服装去看望爷爷奶奶。"},
51673:{"w":"yang","e":"In Chinese culture, the sun is often a symbol of yang.","t":"在中国文化中，太阳常被视为**阳**的象征。"},
51674:{"w":"kangaroo","e":"We saw a kangaroo carrying its baby in a pouch.","t":"我们看到一只**袋鼠**，它的育儿袋里装着宝宝。"},
51675:{"w":"publish","e":"Her first novel was published when she was only nineteen years old.","t":"她的第一部小说**出版**时她才十九岁。"},
51676:{"w":"shelf","e":"I put my old books on the top shelf yesterday.","t":"昨天我把旧书放在了最上面一层**架子**上。"},
51677:{"w":"homework","e":"I do my homework at the kitchen table after dinner.","t":"晚饭后，我在厨房的桌子上做**作业**。"},
51678:{"w":"bread","e":"We bought some fresh bread for breakfast at the shop.","t":"我们在商店买了些新鲜**面包**当早餐。"},
51679:{"w":"sale","e":"The shop has a big sale this weekend, and everything is half price.","t":"这家店本周末有大型**特价促销**，所有商品都半价。"},
51680:{"w":"bus","e":"We took the bus to the beach on Saturday morning.","t":"星期六早上，我们坐**公共汽车**去了海滩。"},
51681:{"w":"museum","e":"We spent the whole afternoon at the science museum looking at old machines and robots.","t":"我们在科学**博物馆**里待了一整个下午，参观旧机器和机器人。"},
51682:{"w":"active","e":"My grandfather is still very active and goes swimming three times a week.","t":"我爷爷仍然很**活跃**，每周游泳三次。"},
51683:{"w":"cinema","e":"We went to the cinema to see a funny film.","t":"我们去了**电影院**看一部搞笑的电影。"},
51684:{"w":"violin","e":"My sister has been learning to play the violin since she was six years old.","t":"我妹妹从六岁起就开始学拉**小提琴**。"},
51685:{"w":"risk","e":"Driving too fast in the rain greatly increases the risk of an accident.","t":"雨天开快车会大大增加发生事故的**风险**。"},
51686:{"w":"phone","e":"I will phone you as soon as I get home.","t":"我一到家就**给你打电话**。"},
51687:{"w":"opposite","e":"The shop is on the opposite side of the street.","t":"那家商店在街道的**对面**。"},
51688:{"w":"teacher","e":"Our maths teacher showed us a new way to count.","t":"我们的数学**老师**教了我们一种新的计数方法。"},
51689:{"w":"piece","e":"Could I have another piece of cake, please?","t":"我能再来一**块**蛋糕吗？"},
51690:{"w":"wallet","e":"I checked my wallet to see if I had enough money.","t":"我看了看**钱包**，确认身上的钱够不够。"},
51691:{"w":"chair","e":"I pulled up a chair and sat next to my sister.","t":"我拉过一把**椅子**，坐在姐姐旁边。"},
51692:{"w":"monkey","e":"A little monkey climbed down the tree to get some fruit.","t":"一只小**猴子**爬下树去拿水果。"},
51693:{"w":"primary","e":"My sister is eight and goes to the local primary school.","t":"我妹妹八岁了，在当地上**小学**。"},
51694:{"w":"cucumber","e":"She cut a fresh cucumber into thin slices and added it to the salad.","t":"她把一根新鲜**黄瓜**切成薄片，加进了沙拉里。"},
51695:{"w":"tool","e":"A saw is a useful tool for cutting pieces of wood.","t":"锯子是切割木料的实用**工具**。"},
51696:{"w":"end","e":"The school year ends in June, and then we have two months of holiday.","t":"学年在六月**结束**，然后我们有两个月的假期。"},
51697:{"w":"address","e":"The headmaster will address the whole school at the opening ceremony.","t":"校长将在开学典礼上向全校师生**讲话**。"},
51698:{"w":"shall","e":"Shall we meet at the school gate at seven tomorrow morning?","t":"我们明天早上七点在校门口碰头，**好吗**？"},
51699:{"w":"blue","e":"He wore a blue shirt and white shoes to the party.","t":"他穿着**蓝色**衬衫和白鞋去参加聚会。"},
51700:{"w":"ticket","e":"I bought a ticket for the school concert on Friday.","t":"我买了一张周五学校音乐会的**票**。"},
51701:{"w":"man","e":"A man in a grey coat helped me find the station.","t":"一位穿灰色外套的**男子**帮我找到了车站。"},
51702:{"w":"throw","e":"He threw the ball to his friend, who caught it easily.","t":"他把球**扔**给朋友，朋友轻松地接住了。"},
51703:{"w":"present","e":"Everyone was present at the meeting yesterday.","t":"昨天的会议上，每个人都**出席**了。"},
51704:{"w":"underground","e":"Taking the underground is the fastest way to get there.","t":"坐**地铁**是到那儿最快的办法。"},
51705:{"w":"nose","e":"The dog put its wet nose against my hand to smell it.","t":"狗用湿漉漉的**鼻子**贴着我的手闻了闻。"},
51706:{"w":"club","e":"I joined the school art club because I love to draw.","t":"我喜欢画画，所以参加了学校的美术**社团**。"},
51707:{"w":"simple","e":"The rules of this game are simple, so even children can play it.","t":"这个游戏的规则很**简单**，连孩子都会玩。"},
51708:{"w":"information","e":"You can find more information about the school clubs on our website.","t":"你可以在我们的网站上找到更多关于学校社团的**信息**。"},
51709:{"w":"rose","e":"My aunt grows red roses along the wall in her garden.","t":"我姑姑在花园的围墙边种了红**玫瑰**。"},
51710:{"w":"floor","e":"The glass fell to the floor and broke into small pieces.","t":"玻璃杯掉在**地板**上，摔成了碎片。"},
51711:{"w":"ago","e":"We moved to this town three years ago, when I was ten.","t":"三年**前**，也就是我十岁的时候，我们搬到了这个镇上。"},
51712:{"w":"literature","e":"Jane taught English literature at my old high school.","t":"简在我的中学母校教英国**文学**。"},
51713:{"w":"sunny","e":"It was sunny, so we decided to have lunch in the park.","t":"天气**晴朗**，所以我们决定到公园吃午饭。"},
51714:{"w":"camp","e":"Our class will camp by the lake for two nights this summer.","t":"今年夏天我们班要在湖边**野营**两晚。"},
51715:{"w":"public","e":"Smoking is not allowed in public places.","t":"**公共**场所禁止吸烟。"},
51716:{"w":"hundred","e":"We sold more than a hundred tickets for the school concert.","t":"学校音乐会的门票我们卖了一**百**多张。"},
51717:{"w":"away","e":"The nearest hospital is twenty kilometres away from our village.","t":"最近的医院**离**我们村有二十公里远。"},
51718:{"w":"biology","e":"In biology class today, we looked at plant cells under a microscope.","t":"今天的**生物**课上，我们用显微镜观察了植物细胞。"},
51719:{"w":"airport","e":"We need to leave home by six o'clock if we want to reach the airport on time.","t":"要想准时到**机场**，我们得六点前出门。"},
51720:{"w":"notice","e":"Did you notice the new poster on the classroom wall?","t":"你**注意到**教室墙上的新海报了吗？"},
51721:{"w":"dance","e":"My grandparents still like to dance together at family parties.","t":"我爷爷奶奶现在还喜欢在家庭聚会上一起**跳舞**。"},
51722:{"w":"similar","e":"My sister and I have very similar tastes in music, food and clothes.","t":"我和姐姐在音乐、食物和衣服上的品味非常**相似**。"},
51723:{"w":"bee","e":"A bee flew from one flower to another in our garden.","t":"一只**蜜蜂**在我们花园的花丛中飞来飞去。"},
51724:{"w":"press","e":"Press the green button to start the machine.","t":"**按**下绿色按钮，启动机器。"},
51725:{"w":"ill","e":"I felt ill this morning, so I stayed home from school.","t":"今天早上我觉得**不舒服**，所以留在家没去上学。"},
51726:{"w":"hate","e":"I hate getting up early on cold winter mornings, especially on weekends.","t":"我**讨厌**在寒冷的冬天早上早起，周末尤其如此。"},
51727:{"w":"path","e":"We followed a narrow path through the woods to the lake.","t":"我们沿着一条**小路**穿过树林走到湖边。"},
51728:{"w":"national","e":"The national team trained hard before the big match against Japan.","t":"**国家**队在对阵日本的大赛前刻苦训练。"},
51729:{"w":"cruel","e":"It is cruel to keep a bird in such a small cage.","t":"把鸟关在这么小的笼子里是很**残忍**的。"},
51730:{"w":"modest","e":"Although she won first prize, she remained modest and thanked her teachers for their help.","t":"她虽然得了一等奖，却依然很**谦虚**，还感谢了老师们的帮助。"},
51731:{"w":"autograph","e":"I asked my favourite player for an autograph after the game.","t":"比赛结束后，我向最喜欢的球员要了个**签名**。"},
51732:{"w":"excite","e":"The news of a school trip to the sea excited everyone.","t":"听说学校要组织大家去海边玩，同学们都很**兴奋**。"},
51733:{"w":"disturb","e":"Please do not disturb me while I am doing my homework.","t":"我做作业的时候，请不要**打扰**我。"},
51734:{"w":"tragedy","e":"The fire was a terrible tragedy, and the whole town came together to help the families.","t":"这场火灾是一场可怕的**悲剧**，全镇的人都来帮助受害的家庭。"},
51735:{"w":"opportunity","e":"The school show gave me an opportunity to sing on stage.","t":"这次学校演出给了我一个在台上唱歌的**机会**。"},
51736:{"w":"headache","e":"I had a headache after spending too long on the computer.","t":"我电脑用久了就**头痛**。"},
51737:{"w":"curious","e":"The curious child asked a lot of questions about the stars.","t":"这个**好奇的**孩子问了许多关于星星的问题。"},
51738:{"w":"wide","e":"The river is very wide here, so we need a boat.","t":"这里的河面很**宽**，所以我们需要一条船。"},
51739:{"w":"able","e":"My sister is able to play both the piano and the violin.","t":"我姐姐**能**弹钢琴，也能拉小提琴。"},
51740:{"w":"period","e":"The Tang dynasty was an important period in Chinese history.","t":"唐朝是中国历史上一个重要的**时期**。"},
51741:{"w":"through","e":"We walked through the park on our way to school.","t":"我们上学途中**穿过**了公园。"},
51742:{"w":"north","e":"We drove north for two hours to visit my uncle.","t":"我们**向北**开了两个小时的车去看叔叔。"},
51743:{"w":"pride","e":"Her parents looked at her with pride when she received the prize.","t":"她领奖时，父母满怀**自豪**地看着她。"},
51744:{"w":"center","e":"The new library is in the center of the city, close to the main station.","t":"新图书馆在市**中心**，离火车总站很近。"},
51745:{"w":"rock","e":"We sat on a rock and watched the boats go by.","t":"我们坐在一块**岩石**上，看着船只经过。"},
51746:{"w":"meet","e":"I often meet my friends at the park after school.","t":"放学后我经常在公园和朋友**见面**。"},
51747:{"w":"pork","e":"Dad cooked pork with potatoes for dinner last night.","t":"爸爸昨晚做了**猪肉**炖土豆当晚饭。"},
51748:{"w":"bed","e":"I left my book on the bed before I went downstairs.","t":"我下楼前把书放在了**床**上。"},
51749:{"w":"relax","e":"Watching TV can help me relax.","t":"看电视可以帮助我**放松**。"},
51750:{"w":"dining","e":"We are dining with our new neighbours this evening.","t":"今晚我们要和新邻居一起**吃饭**。"},
51751:{"w":"panda","e":"We saw a panda eating leaves at the zoo yesterday.","t":"昨天我们在动物园看到一只**熊猫**在吃叶子。"},
51752:{"w":"me","e":"My brother gave me a new bag for my birthday.","t":"哥哥送了**我**一个新书包当生日礼物。"},
51753:{"w":"pour","e":"She poured some hot water into the cup and added a tea bag.","t":"她往杯子里**倒入**一些热水，又放了个茶包。"},
51754:{"w":"must","e":"You must wear a helmet when you ride a bike.","t":"骑自行车时你**必须**戴头盔。"},
51755:{"w":"boy","e":"The boy in the blue shirt is my little brother.","t":"穿蓝衬衫的那个**男孩**是我弟弟。"},
51756:{"w":"flu","e":"My sister stayed home all week because she had the flu.","t":"妹妹得了**流感**，在家待了整整一周。"},
51757:{"w":"play","e":"We often play with our dog in the garden after dinner.","t":"晚饭后我们常在花园里跟狗一起**玩耍**。"},
51758:{"w":"against","e":"Many people voted against the new plan at the meeting.","t":"会上许多人投票**反对**这项新计划。"},
51759:{"w":"jump","e":"The children jumped into the pool one after another.","t":"孩子们一个接一个地**跳**进了游泳池。"},
51760:{"w":"copy","e":"Please keep a copy of your homework in this folder.","t":"请把你作业的**副本**留一份在这个文件夹里。"},
51761:{"w":"clever","e":"The clever little dog quickly learned how to open the kitchen door by itself.","t":"这只**聪明的**小狗很快就学会了自己打开厨房的门。"},
51762:{"w":"coin","e":"I found a coin on the floor under my desk.","t":"我在书桌下面的地板上找到了一枚**硬币**。"},
51763:{"w":"find","e":"I couldn't find my keys anywhere in the house today.","t":"我今天在家里到处找，都**找不到**钥匙。"},
51764:{"w":"borrow","e":"Can I borrow your pen for a minute?","t":"我可以**借**你的笔用一下吗？"},
51765:{"w":"toilet","e":"Can you tell me where the toilet is in this building?","t":"你能告诉我这栋楼的**洗手间**在哪儿吗？"},
51766:{"w":"same","e":"My sister and I go to the same school, but we are in different classes.","t":"我和姐姐上**同一**所学校，但不在一个班。"},
51767:{"w":"alive","e":"The doctors were glad that the little boy was still alive after the accident.","t":"医生们很高兴那个小男孩在事故之后还**活着**。"},
51768:{"w":"blow","e":"The wind blew so hard that my hat flew off.","t":"风**刮**得很大，我的帽子都被吹跑了。"},
51769:{"w":"name","e":"Please write your name at the top of the page.","t":"请在这页上方写下你的**名字**。"},
51770:{"w":"whose","e":"Whose bag is this? It is on my seat.","t":"这是**谁的**包？它放在我的座位上。"},
51771:{"w":"future","e":"What do you want to be in the future, Anna?","t":"安娜，你**将来**想做什么？"},
51772:{"w":"could","e":"When I was six, I could already swim across the small lake.","t":"我六岁的时候就已经**能**游过那个小湖了。"},
51773:{"w":"gold","e":"My grandmother wears a ring made of gold every day.","t":"奶奶每天都戴着一枚**金**戒指。"},
51774:{"w":"climb","e":"We climbed the hill and enjoyed the view from the top.","t":"我们**爬**上小山，欣赏山顶的风景。"},
51775:{"w":"catch","e":"We ran to catch the last bus home.","t":"我们跑着去**赶**最后一班回家的公交车。"},
51776:{"w":"chicken","e":"We had chicken and rice for lunch at school today.","t":"今天我们在学校午饭吃了**鸡肉**和米饭。"},
51777:{"w":"service","e":"The airline companies want to improve the service.","t":"航空公司想提升**服务**质量。"},
51778:{"w":"policeman","e":"A policeman helped us find our way back to the hotel.","t":"一名**警察**帮我们找到了回旅馆的路。"},
51779:{"w":"policewoman","e":"The policewoman stopped the cars so we could cross the road.","t":"那位**女警察**让车停下来，好让我们过马路。"},
51780:{"w":"slow","e":"The traffic was so slow this morning that I was late for school.","t":"今天早上车流**缓慢**，我上学迟到了。"},
51781:{"w":"bottle","e":"I filled my bottle with water before leaving for school.","t":"出门上学前，我把**瓶子**装满了水。"},
51782:{"w":"jog","e":"I jog in the park for half an hour every morning before school.","t":"我每天早上上学前都在公园里**慢跑**半小时。"},
51783:{"w":"disappoint","e":"I don't want to disappoint my parents, so I will study harder.","t":"我不想让父母**失望**，所以我会更努力地学习。"},
51784:{"w":"electronic","e":"You can read the electronic book on your phone.","t":"你可以在手机上读这本**电子**书。"},
51785:{"w":"herself","e":"My sister made this dress for herself last summer.","t":"去年夏天，姐姐给**自己**做了这条裙子。"},
51786:{"w":"news","e":"We heard the good news from our teacher this morning.","t":"今天早上，我们从老师那里听到了这个好**消息**。"},
51787:{"w":"beef","e":"We cooked beef with onions and carrots for dinner.","t":"晚饭我们做了洋葱胡萝卜炖**牛肉**。"},
51788:{"w":"mend","e":"My father is mending the broken chair in the garden.","t":"我父亲正在花园里**修**那把坏椅子。"},
51789:{"w":"casually","e":"She dressed casually in jeans and a T-shirt for the party.","t":"她穿着牛仔裤和 T 恤去参加聚会，打扮得很**随意**。"},
51790:{"w":"frustrate","e":"It frustrates me when my computer stops working during class.","t":"上课时电脑突然坏了，这让我很**懊恼**。"},
51791:{"w":"goat","e":"We saw a goat standing on a rock near the farm.","t":"我们看到一只**山羊**站在农场附近的一块岩石上。"},
51792:{"w":"handbag","e":"My mother always keeps her keys in her handbag.","t":"妈妈总把钥匙放在**手提包**里。"},
51793:{"w":"professional","e":"My cousin wants to become a professional football player.","t":"我表哥想成为一名**职业**足球运动员。"},
51794:{"w":"attempt","e":"She made an attempt to climb the wall, but it was too high.","t":"她**试图**爬过那堵墙，但墙太高了。"},
51795:{"w":"mail","e":"Please mail this letter on your way to school.","t":"去学校的路上，请把这封信**寄**出去。"},
51796:{"w":"upset","e":"Tom was upset when his best friend moved away.","t":"最好的朋友搬走了，汤姆很**难过**。"},
51797:{"w":"disaster","e":"The fire was a disaster for the small town.","t":"这场火灾对这个小镇来说是一场**灾难**。"},
51798:{"w":"honest","e":"Please be honest with me. Did you break the window?","t":"请对我**诚实**点儿。是你打破了窗户吗？"},
51799:{"w":"watch","e":"We watched a funny film at home last night.","t":"昨晚我们在家**看**了一部有趣的电影。"},
51800:{"w":"she","e":"My cousin lives nearby, so she often visits us on Sundays.","t":"我表姐住得近，所以**她**星期天常来看我们。"},
51801:{"w":"table","e":"The children sat around the table to eat their lunch.","t":"孩子们围着**桌子**坐下来吃午饭。"},
51802:{"w":"forget","e":"Don't forget to turn off the lights before you leave the classroom.","t":"离开教室前别**忘记**关灯。"},
51803:{"w":"cute","e":"My neighbor has a cute little puppy that runs to greet me every morning.","t":"我邻居有一只**可爱的**小狗，每天早上都跑过来迎接我。"},
51804:{"w":"laptop","e":"I used my laptop to do my homework last night.","t":"昨晚我用**笔记本电脑**做了作业。"},
51805:{"w":"voice","e":"She has a beautiful voice and often sings in the school choir.","t":"她有一副动听的**嗓音**，常在学校合唱团里唱歌。"},
51806:{"w":"song","e":"We sang a song together at the end of the party.","t":"聚会快结束时，我们一起唱了一首**歌**。"},
51807:{"w":"prove","e":"This photo proves that we were at school that day.","t":"这张照片**证明**我们那天在学校。"},
51808:{"w":"for","e":"She works very hard for her family.","t":"她**为了**家人而辛勤工作。"},
51809:{"w":"story","e":"Grandpa told us a story about his first day at school.","t":"爷爷给我们讲了他第一天上学的**故事**。"},
51810:{"w":"lady","e":"The lady in the red coat is our new teacher.","t":"穿红外套的那位**女士**是我们的新老师。"},
51811:{"w":"folk","e":"She loves folk songs, especially the old ones from the countryside.","t":"她喜欢**民间**歌曲，尤其是乡村里流传的老歌。"},
51812:{"w":"some","e":"Would you like some milk in your tea?","t":"你的茶里要加**一些**牛奶吗？"},
51813:{"w":"main","e":"The main road was closed because of the accident.","t":"因为发生了事故，**主要**道路被封闭了。"},
51814:{"w":"solve","e":"Let us work together to solve this difficult maths problem.","t":"让我们一起**解答**这道数学难题吧。"},
51815:{"w":"language","e":"Learning a new language takes a lot of time and patience.","t":"学一门新**语言**需要大量的时间和耐心。"},
51816:{"w":"talent","e":"She showed a great talent for music when she was only five years old.","t":"她年仅五岁时就显示出了非凡的音乐**才能**。"},
51817:{"w":"pencil","e":"Please use a pencil to draw a line under the title.","t":"请用**铅笔**在标题下画一条线。"},
51818:{"w":"great","e":"We had a great time at the beach last Sunday.","t":"上星期天我们在海边玩得**很开心**。"},
51819:{"w":"hotel","e":"Our hotel was just a short walk from the beach.","t":"从我们住的**旅馆**步行一小段路就到海边。"},
51820:{"w":"normal","e":"It is normal to feel nervous before an important exam.","t":"重要考试前感到紧张是**正常**的。"},
51821:{"w":"door","e":"Please close the door when you leave the classroom today.","t":"今天离开教室时，请把**门**关上。"},
51822:{"w":"cent","e":"I found a coin worth one cent in my old bag.","t":"我在旧包里找到一枚面值一**分**的硬币。"},
51823:{"w":"tea","e":"My grandfather drinks a cup of tea after breakfast every day.","t":"爷爷每天早饭后都喝一杯**茶**。"},
51824:{"w":"brown","e":"The small brown dog is sleeping next to the door.","t":"那只**棕色的**小狗正在门边睡觉。"},
51825:{"w":"south","e":"Many birds fly south when the weather begins to get cold.","t":"天气开始变冷时，许多鸟就**向南**飞。"},
51826:{"w":"color","e":"What color do you want to paint your room this summer?","t":"今年夏天你想把房间刷成什么**颜色**？"},
51827:{"w":"everything","e":"Everything is ready for the party, so you can invite your friends now.","t":"**一切**都为聚会准备好了，所以你现在可以邀请朋友了。"},
51828:{"w":"funny","e":"The clown's funny hat made all the children laugh out loud.","t":"小丑那顶**可笑的**帽子把孩子们逗得哈哈大笑。"},
51829:{"w":"question","e":"The police questioned the man for two hours about the missing bag.","t":"警察就丢失的包**询问**了那个男人两个小时。"},
51830:{"w":"come","e":"Please come to my house after school.","t":"放学后请**来**我家。"},
51831:{"w":"temperature","e":"The temperature fell below zero after the sun went down.","t":"太阳下山后，**气温**降到了零度以下。"},
51832:{"w":"day","e":"We spent the whole day at the beach with our cousins.","t":"我们和表亲在海滩待了整整**一天**。"},
51833:{"w":"skill","e":"Learning to swim is a useful skill that can save your life.","t":"学游泳是一项能救命的有用**技能**。"},
51834:{"w":"planet","e":"Earth is the only planet known to have living things.","t":"地球是目前已知唯一有生命的**行星**。"},
51835:{"w":"candle","e":"Dad lit a candle when the lights went out.","t":"灯灭了，爸爸点了一支**蜡烛**。"},
51836:{"w":"bag","e":"I packed my lunch and a book in my bag.","t":"我把午饭和一本书装进了**包**里。"},
51837:{"w":"explain","e":"Can you explain why the sky is blue?","t":"你能**解释**一下天空为什么是蓝色的吗？"},
51838:{"w":"grow","e":"Tomatoes grow well in warm weather if they get enough water.","t":"只要水分充足，西红柿在温暖的天气里就**长**得很好。"},
51839:{"w":"if","e":"If it rains tomorrow, we will play games at home.","t":"**如果**明天下雨，我们就在家玩游戏。"},
51840:{"w":"famous","e":"Mount Tai is famous for its beautiful sunrise and ancient temples.","t":"泰山以美丽的日出和古老的寺庙而**著名**。"},
51841:{"w":"astronaut","e":"The astronaut watched Earth from the window of the spaceship.","t":"**宇航员**透过飞船的窗户望着地球。"},
51842:{"w":"summer","e":"We often visit our grandparents in the mountains in summer.","t":"**夏天**我们常去山里看望爷爷奶奶。"},
51843:{"w":"yes","e":"She smiled and said yes when I asked her to sing.","t":"我请她唱首歌，她笑着说**好**。"},
51844:{"w":"piano","e":"My brother plays the piano every evening after doing his homework.","t":"弟弟每天晚上做完作业后都会弹**钢琴**。"},
51845:{"w":"adverb","e":"In the sentence “She runs quickly,” the word “quickly” is an adverb.","t":"在“She runs quickly”这个句子里，“quickly”是**副词**。"},
51846:{"w":"dislike","e":"I dislike cold weather because I cannot play outside much.","t":"我**不喜欢**冷天，因为那样就不能常出去玩。"},
51847:{"w":"border","e":"We crossed the border into France early in the morning.","t":"我们一早就越过**边境**进入了法国。"},
51848:{"w":"educate","e":"Parents should educate their children to be honest and kind to others.","t":"父母应该**教育**孩子诚实、善待他人。"},
51849:{"w":"lamb","e":"In spring, the farmer's sheep gave birth to five lambs on the hill.","t":"春天，农场主的羊在山坡上生了五只**小羊**。"},
51850:{"w":"frog","e":"On summer nights we could hear the frogs singing in the fields near our house.","t":"夏天的夜里，我们能听到房子附近田里的**青蛙**在叫。"},
51851:{"w":"drug","e":"The doctor gave him a new drug for his headache.","t":"医生给他开了一种治头痛的新**药**。"},
51852:{"w":"rent","e":"We decided to rent a small house near the sea.","t":"我们决定在海边**租**一间小房子。"},
51853:{"w":"northern","e":"It often snows in northern China during the winter months.","t":"冬季中国**北部**经常下雪。"},
51854:{"w":"disappointing","e":"The students find the exhibition disappointing.","t":"学生们觉得这个展览**令人失望**。"},
51855:{"w":"yeah","e":"“Yeah, I saw him at school this morning,” said Jack.","t":"“**对**，我今天早上在学校看到他了。”杰克说。"},
51856:{"w":"album","e":"My mother keeps all our family photos in a big old album.","t":"妈妈把我们所有的家庭照片都放在一本旧的大**相册**里。"},
51857:{"w":"garage","e":"My father parks the car in the garage every night.","t":"爸爸每天晚上都把车停在**车库**里。"},
51858:{"w":"prison","e":"The thief was sent to prison for three years after he stole the car.","t":"小偷偷了那辆车后，被送进**监狱**关了三年。"},
51859:{"w":"fog","e":"The fog was so thick this morning that drivers could hardly see the road ahead.","t":"今天早上**雾气**很浓，司机几乎看不清前面的路。"},
51860:{"w":"few","e":"Very few people came to the park on that cold day.","t":"那天很冷，**很少**有人来公园。"},
51861:{"w":"itself","e":"The cat can get out of the box by itself.","t":"猫**自己**就能从箱子里出来。"},
51862:{"w":"fun","e":"The games at the class party last night were full of fun.","t":"昨晚班级聚会上的游戏充满了**乐趣**。"},
51863:{"w":"quiet","e":"Please be quiet when you walk past the baby's room.","t":"经过宝宝房间时请保持**安静**。"},
51864:{"w":"short","e":"It is a short walk from the bus stop to school.","t":"从公交站走到学校，路程很**短**。"},
51865:{"w":"truth","e":"She told her parents the truth about the broken window.","t":"她把窗户被打破的**事实**告诉了父母。"},
51866:{"w":"prefer","e":"I prefer tea to coffee, especially in the evening.","t":"我**更喜欢**茶而不是咖啡，尤其是在晚上。"},
51867:{"w":"shoe","e":"I cannot find my other shoe anywhere in the house.","t":"我在家里到处都找不到另一只**鞋**。"},
51868:{"w":"relative","e":"We are going to visit a relative in London next week.","t":"下周我们要去伦敦看望一位**亲戚**。"},
51869:{"w":"shower","e":"I always take a shower after playing football with my friends.","t":"和朋友踢完足球后，我总会去**洗澡**。"},
51870:{"w":"from","e":"My cousin comes from a small village near the sea.","t":"我表哥**来自**海边的一个小村庄。"},
51871:{"w":"cold","e":"The water in the lake was too cold for swimming.","t":"湖水太**冷**，没法游泳。"},
51872:{"w":"magazine","e":"I read a story in a magazine on the train.","t":"我在火车上读了一篇**杂志**上的故事。"},
51873:{"w":"stone","e":"We used a small stone to hold the paper down.","t":"我们用一块小**石头**压住了那张纸。"},
51874:{"w":"window","e":"Please open the window and let in some fresh air.","t":"请把**窗户**打开，让新鲜空气进来。"},
51875:{"w":"tail","e":"The cat's tail moved slowly as it watched the bird.","t":"猫盯着那只鸟，**尾巴**慢慢摆动。"},
51876:{"w":"develop","e":"Reading every day can help you develop better language skills.","t":"每天阅读可以帮助你**提高**语言能力。"},
51877:{"w":"angry","e":"My mother was angry because I came home two hours late without calling.","t":"妈妈很**生气**，因为我晚归了两个小时，也没打电话。"},
51878:{"w":"please","e":"Please close the door when you leave the room.","t":"离开房间时，**请**把门关上。"},
51879:{"w":"close","e":"My best friend lives close to my school, so we walk home together.","t":"我最好的朋友住得离学校很**近**，所以我们一起走路回家。"},
51880:{"w":"plant","e":"We plant trees on the hill every spring.","t":"每年春天我们都在山上**种植**树木。"},
51881:{"w":"page","e":"Please read the first page of the story before class.","t":"请在上课前读一下这个故事的第一**页**。"},
51882:{"w":"freeze","e":"The lake freezes every winter, so we can skate on it.","t":"这个湖每年冬天都会**结冰**，所以我们可以在上面滑冰。"},
51883:{"w":"afraid","e":"Many children are afraid of the dark and want a light on at night.","t":"许多孩子**害怕**黑暗，晚上想开着灯。"},
51884:{"w":"help","e":"Can you help me carry these boxes upstairs?","t":"你能**帮**我把这些箱子搬上楼吗？"},
51885:{"w":"voluntary","e":"Taking part in the school show is voluntary for everyone.","t":"是否参加学校演出由大家**自愿**决定。"},
51886:{"w":"either","e":"You can choose either book, because both of them are good.","t":"你可以选**任何一本**，因为两本都不错。"},
51887:{"w":"out","e":"The children ran out to play in the snow after lunch.","t":"午饭后，孩子们跑**出去**玩雪。"},
51888:{"w":"meter","e":"The new shelf is almost one meter above the floor.","t":"新装的架子离地面差不多有一**米**。"},
51889:{"w":"box","e":"My little brother keeps his toy cars in this box.","t":"我弟弟把他的玩具车放在这个**盒子**里。"},
51890:{"w":"fill","e":"Please fill the bottle with water before the trip.","t":"出发之前请把瓶子**装满**水。"},
51891:{"w":"place","e":"This is a quiet place where students can read and think.","t":"这是一个学生可以阅读和思考的安静**地方**。"},
51892:{"w":"fridge","e":"Please put the milk back in the fridge after breakfast.","t":"吃完早饭，请把牛奶放回**冰箱**。"},
51893:{"w":"chat","e":"My sister likes to chat with her friends after school.","t":"我姐姐放学后喜欢和朋友**聊天**。"},
51894:{"w":"rubbish","e":"Please put your rubbish in the bin before you leave the classroom.","t":"离开教室前，请把你的**垃圾**扔进垃圾桶。"},
51895:{"w":"plane","e":"We took a plane to Beijing to visit my grandparents.","t":"我们坐**飞机**去北京看望爷爷奶奶。"},
51896:{"w":"point","e":"The teacher pointed at the map and showed us where the river begins.","t":"老师**指**着地图，告诉我们这条河从哪里发源。"},
51897:{"w":"postcard","e":"My friend sent me a postcard from London last week.","t":"上周，朋友从伦敦给我寄来一张**明信片**。"},
51898:{"w":"gas","e":"We use gas to cook dinner in our kitchen every day.","t":"我们每天在厨房里用**燃气**做晚饭。"},
51899:{"w":"truck","e":"A big truck stopped outside our school early this morning.","t":"今天一早，一辆大**卡车**停在了我们学校外面。"},
51900:{"w":"joke","e":"My uncle tells a funny joke every time the family has dinner together.","t":"每次全家一起吃饭，我叔叔都会讲一个有趣的**笑话**。"},
51901:{"w":"spoon","e":"She stirred her tea slowly with a small spoon.","t":"她用一把小**勺**慢慢搅着茶。"},
51902:{"w":"manner","e":"The teacher spoke to the nervous new student in a kind and gentle manner.","t":"老师用亲切温和的**方式**跟紧张的新同学说话。"},
51903:{"w":"graduate","e":"My brother will graduate from university in June this year.","t":"哥哥今年六月就要从大学**毕业**了。"},
51904:{"w":"pleasure","e":"It gives me great pleasure to welcome you to our school.","t":"欢迎你来到我们学校，我感到非常**高兴**。"},
51905:{"w":"success","e":"Hard work is the key to success.","t":"努力是**成功**的关键。"},
51906:{"w":"field","e":"We ran across an open field on our way home.","t":"回家的路上，我们跑过一片开阔的**田野**。"},
51907:{"w":"grandfather","e":"My grandfather often tells us stories about his childhood.","t":"**爷爷**经常给我们讲他小时候的故事。"},
51908:{"w":"grandmother","e":"My grandmother taught me how to make noodles last weekend.","t":"上周末，**奶奶**教我怎么做面条。"},
51909:{"w":"at","e":"My mother has been waiting for us at the station for half an hour.","t":"妈妈已经**在**车站等了我们半个小时。"},
51910:{"w":"year","e":"I learned to ride a bike in less than a year.","t":"我用了不到一**年**就学会了骑自行车。"},
51911:{"w":"turtle","e":"We saw a turtle swimming in the sea near our boat.","t":"我们看见一只**海龟**在船旁的海里游。"},
51912:{"w":"humorous","e":"Our English teacher is so humorous that everyone laughs in her classes.","t":"我们的英语老师非常**幽默**，大家在她的课上都会笑。"},
51913:{"w":"possibly","e":"She could possibly be at the library with her friends.","t":"她**可能**和朋友们在图书馆。"},
51914:{"w":"trash","e":"Please take out the trash before you go to school this morning.","t":"今天早上上学前请把**垃圾**拿出去倒掉。"},
51915:{"w":"lighting","e":"The lighting in our classroom is bright enough for reading.","t":"我们教室的**灯光**够亮，适合阅读。"},
51916:{"w":"outdoor","e":"Our school holds an outdoor concert in the park every spring.","t":"我们学校每年春天都在公园举办一场**露天**音乐会。"},
51917:{"w":"concentrate","e":"I can't concentrate on my homework when the TV is on in the next room.","t":"隔壁房间开着电视时，我没法**专心**写作业。"},
51918:{"w":"gum","e":"Please do not chew gum in class or leave it under your desk.","t":"上课时请不要嚼**口香糖**，也不要把它粘在课桌下面。"},
51919:{"w":"department","e":"My sister teaches in the English department at the university.","t":"我姐姐在那所大学的英语**系**教书。"},
51920:{"w":"clothing","e":"You should wear warm clothing when you go skiing in winter.","t":"冬天去滑雪时，你应该穿保暖的**衣服**。"},
51921:{"w":"energetic","e":"My little brother is very energetic and runs around all day.","t":"弟弟**精力充沛**，整天跑来跑去。"},
51922:{"w":"effect","e":"The new rule has had a good effect on the students' reading habits.","t":"这项新规定对学生的阅读习惯产生了良好的**影响**。"},
51923:{"w":"back","e":"Please put the book back on the shelf when you finish reading it.","t":"看完书请把它放**回**书架上。"},
51924:{"w":"strong","e":"My sister is strong enough to carry the heavy box alone.","t":"姐姐很**强壮**，能一个人搬动这个重箱子。"},
51925:{"w":"college","e":"My sister went to college in a city near our home.","t":"姐姐去了离我们家不远的一座城市上**大学**。"},
51926:{"w":"white","e":"We wore white shirts to sing at the school concert.","t":"我们穿着**白色的**衬衫在学校音乐会上唱歌。"},
51927:{"w":"knee","e":"He fell off his bike and hurt his knee badly.","t":"他从自行车上摔下来，把**膝盖**伤得很重。"},
51928:{"w":"part","e":"Reading is an important part of learning a foreign language.","t":"阅读是学习一门外语的重要**部分**。"},
51929:{"w":"nobody","e":"Nobody knew where the cat had gone.","t":"**没有人**知道猫去了哪里。"},
51930:{"w":"kiss","e":"The little girl gave her grandmother a kiss and ran off to play.","t":"小女孩给了奶奶一个**吻**，然后跑去玩了。"},
51931:{"w":"upon","e":"A cat was sitting upon the roof of the garage.","t":"一只猫坐在车库的屋顶**上**。"},
51932:{"w":"weak","e":"I felt too weak to get out of bed yesterday.","t":"昨天我觉得太**虚弱**，连床都下不了。"},
51933:{"w":"socialism","e":"The students learned about the history of socialism in their politics class this term.","t":"这学期学生们在政治课上学习了**社会主义**的历史。"},
51934:{"w":"fool","e":"Only a fool would swim in the sea during such a big storm.","t":"只有**傻瓜**才会在这么大的风暴中去海里游泳。"},
51935:{"w":"reason","e":"Please tell me the reason why you were late for class.","t":"请告诉我你上课迟到的**原因**。"},
51936:{"w":"picture","e":"We took a picture of the whole class after lunch.","t":"午饭后我们给全班拍了一张**照片**。"},
51937:{"w":"than","e":"My brother is taller than my father.","t":"我哥哥**比**我爸爸高。"},
51938:{"w":"OK","e":"“OK, we can play outside after lunch,” my dad said.","t":"爸爸说：“**好**，我们吃完午饭可以出去玩。”"},
51939:{"w":"yourself","e":"Did you make this beautiful birthday card all by yourself?","t":"这张漂亮的生日卡是你**自己**做的吗？"},
51940:{"w":"give","e":"Please give this note to your teacher after lunch today.","t":"今天午饭后，请把这张纸条交**给**你的老师。"},
51941:{"w":"cloud","e":"A large cloud covered the sun while we were outside.","t":"我们在外面时，一大朵**云**遮住了太阳。"},
51942:{"w":"send","e":"I will send you the photos by email as soon as I get home.","t":"我一到家就用电子邮件把照片**寄**给你。"},
51943:{"w":"instruction","e":"The students must follow all instructions exactly.","t":"学生必须准确遵守所有的**指示**。"},
51944:{"w":"dress","e":"She wore a long blue dress to her cousin's wedding.","t":"她穿了一条蓝色的长**连衣裙**去参加表姐的婚礼。"},
51945:{"w":"separate","e":"Please separate the clean clothes from the dirty ones.","t":"请把干净衣服和脏衣服**分开**。"},
51946:{"w":"now","e":"You can open your birthday present now if you want.","t":"你想的话，**现在**就可以拆生日礼物。"},
51947:{"w":"theater","e":"We watched a play at the theater near our school.","t":"我们在学校附近的**剧场**看了一场戏。"},
51948:{"w":"mine","e":"My uncle works in a coal mine in the north of the country.","t":"我叔叔在这个国家北部的一座**煤矿**里工作。"},
51949:{"w":"world","e":"People around the world use the internet to share ideas.","t":"**世界**各地的人都用互联网交流想法。"},
51950:{"w":"ring","e":"My grandmother wears a small gold ring on her left hand.","t":"奶奶左手戴着一枚小**戒指**，是金的。"},
51951:{"w":"learn","e":"We learn about different cultures in our geography class every week.","t":"我们每周在地理课上**学习**不同的文化。"},
51952:{"w":"charity","e":"Our school collected books for a charity that helps children.","t":"我们学校为一家帮助儿童的**慈善机构**募集了图书。"},
51953:{"w":"purple","e":"She wore a purple dress to the party, which matched the flowers in her hair.","t":"她穿了一条**紫色**连衣裙去参加聚会，和她头发上的花很相配。"},
51954:{"w":"school","e":"My brother walks to school with his friends every morning.","t":"弟弟每天早上都和朋友一起步行去**学校**。"},
51955:{"w":"daily","e":"She goes for a short walk by the river as part of her daily routine.","t":"她沿着河边短暂散步，这是她**日常**作息的一部分。"},
51956:{"w":"celebrate","e":"We celebrate the Spring Festival with a big family dinner every year.","t":"我们每年都用一顿丰盛的家宴来**庆祝**春节。"},
51957:{"w":"text","e":"Please read the text on page ten before answering the questions.","t":"请先阅读第十页的**文章**，再回答问题。"},
51958:{"w":"proper","e":"It is important to use the proper tools when you repair a bicycle.","t":"修自行车时，用**合适的**工具很重要。"},
51959:{"w":"health","e":"Eating fruit and taking exercise are good for your health.","t":"吃水果和锻炼对你的**健康**有好处。"},
51960:{"w":"movie","e":"We watched a funny movie at home on Friday night.","t":"星期五晚上，我们在家看了一部有趣的**电影**。"},
51961:{"w":"goodbye","e":"We said goodbye to our friends at the train station.","t":"我们在火车站和朋友们**道别**。"},
51962:{"w":"wheel","e":"One wheel came off the cart, so we had to stop.","t":"一个**车轮**从小车上掉了下来，所以我们只好停下。"},
51963:{"w":"mall","e":"We bought a birthday gift for Dad at the mall.","t":"我们在**购物中心**给爸爸买了一份生日礼物。"},
51964:{"w":"fix","e":"My father fixed the broken bike in less than an hour.","t":"爸爸不到一小时就把坏掉的自行车**修好**了。"},
51965:{"w":"poem","e":"Every student had to learn a short poem by heart for the class.","t":"每个学生都得为这堂课背一首简短的**诗歌**。"},
51966:{"w":"sentence","e":"Write one sentence about what you did at the weekend.","t":"用一个**句子**写写你周末做了什么。"},
51967:{"w":"per cent","e":"Ten per cent of the students ride their bikes to school.","t":"**百分之**十的学生骑自行车上学。"},
51968:{"w":"impress","e":"The young singer's beautiful voice impressed everyone in the hall.","t":"这位年轻歌手美妙的歌声给大厅里的每个人都**留下深刻印象**。"},
51969:{"w":"chop","e":"Please chop the onions and carrots into small pieces for the soup.","t":"请把洋葱和胡萝卜**切碎**，用来煮汤。"},
51970:{"w":"licence","e":"You have to be at least eighteen to get a driving licence in China.","t":"在中国，你必须年满十八岁才能考取驾驶**执照**。"},
51971:{"w":"habitat","e":"The forest is a natural habitat for many wild animals.","t":"这片森林是许多野生动物的天然**栖息地**。"},
51972:{"w":"alien","e":"The children drew a picture of an alien from Mars.","t":"孩子们画了一个来自火星的**外星人**。"},
51973:{"w":"popcorn","e":"We shared a big bag of popcorn during the film.","t":"看电影时，我们一起吃了一大袋**爆米花**。"},
51974:{"w":"sour","e":"The milk has turned sour because I forgot to put it in the fridge.","t":"牛奶**变酸**了，因为我忘了把它放进冰箱。"},
51975:{"w":"airline","e":"My aunt works for an airline and often visits other countries.","t":"我阿姨在一家**航空公司**工作，经常去别的国家。"},
51976:{"w":"hey","e":"“Hey, do you want to play football after school today?”","t":"“**嘿**，今天放学后你想踢足球吗？”"},
51977:{"w":"suitcase","e":"I packed my clothes in a suitcase before the trip.","t":"出发旅行前，我把衣服装进了**手提箱**。"},
51978:{"w":"hike","e":"My classmates want to hike through the forest in summer.","t":"我们班同学想在夏天**徒步**穿越森林。"},
51979:{"w":"grade","e":"She got good grades in all her subjects this term.","t":"这学期她所有科目的**成绩**都不错。"},
51980:{"w":"lantern","e":"We hung a red lantern by the door before the festival.","t":"节日前，我们在门边挂了一盏红**灯笼**。"},
51981:{"w":"road","e":"Look both ways before you cross the road near school.","t":"在学校附近过**马路**前，要先看看两边。"},
51982:{"w":"result","e":"She was very happy with the result of her final exam this term.","t":"她对这学期期末考试的**结果**很满意。"},
51983:{"w":"football","e":"My cousins play football in the park every Saturday morning.","t":"我的表兄弟每周六早上都在公园踢**足球**。"},
51984:{"w":"any","e":"Do you have any questions about the homework?","t":"关于作业，你有**任何**问题吗？"},
51985:{"w":"room","e":"Please turn off the light before you leave the room.","t":"离开**房间**前请把灯关掉。"},
51986:{"w":"cause","e":"Heavy rain can cause floods in low areas near the river.","t":"大雨会在河边的低洼地区**引起**洪水。"},
51987:{"w":"bad","e":"It was a bad idea to go out without an umbrella.","t":"没带伞就出门是个**坏**主意。"},
51988:{"w":"holiday","e":"We went to the seaside for a holiday last week.","t":"上星期我们去了海边**度假**。"},
51989:{"w":"draw","e":"She likes to draw pictures of animals in her free time.","t":"她空闲时喜欢**画**动物的画。"},
51990:{"w":"create","e":"The students will create a short video about their school.","t":"学生们要**制作**一段关于自己学校的短视频。"},
51991:{"w":"wish","e":"I wish you all the best in your new job.","t":"**祝愿**你在新工作中一切顺利。"},
51992:{"w":"exam","e":"I studied hard all week for the history exam.","t":"我整整一周都在为历史**考试**用功复习。"},
51993:{"w":"art","e":"We made paper flowers in our art class last Friday.","t":"上周五，我们在**美术**课上做了纸花。"},
51994:{"w":"sweet","e":"These peaches are so sweet that the children want more.","t":"这些桃子真**甜**，孩子们还想再吃。"},
51995:{"w":"donate","e":"We will donate these old books to the school library.","t":"我们会把这些旧书**捐赠**给学校图书馆。"},
51996:{"w":"too","e":"I like swimming, and my sister likes it too.","t":"我喜欢游泳，我妹妹**也**喜欢。"},
51997:{"w":"him","e":"Ben lost his pencil, so I gave him a new one.","t":"本把铅笔弄丢了，所以我给了**他**一支新的。"},
51998:{"w":"rule","e":"The new rule says that students must wear a uniform on Mondays.","t":"新**规定**要求学生周一穿校服。"},
51999:{"w":"autumn","e":"We often go to the park to see the leaves in autumn.","t":"**秋天**我们常去公园看树叶。"},
52000:{"w":"these","e":"These books belong to our school, so please look after them.","t":"**这些**书是我们学校的，请爱护它们。"},
52001:{"w":"advertisement","e":"The advertisement on the bus showed a smiling family eating breakfast together.","t":"公交车上的**广告**画着一家人微笑着一起吃早餐。"},
52002:{"w":"whom","e":"To whom should I give this letter before the meeting starts?","t":"会议开始前，这封信我该交给**谁**？"},
52003:{"w":"rise","e":"The price of vegetables has risen sharply this winter.","t":"今年冬天蔬菜的价格**上涨**得很厉害。"},
52004:{"w":"term","e":"The new term begins in September, and we will have more homework.","t":"新**学期**九月开始，我们的作业会更多。"},
52005:{"w":"until","e":"I did not go to bed until I finished my homework.","t":"我**直到**做完作业才去睡觉。"},
52006:{"w":"pen","e":"I always carry a pen in my bag for class.","t":"我总在包里带一支**笔**，上课用。"},
52007:{"w":"tour","e":"We took a tour of the old town with our teacher.","t":"我们跟老师一起**游览**了那座古镇。"},
52008:{"w":"many","e":"Many children like to play in the park after school.","t":"放学后，**许多**孩子喜欢在公园里玩。"},
52009:{"w":"them","e":"My cousins are coming, and I bought some fruit for them.","t":"表兄弟们要来，我给**他们**买了些水果。"},
52010:{"w":"single","e":"There is not a single cloud in the sky today.","t":"今天天空中连**一朵**云也没有。"},
52011:{"w":"habit","e":"Brushing your teeth before bed is a good habit for your health.","t":"睡前刷牙是有益健康的好**习惯**。"},
52012:{"w":"calendar","e":"I marked my birthday on the calendar in our kitchen.","t":"我在厨房的**日历**上标出了我的生日。"},
52013:{"w":"hold","e":"Please hold the rope tightly with both hands, or you may fall into the river.","t":"请双手**握紧**绳子，否则你可能会掉进河里。"},
52014:{"w":"earthquake","e":"Many old buildings in the town fell down during the strong earthquake last night.","t":"在昨晚的强烈**地震**中，镇上许多老房子倒塌了。"},
52015:{"w":"collect","e":"We collect empty bottles to make things in art class.","t":"我们**收集**空瓶子，在美术课上做手工。"},
52016:{"w":"cash","e":"I don't have any cash with me, so I'll pay by card.","t":"我身上没带**现金**，所以刷卡付款。"},
52017:{"w":"poor","e":"Many people in the village were too poor to send their children to school.","t":"村里许多人太**穷**了，送不起孩子上学。"},
52018:{"w":"government","e":"The government plans to build more schools in the countryside.","t":"**政府**计划在农村多建一些学校。"},
52019:{"w":"suffer","e":"My uncle still suffers from back pain after the accident.","t":"事故之后，叔叔仍**饱受**背痛折磨。"},
52020:{"w":"dear","e":"Dear Anna, thank you for helping me with my homework.","t":"**亲爱的**安娜，谢谢你帮我做作业。"},
52021:{"w":"take","e":"Don't forget to take your umbrella, because it may rain later.","t":"别忘了**带**伞，因为待会儿可能下雨。"},
52022:{"w":"mirror","e":"She looked in the mirror before leaving for the party.","t":"出门去参加聚会前，她照了照**镜子**。"},
52023:{"w":"central","e":"Our hotel is in a central part of the city.","t":"我们住的酒店位于市**中心**。"},
52024:{"w":"yellow","e":"The girl in the yellow dress is my best friend.","t":"穿**黄色**连衣裙的那个女孩是我最好的朋友。"},
52025:{"w":"knowledge","e":"Reading books is a good way to gain knowledge.","t":"读书是获取**知识**的好方法。"},
52026:{"w":"victory","e":"Our team celebrated its first victory of the season with a big dinner.","t":"我们队用一顿丰盛的晚餐庆祝本赛季的第一场**胜利**。"},
52027:{"w":"wing","e":"The bird spread its wings and flew over the garden.","t":"那只鸟张开**翅膀**，飞过了花园。"},
52028:{"w":"sweater","e":"It was cold, so I put on a warm sweater.","t":"天气冷，所以我穿了件暖和的**毛衣**。"},
52029:{"w":"tasty","e":"This soup is really tasty, so I'd like another bowl.","t":"这汤**味道很好**，我想再来一碗。"},
52030:{"w":"marriage","e":"Their marriage was happy, and they spent many years together.","t":"他们的**婚姻**很幸福，两人一起生活了许多年。"},
52031:{"w":"unhealthy","e":"It is unhealthy to eat too much fast food every day.","t":"每天吃太多快餐**不健康**。"},
52032:{"w":"operation","e":"After the operation, my grandfather could walk without pain again.","t":"做完**手术**后，爷爷走路又不疼了。"},
52033:{"w":"coal","e":"Some homes use coal to stay warm in the winter.","t":"有些家庭用**煤**取暖过冬。"},
52034:{"w":"regular","e":"Regular exercise keeps you healthy and helps you sleep better.","t":"**经常**锻炼能让你保持健康，睡得更好。"},
52035:{"w":"polar","e":"Scientists study polar animals to learn how they stay warm.","t":"科学家研究**极地**动物，了解它们怎样保暖。"},
52036:{"w":"church","e":"We saw an old church next to the town square.","t":"我们在镇广场旁边看到了一座古老的**教堂**。"},
52037:{"w":"subway","e":"It is much faster to take the subway than a taxi during rush hour.","t":"在高峰时段，坐**地铁**比打车快多了。"},
52038:{"w":"pro","e":"My little brother dreams of becoming a pro in his favourite sport.","t":"弟弟梦想有朝一日在自己最喜欢的运动中成为**职业选手**。"},
52039:{"w":"haircut","e":"I am getting a haircut after school next Friday.","t":"下星期五放学后，我要去**理发**。"},
52040:{"w":"route","e":"This map shows the route across the mountains.","t":"这张地图上有穿越群山的**路线**。"},
52041:{"w":"landscape","e":"The landscape around the lake is so beautiful that many artists come here to paint.","t":"湖周围的**风景**非常美，许多画家来这里写生。"},
52042:{"w":"city","e":"We took the train to the city to visit a museum.","t":"我们坐火车进**城**去参观博物馆。"},
52043:{"w":"shape","e":"The cloud had the shape of a rabbit with long ears.","t":"那朵云的**形状**像一只长耳朵的兔子。"},
52044:{"w":"dead","e":"The leaves fell from the dead tree in the garden.","t":"花园里那棵**枯死的**树掉了叶子。"},
52045:{"w":"almost","e":"It was almost midnight when we finally got home from the airport.","t":"我们终于从机场回到家时，**差不多**已是午夜了。"},
52046:{"w":"thunder","e":"We heard thunder and saw bright flashes in the sky.","t":"我们听到了**雷声**，还看到天空中一道道亮光。"},
52047:{"w":"chance","e":"There is a good chance that it will rain tomorrow.","t":"明天下雨的**可能性**很大。"},
52048:{"w":"doubt","e":"I have no doubt that our team will win the match tomorrow.","t":"我毫不**怀疑**我们队明天会赢得比赛。"},
52049:{"w":"master","e":"It takes years of practice to master a musical instrument.","t":"想**掌握**一门乐器，需要多年的练习。"},
52050:{"w":"cheer","e":"The crowd began to cheer as the runners entered the stadium.","t":"运动员们进入体育场时，观众们开始**欢呼**。"},
52051:{"w":"across","e":"The children walked across the road with their teacher.","t":"孩子们和老师一起**穿过**了马路。"},
52052:{"w":"cake","e":"We made a chocolate cake for our mother's birthday.","t":"我们给妈妈做了个巧克力**蛋糕**庆祝生日。"},
52053:{"w":"yogurt","e":"I had some yogurt and an apple for breakfast today.","t":"我今天早饭喝了些**酸奶**，还吃了一个苹果。"},
52054:{"w":"taste","e":"The soup tastes better when you add a little salt.","t":"汤里加点盐，**尝起来**会更好喝。"},
52055:{"w":"circle","e":"The children sat in a circle on the grass and listened to the story.","t":"孩子们围成一个**圆圈**坐在草地上听故事。"},
52056:{"w":"medium","e":"Can I try on this shirt in a medium size?","t":"我可以试穿一下这件衬衫的**中号**吗？"},
52057:{"w":"greet","e":"The teacher stood at the door to greet every student with a smile.","t":"老师站在门口，微笑着**迎接**每一位学生。"},
52058:{"w":"dangerous","e":"It is dangerous to swim in the river after heavy rain.","t":"大雨过后在河里游泳很**危险**。"},
52059:{"w":"perfect","e":"Her English is almost perfect, and she speaks with no mistakes at all.","t":"她的英语几乎**完美**，说起来一点错误也没有。"},
52060:{"w":"lion","e":"We saw a lion sleeping under a tree at the zoo.","t":"我们在动物园看到一头**狮子**在树下睡觉。"},
52061:{"w":"coffee","e":"My mum usually drinks a cup of coffee after breakfast.","t":"妈妈通常在早饭后喝一杯**咖啡**。"},
52062:{"w":"thing","e":"Please put your things in your bag before you go.","t":"走之前，请把你的**东西**放进包里。"},
52063:{"w":"go","e":"We go to the library every Saturday to read and borrow books.","t":"我们每个周六都**去**图书馆看书、借书。"},
52064:{"w":"experience","e":"She has a lot of experience in teaching young children.","t":"她有很多教小孩子的**经验**。"},
52065:{"w":"serve","e":"The waiter served us tea and cakes as soon as we sat down.","t":"我们一坐下，服务员就**端上**了茶和蛋糕。"},
52066:{"w":"weak","e":"After the long illness, she was still too weak to walk far.","t":"久病之后，她还是太**虚弱**，走不了远路。"},
52067:{"w":"fish","e":"We watched the fish swim slowly around the small pond.","t":"我们看着**鱼**在小池塘里慢慢游动。"},
52068:{"w":"rapid","e":"We were surprised by the rapid change in the weather.","t":"天气变化得这么**快**，我们都很意外。"},
52069:{"w":"ride","e":"My brother and I ride our bikes to school together.","t":"我和弟弟一起**骑**自行车上学。"},
52070:{"w":"meaning","e":"If you don't know the meaning of a word, look it up in a dictionary.","t":"如果你不知道一个词的**意思**，就查查词典。"},
52071:{"w":"everyone","e":"Everyone in our class enjoyed the trip.","t":"我们班**每个人**都很喜欢这次旅行。"},
52072:{"w":"bin","e":"Please put your empty bottles in the green bin next to the door.","t":"请把空瓶子放进门边的绿色**垃圾箱**里。"},
52073:{"w":"moment","e":"Please wait a moment while I find your file.","t":"请稍等**片刻**，我去找你的文件。"},
52074:{"w":"bath","e":"I always take a hot bath before I go to bed.","t":"我睡觉前总要洗个热水**澡**。"},
52075:{"w":"bathroom","e":"I left my towel in the bathroom after my shower.","t":"洗完澡，我把毛巾落在**浴室**里了。"},
52076:{"w":"ancient","e":"We visited an ancient city on our school trip last week.","t":"上周学校组织旅行，我们参观了一座**古老的**城市。"},
52077:{"w":"park","e":"We had a picnic in the park on Sunday afternoon.","t":"星期天下午，我们在**公园**里野餐。"},
52078:{"w":"near","e":"There is a small park near my school where we play football.","t":"我的学校**附近**有一个小公园，我们在那里踢足球。"},
52079:{"w":"expensive","e":"This coat is too expensive for me, so I will not buy it.","t":"这件外套对我来说太**贵**了，所以我不买它。"},
52080:{"w":"journey","e":"The train journey took three hours, but we enjoyed it.","t":"这趟火车**旅程**花了三个小时，但我们很喜欢。"},
52081:{"w":"geography","e":"We learn about rivers and mountains in our geography class every Tuesday.","t":"我们每周二在**地理**课上学习河流和山脉。"},
52082:{"w":"skate","e":"We skate on the frozen lake every winter.","t":"每年冬天我们都在结冰的湖上**滑冰**。"},
52083:{"w":"sure","e":"I am sure that she will pass the test because she has studied hard.","t":"我**确信**她会通过考试，因为她学习很努力。"},
52084:{"w":"emergency","e":"If it's an emergency, you can phone at any time.","t":"如果发生**紧急情况**，你可以随时来电。"},
52085:{"w":"cry","e":"The baby began to cry when his mother left the room.","t":"妈妈离开房间时，婴儿开始**哭**了。"},
52086:{"w":"first","e":"I was the first person to finish the test today.","t":"今天我是**第一**个做完测验的人。"},
52087:{"w":"among","e":"I saw my little brother among the children in the playground.","t":"我在操场的孩子们**当中**看到了弟弟。"},
52088:{"w":"carry","e":"We advised the students to carry either euros or dollars.","t":"我们建议学生**带**欧元或美元。"},
52089:{"w":"office","e":"Our teacher asked us to go to her office after class.","t":"老师让我们下课后去她的**办公室**。"},
52090:{"w":"Mrs","e":"Mrs Green teaches English at the school near our home.","t":"格林**太太**在我们家附近的学校教英语。"},
52091:{"w":"stupid","e":"It was stupid of me to leave my phone on the bus.","t":"我把手机落在公共汽车上，真是太**愚蠢**了。"},
52092:{"w":"wine","e":"We bought a bottle of wine for my uncle's birthday.","t":"我们买了一瓶**葡萄酒**给叔叔庆祝生日。"},
52093:{"w":"guilty","e":"I felt guilty about forgetting my best friend's birthday party last Saturday.","t":"上周六我忘了最好朋友的生日聚会，心里很**内疚**。"},
52094:{"w":"obey","e":"We must obey the school rules even when nobody is watching.","t":"就算没人看着，我们也必须**遵守**校规。"},
52095:{"w":"microwave","e":"She heated the soup in the microwave for two minutes.","t":"她把汤放进**微波炉**里加热了两分钟。"},
52096:{"w":"oak","e":"We sat under the big oak to eat our lunch.","t":"我们坐在那棵大**橡树**下吃午饭。"},
52097:{"w":"spot","e":"You'll spot the cinema right next to the underground station.","t":"你会**发现**这家电影院就在地铁站旁边。"},
52098:{"w":"fry","e":"The cook fried the fish in hot oil until it turned golden.","t":"厨师把鱼放进热油里**油炸**，直到变成金黄色。"},
52099:{"w":"transportation","e":"Public transportation makes it easy to get around our city.","t":"有了公共**交通**，在我们城里出行很方便。"},
52100:{"w":"novel","e":"My sister finished reading the novel on the bus home.","t":"姐姐在回家的公交车上读完了那本**小说**。"},
52101:{"w":"stress","e":"Students often feel stress before important exams, so they need time to relax.","t":"学生在重要考试前常常感到**压力**，所以需要时间放松。"},
52102:{"w":"fever","e":"I had a fever last night and could not sleep.","t":"我昨晚**发烧**了，睡不着。"},
52103:{"w":"island","e":"We took a small boat to the island last summer.","t":"去年夏天，我们乘一艘小船去了那座**岛**。"},
52104:{"w":"provide","e":"The hotel provides free breakfast for all guests who stay more than two nights.","t":"这家酒店为所有住两晚以上的客人**提供**免费早餐。"},
52105:{"w":"energy","e":"Children have so much energy that they can run around all day.","t":"孩子们**精力**充沛，可以整天跑来跑去。"},
52106:{"w":"ourselves","e":"We painted the walls ourselves while our parents were away.","t":"父母不在时，我们**自己**刷了墙。"},
52107:{"w":"bowl","e":"Please put the apples in the blue bowl for me.","t":"请帮我把苹果放进那个蓝色的**碗**里。"},
52108:{"w":"carrot","e":"Rabbits love eating carrots, so we feed our pet rabbit one every morning.","t":"兔子爱吃**胡萝卜**，所以我们每天早上喂宠物兔一根。"},
52109:{"w":"reach","e":"The little boy could not reach the top shelf of the bookcase.","t":"小男孩**够不到**书柜的最上层。"},
52110:{"w":"partner","e":"In English class, we practise speaking with a partner for ten minutes every day.","t":"英语课上，我们每天和**搭档**练习口语十分钟。"},
52111:{"w":"strict","e":"Our teacher is strict about homework, but she is also very kind.","t":"我们的老师对作业要求很**严格**，但她也很和蔼。"},
52112:{"w":"ready","e":"Dinner is ready, so please wash your hands and come to the table.","t":"晚饭**准备好了**，请洗洗手来吃饭。"},
52113:{"w":"chalk","e":"The teacher wrote my name on the board with chalk.","t":"老师用**粉笔**把我的名字写在黑板上。"},
52114:{"w":"desk","e":"I left the finished homework on my desk last night.","t":"昨晚我把做完的作业放在**书桌**上了。"},
52115:{"w":"tell","e":"Please tell me the truth about what happened in the classroom.","t":"请**告诉**我教室里发生的事情的真相。"},
52116:{"w":"print","e":"Please print this report and bring it to the meeting.","t":"请把这份报告**打印**出来，带到会上。"},
52117:{"w":"sport","e":"My favourite sport is basketball, and I play every weekend.","t":"我最喜欢的**运动**是篮球，每个周末我都打。"},
52118:{"w":"spell","e":"Can you spell your name for me before I write it?","t":"我写之前，你能把名字**拼**给我听吗？"},
52119:{"w":"king","e":"The king lived in a tall castle by the sea.","t":"**国王**住在海边一座高高的城堡里。"},
52120:{"w":"juice","e":"Would you like some apple juice with your lunch today?","t":"你今天午饭想喝点苹果**汁**吗？"},
52121:{"w":"notebook","e":"I always carry a small notebook so I can write down new words.","t":"我总是随身带个小**笔记本**，好把生词记下来。"},
52122:{"w":"before","e":"Please remember to wash your hands before you have dinner tonight.","t":"今晚吃饭**之前**请记得洗手。"},
52123:{"w":"test","e":"We have a spelling test every Friday morning.","t":"我们每个星期五早上都有拼写**测试**。"},
52124:{"w":"pass","e":"Could you pass me the salt, please?","t":"请把盐**递**给我好吗？"},
52125:{"w":"balance","e":"It is hard to balance schoolwork with sports, but good planning helps.","t":"要**平衡**学业和运动不容易，但好的规划会有帮助。"},
52126:{"w":"robot","e":"The robot can clean the floor by itself.","t":"这个**机器人**能自己打扫地板。"},
52127:{"w":"seat","e":"Excuse me, is this seat free?","t":"打扰一下，这个**座位**有人吗？"},
52128:{"w":"creative","e":"Our art teacher always encourages us to be creative and try new ways of painting.","t":"美术老师总是鼓励我们要有**创造性**，尝试新的画法。"},
52129:{"w":"time","e":"It is time to go home and get some rest.","t":"到回家休息的**时候**了。"},
52130:{"w":"ping-pong","e":"We often play ping-pong after lunch in the school gym.","t":"我们经常午饭后在学校体育馆打**乒乓球**。"},
52131:{"w":"glad","e":"I'm glad to see you again after such a long time.","t":"时隔这么久又见到你，我很**高兴**。"},
52132:{"w":"crazy","e":"Everyone thought the plan was crazy, but it worked in the end.","t":"大家都觉得这个计划很**疯狂**，但最后却成功了。"},
52133:{"w":"interview","e":"Lily has an interview for a summer job this Friday.","t":"莉莉本周五要去**面试**一份暑期工作。"},
52134:{"w":"compare","e":"Let's compare our answers before we give them to the teacher.","t":"把答案交给老师前，我们先**比一比**。"},
52135:{"w":"sea","e":"We could see the sea from the window of our hotel.","t":"我们从酒店的窗户能看到**大海**。"},
52136:{"w":"use","e":"The use of solar energy is becoming more common in many countries.","t":"太阳能的**利用**在许多国家越来越普遍。"},
52137:{"w":"inside","e":"The keys are inside the drawer under the desk.","t":"钥匙在书桌下面那个抽屉的**里面**。"},
52138:{"w":"athlete","e":"The athlete trained every day to get ready for the race.","t":"这位**运动员**每天训练，为比赛做准备。"},
52139:{"w":"whole","e":"We spent the whole afternoon cleaning up our school garden.","t":"我们花了**整个**下午打扫学校的花园。"},
52140:{"w":"thick","e":"The walls of the old castle are so thick that it stays cool inside in summer.","t":"古堡的墙**厚实**得很，夏天里面依然凉快。"},
52141:{"w":"share","e":"I share a room with my younger brother.","t":"我和弟弟**共用**一个房间。"},
52142:{"w":"online","e":"We bought the train tickets online before leaving the house.","t":"出门前，我们在**网上**买了火车票。"},
52143:{"w":"big","e":"We found a big box for all the old toys.","t":"我们找了个**大**箱子来装所有的旧玩具。"},
52144:{"w":"somebody","e":"Somebody left a red umbrella in the classroom, so I took it to the office.","t":"**有人**把一把红伞落在了教室里，我就把它送到了办公室。"},
52145:{"w":"mouth","e":"The little boy covered his mouth when he started laughing.","t":"小男孩笑起来时捂住了**嘴**。"},
52146:{"w":"noon","e":"We stopped for lunch at noon after a long walk.","t":"走了很久后，我们在**中午**停下来吃午饭。"},
52147:{"w":"importance","e":"Our teacher often talks about the importance of sleep for students.","t":"老师常常谈到睡眠对学生的**重要性**。"},
52148:{"w":"fence","e":"There is a white fence around the garden.","t":"花园周围有一圈白色的**篱笆**。"},
52149:{"w":"entertainment","e":"Movies and music are popular forms of entertainment for teenagers.","t":"电影和音乐是青少年常见的**娱乐**方式。"},
52150:{"w":"attitude","e":"Her positive attitude helps her stay calm even when things go wrong.","t":"她积极的**态度**让她即使事情出了问题也能保持冷静。"},
52151:{"w":"crowd","e":"A crowd waited outside the cinema to see the actor.","t":"一**群人**等在电影院外，想见那位演员。"},
52152:{"w":"soccer","e":"My little brother plays soccer with his friends every Saturday.","t":"弟弟每星期六都和朋友们一起踢**足球**。"},
52153:{"w":"monster","e":"In the story, a green monster lives under the bridge.","t":"故事里有一只绿色的**怪物**住在桥下。"},
52154:{"w":"spotlight","e":"The singer stood under a bright spotlight on the stage.","t":"歌手站在舞台上耀眼的**聚光灯**下。"},
52155:{"w":"coat","e":"It was cold, so I took my coat to school.","t":"天气很冷，所以我带着**外套**去上学了。"},
52156:{"w":"enter","e":"Please knock before you enter the room.","t":"请在**进入**房间前先敲门。"},
52157:{"w":"chemistry","e":"We learned how soap works in our chemistry class today.","t":"今天我们在**化学**课上学了肥皂的作用原理。"},
52158:{"w":"storm","e":"We stayed inside until the storm passed in the afternoon.","t":"我们待在屋里，直到下午**暴风雨**过去。"},
52159:{"w":"interest","e":"She has a strong interest in animals and reads about them.","t":"她对动物很**感兴趣**，常读与动物有关的书。"},
52160:{"w":"challenge","e":"It was a real challenge to finish the race in the rain.","t":"在雨中跑完全程是个不小的**挑战**。"},
52161:{"w":"put","e":"Please put your bags on the shelf at the back of the room.","t":"请把你们的书包**放**在教室后面的架子上。"},
52162:{"w":"show","e":"Please show your ticket to the officer at the gate.","t":"请向门口的工作人员**出示**车票。"},
52163:{"w":"treasure","e":"The children found an old box full of treasure on the beach.","t":"孩子们在海滩上发现了一个装满**财宝**的旧箱子。"},
52164:{"w":"basket","e":"I put the apples in a basket by the door.","t":"我把苹果放进了门边的**篮子**里。"},
52165:{"w":"high","e":"The wall is too high for the dog to jump over.","t":"这堵墙太**高**了，狗跳不过去。"},
52166:{"w":"deal","e":"She has to deal with a lot of emails every morning.","t":"她每天早上都要**处理**很多电子邮件。"},
52167:{"w":"why","e":"Why are you late for school again?","t":"你**为什么**又上学迟到了？"},
52168:{"w":"apple","e":"I ate an apple on the way home from school.","t":"我放学回家的路上吃了一个**苹果**。"},
52169:{"w":"sometimes","e":"My father sometimes cooks dinner when my mother works late.","t":"妈妈加班时，爸爸**有时**会做晚饭。"},
52170:{"w":"dark","e":"The room was so dark that I could see nothing.","t":"房间里太**暗**了，我什么也看不见。"},
52171:{"w":"sun","e":"The sun came out just as we left the house.","t":"我们刚出门，**太阳**就出来了。"},
52172:{"w":"congratulation","e":"Congratulations on winning the first prize in the speech contest!","t":"**祝贺**你在演讲比赛中获得一等奖！"},
52173:{"w":"mouse","e":"We saw a mouse run under the table last night.","t":"昨晚我们看到一只**老鼠**跑到了桌子底下。"},
52174:{"w":"excuse","e":"He gave a poor excuse for being late, and the teacher was not happy.","t":"他为迟到找了个蹩脚的**借口**，老师不太高兴。"},
52175:{"w":"choose","e":"You must choose between the red bag and the blue one.","t":"你必须在红色的包和蓝色的包之间**选择**。"},
52176:{"w":"secret","e":"It is a secret, so please do not tell anyone about our plan.","t":"这是个**秘密**，所以请不要把我们的计划告诉任何人。"},
52177:{"w":"job","e":"My uncle got a new job at the train station.","t":"叔叔在火车站找到了一份新**工作**。"},
52178:{"w":"lead","e":"This little road will lead you to the town centre.","t":"这条小路**通向**镇中心。"},
52179:{"w":"once","e":"I have been to Shanghai only once, when I was ten.","t":"我只去过上海**一次**，那时我十岁。"},
52180:{"w":"by","e":"I must be home by six o'clock because my parents are waiting for me.","t":"我必须在六点**以前**到家，因为父母在等我。"},
52181:{"w":"evening","e":"We went for a walk by the river in the evening.","t":"**傍晚**我们去河边散步了。"},
52182:{"w":"gift","e":"My aunt gave me a lovely gift on my birthday.","t":"生日那天，姑姑送了我一份可爱的**礼物**。"},
52183:{"w":"add","e":"Add a little salt to the soup, and it will taste better.","t":"往汤里**加**一点盐，味道会更好。"},
52184:{"w":"luck","e":"I wish you the best of luck in tomorrow's final English exam.","t":"祝你在明天的英语期末考试中**好运**。"},
52185:{"w":"act","e":"The doctor had to act fast to save the boy's life.","t":"医生必须迅速**行动**，才能挽救这个男孩的生命。"},
52186:{"w":"talk","e":"We talk about our plans for the summer holiday every Friday.","t":"每个星期五，我们都会**谈论**暑假的计划。"},
52187:{"w":"count","e":"Every vote counts in the class election.","t":"在班级选举中，每一票都**很重要**。"},
52188:{"w":"rope","e":"We used a rope to pull the boat to the beach.","t":"我们用**绳子**把小船拉到了沙滩上。"},
52189:{"w":"honey","e":"I put a little honey on my bread at breakfast.","t":"早饭时，我在面包上抹了一点**蜂蜜**。"},
52190:{"w":"accident","e":"Three people were hurt in a traffic accident on the highway last night.","t":"昨晚高速公路上发生了一起交通**事故**，三人受伤。"},
52191:{"w":"kid","e":"My neighbor's two kids often play football in the park after school.","t":"我邻居家的两个**孩子**放学后常在公园踢足球。"},
52192:{"w":"increase","e":"The number of books in our library increases every year.","t":"我们图书馆的藏书数量每年都在**增长**。"},
52193:{"w":"hometown","e":"My parents often go back to their hometown in summer.","t":"我父母夏天常回**家乡**。"},
52194:{"w":"prize","e":"She won first prize in the national writing competition.","t":"她在全国写作比赛中获得了一等**奖**。"},
52195:{"w":"better","e":"I feel much better today after a good night's sleep.","t":"睡了个好觉后，我今天感觉**好多了**。"},
52196:{"w":"but","e":"I like tea, but my brother prefers coffee.","t":"我喜欢茶，**但是**我弟弟更喜欢咖啡。"},
52197:{"w":"follow","e":"Please follow the guide, and don't walk away from the group.","t":"请**跟随**导游，不要离开队伍。"},
52198:{"w":"else","e":"Would you like anything else to drink?","t":"你还想喝点**别的**什么吗？"},
52199:{"w":"garden","e":"We grow flowers and vegetables in the garden behind our house.","t":"我们在屋后的**花园**里种花也种菜。"},
52200:{"w":"pig","e":"We saw a pig sleeping in the sun at the farm.","t":"我们在农场看到一头**猪**在太阳底下睡觉。"},
52201:{"w":"countryside","e":"We spent the summer holiday in the countryside with our grandparents.","t":"暑假我们和祖父母在**乡下**度过。"},
52202:{"w":"X-ray","e":"The doctor took an X-ray of my arm to see whether the bone was broken.","t":"医生给我的手臂拍了**X光片**，看看骨头有没有断。"},
52203:{"w":"cola","e":"I bought a bottle of cola for our picnic lunch.","t":"我买了一瓶**可乐**，打算野餐时喝。"},
52204:{"w":"golden","e":"The sky turned golden just before the sun went down.","t":"太阳快下山时，天空变成了**金色**。"},
52205:{"w":"net","e":"The ball hit the net at the back of the goal.","t":"球打在球门后面的**球网**上。"},
52206:{"w":"saying","e":"There is an old saying that a friend in need is a friend indeed.","t":"有句古老的**谚语**说，患难之交才是真朋友。"},
52207:{"w":"firm","e":"My uncle works for a small firm that makes toys.","t":"我叔叔在一家生产玩具的小**公司**工作。"},
52208:{"w":"suitable","e":"This medicine is not suitable for children under age 5.","t":"这种药不**适合**五岁以下儿童服用。"},
52209:{"w":"beauty","e":"The beauty of the mountain lake made everyone stop and take photos.","t":"山中湖泊的**美丽**让每个人都停下来拍照。"},
52210:{"w":"bulb","e":"The bulb in the kitchen has gone out, so we need to buy a new one.","t":"厨房的**灯泡**坏了，我们得买个新的。"},
52211:{"w":"clap","e":"The audience began to clap loudly when the little girl finished her song.","t":"小女孩唱完歌后，观众们开始大声**鼓掌**。"},
52212:{"w":"permission","e":"You need permission from your teacher to leave the classroom.","t":"你要得到老师的**许可**才能离开教室。"},
52213:{"w":"heaven","e":"She believes her old dog is now in heaven.","t":"她相信，她那只老狗已经去了**天堂**。"},
52214:{"w":"specifically","e":"I chose this book specifically for your little brother.","t":"我是**特意**为你弟弟挑的这本书。"},
52215:{"w":"scary","e":"We heard a scary noise outside the window last night.","t":"昨晚我们听见窗外传来一阵**吓人的**声音。"},
52216:{"w":"vote","e":"Everyone in the class will vote for a new monitor tomorrow morning.","t":"明天上午全班同学将**投票**选出新班长。"},
52217:{"w":"plastic","e":"Many supermarkets no longer give free plastic bags to customers who buy food.","t":"许多超市不再给买食品的顾客免费提供**塑料**袋。"},
52218:{"w":"sister","e":"My sister walks to school with me every morning before class.","t":"我**姐姐**每天早上都和我一起走路去上学。"},
52219:{"w":"record","e":"She keeps a record of everything she spends each month.","t":"她把每个月花的每一笔钱都做了**记录**。"},
52220:{"w":"butter","e":"He put some butter on his bread before eating it.","t":"他先在面包上抹了点**黄油**，然后才吃。"},
52221:{"w":"hard","e":"I found the last question really hard, so I skipped it.","t":"我觉得最后一道题太**难**了，就跳过了。"},
52222:{"w":"off","e":"I am off work tomorrow, so we can go to the park.","t":"我明天**休息**，咱们可以去公园。"},
52223:{"w":"break","e":"Be careful, or you will break the window with that ball.","t":"小心点，不然你会用那个球把窗户**打破**的。"},
52224:{"w":"cotton","e":"These shirts are made of cotton and feel soft and cool.","t":"这些衬衫是**棉**做的，摸起来又软又凉快。"},
52225:{"w":"artist","e":"We watched an artist paint a picture of the old bridge.","t":"我们看着一位**画家**画那座老桥。"},
52226:{"w":"glue","e":"I used glue to stick the picture into my notebook.","t":"我用**胶水**把图片粘在笔记本上。"},
52227:{"w":"shoot","e":"The hunter shot at the bird, but he missed.","t":"猎人朝那只鸟**射击**，但没有打中。"},
52228:{"w":"doctor","e":"The doctor told me to stay home and rest for two days.","t":"**医生**让我在家休息两天。"},
52229:{"w":"convenient","e":"It is convenient to live close to a bus stop.","t":"住在公交车站附近很**方便**。"},
52230:{"w":"terrible","e":"We had a terrible storm last night, and the power went out.","t":"昨晚我们遇上了一场**可怕的**暴风雨，停电了。"},
52231:{"w":"of","e":"This is a photo of my family.","t":"这是我家人**的**照片。"},
52232:{"w":"glass","e":"She poured some cold water into a glass for me.","t":"她往**玻璃杯**里倒了些凉水给我喝。"},
52233:{"w":"careful","e":"Be careful when you cross the street near the school.","t":"过学校附近那条街时，要**小心**。"},
52234:{"w":"more","e":"Could I have some more rice, please?","t":"请给我**再多**一点米饭，好吗？"},
52235:{"w":"under","e":"The cat is sleeping under the table.","t":"猫在桌子**下面**睡觉。"},
52236:{"w":"diary","e":"I write in my diary before I go to bed.","t":"我睡觉前会写**日记**。"},
52237:{"w":"shout","e":"Don't shout in the library, because other people are trying to study.","t":"别在图书馆里**大喊大叫**，其他人正在努力学习。"},
52238:{"w":"hunt","e":"In the past, people in this area had to hunt wild animals for food.","t":"过去，这一带的人们得靠**捕猎**野生动物来获取食物。"},
52239:{"w":"fashion","e":"This kind of hat was in fashion when Dad was young.","t":"爸爸年轻时，这种帽子很**时髦**。"},
52240:{"w":"punish","e":"The teacher did not punish him because he told the truth.","t":"老师没有**惩罚**他，因为他说了实话。"},
52241:{"w":"bridge","e":"We crossed the old bridge to get to the village.","t":"我们过了那座老**桥**，到了村子里。"},
52242:{"w":"radio","e":"Grandpa listens to the news on the radio every morning.","t":"爷爷每天早上都用**收音机**听新闻。"},
52243:{"w":"somewhere","e":"I left my keys somewhere, but I cannot remember where.","t":"我把钥匙落在**某处**了，但想不起在哪里。"},
52244:{"w":"product","e":"This company sells its products in more than thirty countries around the world.","t":"这家公司的**产品**销往全球三十多个国家。"},
52245:{"w":"never","e":"I will never forget my first day at this school.","t":"我**永远不会**忘记在这所学校的第一天。"},
52246:{"w":"several","e":"My uncle keeps several hens in a little house behind his garden.","t":"我叔叔在花园后面的小棚子里养了**几只**母鸡。"},
52247:{"w":"insect","e":"Bees are useful insects because they help flowers and fruit trees grow.","t":"蜜蜂是有益的**昆虫**，因为它们帮助花和果树生长。"},
52248:{"w":"banana","e":"I put a banana and an apple in my school bag.","t":"我在书包里放了一根**香蕉**和一个苹果。"},
52249:{"w":"volunteer","e":"Mary volunteered to work as a teacher in West Africa.","t":"玛丽**自愿**去西非做一名教师。"},
52250:{"w":"all","e":"All the students in our class passed the exam.","t":"我们班**所有**学生都通过了考试。"},
52251:{"w":"smile","e":"The little girl smiled and waved at her mother.","t":"小女孩**微笑**着向妈妈挥手。"},
52252:{"w":"rather","e":"The test was rather difficult, but most students passed it.","t":"这次测验**相当**难，但大多数学生都通过了。"},
52253:{"w":"camera","e":"I brought my camera to take pictures of the mountains.","t":"我带了**相机**来拍山景。"},
52254:{"w":"idea","e":"That is a good idea, so let's have the class meeting outdoors.","t":"这是个好**主意**，我们就到户外开班会吧。"},
52255:{"w":"advantage","e":"One advantage of walking to school is that it saves money.","t":"步行上学的一个**好处**是可以省钱。"},
52256:{"w":"hill","e":"We climbed a small hill to watch the sun go down.","t":"我们爬上一座**小山**看日落。"},
52257:{"w":"clothes","e":"I put my wet clothes in the bathroom to dry.","t":"我把湿**衣服**放在浴室里晾干。"},
52258:{"w":"anything","e":"I can't find anything to eat in the fridge.","t":"我在冰箱里找不到**任何东西**吃。"},
52259:{"w":"purpose","e":"The main purpose of this meeting is to plan the school trip.","t":"这次会议的主要**目的**是规划学校旅行。"},
52260:{"w":"boat","e":"We took a small boat across the lake to the island.","t":"我们坐着**小船**穿过湖面，到了岛上。"},
52261:{"w":"to","e":"I gave the new book to my sister for her birthday.","t":"我把这本新书送**给**妹妹当生日礼物。"},
52262:{"w":"lonely","e":"He felt lonely in the new city because he had no friends there.","t":"他在新城市里感到很**孤独**，因为那里没有朋友。"},
52263:{"w":"education","e":"My parents believe that a good education is the best gift for children.","t":"我父母认为良好的**教育**是给孩子最好的礼物。"},
52264:{"w":"order","e":"Please put the cards in order, from the smallest number to the largest.","t":"请把这些卡片按**顺序**排好，从最小的数字到最大的。"},
52265:{"w":"playground","e":"The children ran to the playground as soon as class ended.","t":"一下课，孩子们就跑到了**操场**上。"},
52266:{"w":"statement","e":"Our school made a statement about the change to the summer holiday.","t":"学校就暑假时间调整发布了**声明**。"},
52267:{"w":"seal","e":"Please seal the envelope and stick an eight-cent stamp on it.","t":"请**封好**信封并贴上一张8分邮票。"},
52268:{"w":"alright","e":"Is it alright if I bring my little sister with me?","t":"我带上妹妹一起去，**可以**吗？"},
52269:{"w":"supply","e":"This river supplies water to the farms in our village.","t":"这条河为我们村里的农场**供**水。"},
52270:{"w":"district","e":"Our school is in the business district of the city.","t":"我们学校在城市的商业**区**。"},
52271:{"w":"reveal","e":"Don't reveal the ending of the story to your friends.","t":"别把故事的结局**透露**给朋友们。"},
52272:{"w":"marathon","e":"He trained for months to run in the city marathon.","t":"他训练了好几个月，为的是参加城市**马拉松**。"},
52273:{"w":"ink","e":"My pen ran out of ink during the English test.","t":"英语考试时，我的笔没**墨水**了。"},
52274:{"w":"discovery","e":"The discovery of a new planet surprised many scientists around the world.","t":"一颗新行星的**发现**让世界各地的许多科学家感到惊讶。"},
52275:{"w":"association","e":"He is a member of the Chinese Writers' Association.","t":"他是中国作家**协会**的会员。"},
52276:{"w":"southern","e":"My aunt lives in a small town in southern China.","t":"我姑姑住在中国**南部**的一个小镇上。"},
52277:{"w":"reduce","e":"We should reduce the use of plastic bags to protect the environment.","t":"为了保护环境，我们应该**减少**塑料袋的使用。"},
52278:{"w":"keep","e":"Please keep this ticket until the end of the show.","t":"请把这张票**保存**到演出结束。"},
52279:{"w":"when","e":"When I got home, my mother was already cooking dinner.","t":"我到家**的时候**，妈妈已经在做晚饭了。"},
52280:{"w":"total","e":"The total cost of the trip was about two thousand yuan.","t":"这次旅行的**总**费用大约是两千元。"},
52281:{"w":"mention","e":"He mentioned in his letter that he might be moving abroad.","t":"他在信中**提到**他可能要移居国外。"},
52282:{"w":"work","e":"Her work as a nurse is hard, but she enjoys helping people.","t":"她的**工作**是护士，很辛苦，但她喜欢帮助别人。"},
52283:{"w":"cabbage","e":"My grandmother grows cabbage and carrots in the small garden behind her house.","t":"我奶奶在屋后的小菜园里种了**卷心菜**和胡萝卜。"},
52284:{"w":"aware","e":"Are you aware that the shop closes at five on Sundays?","t":"你**知道**星期天这家店五点关门吗？"},
52285:{"w":"English","e":"We learn new English words by reading short stories together.","t":"我们一起读短故事来学习**英语**新单词。"},
52286:{"w":"dialog","e":"The book uses short lines of dialog to tell the story.","t":"这本书用简短的**对话**来讲述故事。"},
52287:{"w":"penguin","e":"We watched a penguin jump into the cold water to swim.","t":"我们看见一只**企鹅**跳进冰冷的水里游泳。"},
52288:{"w":"not","e":"The boy did not see the small bird behind him.","t":"男孩**没**看见他身后的小鸟。"},
52289:{"w":"hear","e":"I could hear music coming from the room next door.","t":"我能**听见**隔壁房间传来音乐声。"},
52290:{"w":"pain","e":"He felt a sharp pain in his leg after the football match.","t":"足球赛后，他感到腿上一阵剧烈的**疼痛**。"},
52291:{"w":"bill","e":"After dinner, my father asked the waiter to bring the bill.","t":"晚饭后，爸爸请服务员把**账单**拿来。"},
52292:{"w":"positive","e":"She stayed positive even when the work was very hard.","t":"即使工作很难，她也保持**乐观**。"},
52293:{"w":"grey","e":"The sky turned grey, and soon it began to rain heavily.","t":"天空变成了**灰色**，不久就下起了大雨。"},
52294:{"w":"pear","e":"My mum cut a ripe pear into pieces for me.","t":"妈妈把一个熟**梨**切成小块给我吃。"},
52295:{"w":"tower","e":"We could see the whole town from the top of the tower.","t":"我们从**塔**顶可以看到整个小镇。"},
52296:{"w":"dig","e":"The dog dug a deep hole in the garden.","t":"那只狗在花园里**挖**了一个深洞。"},
52297:{"w":"pizza","e":"We shared a pizza after the game because we were hungry.","t":"比赛后我们饿了，就分吃了一个**比萨饼**。"},
52298:{"w":"death","e":"The death of his old dog made the boy very sad.","t":"老狗的**死**让男孩非常难过。"},
52299:{"w":"safe","e":"It is safe to cross the street when the light is green.","t":"绿灯亮时过马路是**安全**的。"},
52300:{"w":"age","e":"At the age of ten, my sister learned to play chess.","t":"我姐姐十**岁**时学会了下国际象棋。"},
52301:{"w":"straight","e":"Draw a straight line from this point to the edge of the paper.","t":"从这一点到纸的边缘画一条**直**线。"},
52302:{"w":"onion","e":"Cutting onions always makes my eyes water, so I wear glasses in the kitchen.","t":"切**洋葱**总让我流眼泪，所以我在厨房里戴着眼镜。"},
52303:{"w":"afford","e":"I saved enough money to afford a new pair of shoes.","t":"我存了足够的钱，**买得起**一双新鞋了。"},
52304:{"w":"ground","e":"The glass fell to the ground as I opened the door.","t":"我开门时，玻璃杯掉到了**地上**。"},
52305:{"w":"cap","e":"He wore a cap to keep the sun out of his eyes.","t":"他戴了顶**帽子**，好让阳光别照到眼睛。"},
52306:{"w":"animal","e":"A rabbit is a small animal that can run very fast.","t":"兔子是一种跑得很快的小**动物**。"},
52307:{"w":"card","e":"My friend sent me a card for my birthday last week.","t":"上周我过生日，朋友给我寄了张**贺卡**。"},
52308:{"w":"heart","e":"I could feel my heart beating faster as I ran uphill.","t":"我往山坡上跑时，能感觉到**心脏**跳得更快了。"},
52309:{"w":"breakfast","e":"We have breakfast in the kitchen before we go to school.","t":"我们上学前在厨房吃**早饭**。"},
52310:{"w":"guide","e":"Our guide led us through the forest and showed us the way back.","t":"我们的**向导**带领我们穿过森林，并给我们指明了回去的路。"},
52311:{"w":"weekend","e":"I often help my dad in the garden at the weekend.","t":"我经常在**周末**帮爸爸打理花园。"},
52312:{"w":"practice","e":"You need a lot of practice before you can play the piano well.","t":"要想把钢琴弹好，你需要大量**练习**。"},
52313:{"w":"a","e":"I bought a new notebook for school with my pocket money.","t":"我用零花钱买了**一**本上学用的新笔记本。"},
52314:{"w":"schoolbag","e":"I checked my schoolbag to make sure my lunch was inside.","t":"我检查了**书包**，确认午餐在里面。"},
52315:{"w":"kilo","e":"She bought two kilos of apples at the market.","t":"她在市场上买了两**公斤**苹果。"},
52316:{"w":"other","e":"Some students walk to school, while the other students take the bus.","t":"有些学生步行上学，**其他**学生则坐公交。"},
52317:{"w":"matter","e":"It does not matter whether you win or lose, as long as you try your best.","t":"你是赢是输都**不要紧**，只要尽了全力。"},
52318:{"w":"full","e":"The box was full of old photos from my childhood.","t":"箱子里**满**是我小时候的照片。"},
52319:{"w":"pressure","e":"Students often feel great pressure before important exams.","t":"重要考试前，学生们常常感到巨大的**压力**。"},
52320:{"w":"diet","e":"A healthy diet includes plenty of fruit, vegetables and water.","t":"健康的**饮食**包括大量的水果、蔬菜和水。"},
52321:{"w":"hurt","e":"Be careful with that knife, or you will hurt yourself.","t":"小心那把刀，否则你会**伤**到自己。"},
52322:{"w":"project","e":"Our class is working on a science project about water.","t":"我们班正在做一个关于水的科学**项目**。"},
52323:{"w":"enemy","e":"In the story, the two men become friends after being enemies.","t":"故事里的这两个人原本是**敌人**，后来成了朋友。"},
52324:{"w":"supermarket","e":"We went to the supermarket to buy food for dinner.","t":"我们去**超市**买了晚餐要用的食材。"},
52325:{"w":"nature","e":"We spent the weekend in the countryside, enjoying the beauty of nature.","t":"我们在乡下过周末，欣赏**大自然**的美。"},
52326:{"w":"list","e":"Please make a list of the things we need to buy for the party.","t":"请把我们为聚会需要买的东西列一张**清单**。"},
52327:{"w":"yet","e":"I have not finished my homework yet, so I cannot go out.","t":"我**还**没做完作业，所以不能出去。"},
52328:{"w":"author","e":"The author of this book spent five years living in a small village in Africa.","t":"这本书的**作者**在非洲的一个小村庄里住了五年。"},
52329:{"w":"Jew","e":"The museum has stories about Jews who lived in our city.","t":"博物馆里有一些关于曾住在这座城市的**犹太人**的故事。"},
52330:{"w":"glow","e":"The lamp in the window gave off a warm glow that made the room feel cozy.","t":"窗边的台灯发出温暖的**光亮**，让房间显得很舒适。"},
52331:{"w":"globe","e":"The teacher pointed to China on the globe and asked us to find our city.","t":"老师指着**地球仪**上的中国，让我们找出自己的城市。"},
52332:{"w":"hallway","e":"I left my wet shoes by the door in the hallway.","t":"我把湿鞋放在**门厅**的门边了。"},
52333:{"w":"soap","e":"Please wash your hands with soap before you touch the food.","t":"碰食物前，请用**肥皂**洗手。"},
52334:{"w":"fiction","e":"She enjoys reading science fiction, especially stories about travel to other planets.","t":"她喜欢读科幻**小说**，尤其是关于星际旅行的故事。"},
52335:{"w":"digital","e":"She took a lot of photos with her new digital camera.","t":"她用新买的**数码**相机拍了很多照片。"},
52336:{"w":"zoo","e":"We went to the zoo to see the baby pandas.","t":"我们去**动物园**看熊猫宝宝。"},
52337:{"w":"hide","e":"My brother tried to hide the gift under his bed.","t":"我弟弟想把礼物**藏**在床底下。"},
52338:{"w":"quality","e":"The quality of the food in this restaurant is excellent.","t":"这家餐厅食物的**质量**非常好。"},
52339:{"w":"grass","e":"We sat on the grass and ate lunch in the park.","t":"我们坐在公园的**草地**上吃午饭。"},
52340:{"w":"conversation","e":"The conversation between the new students touched on many new subjects.","t":"新同学之间的**对话**涉及很多新话题。"},
52341:{"w":"flower","e":"I picked a yellow flower for my mum on the way home.","t":"回家路上，我给妈妈摘了一朵黄色的**花**。"},
52342:{"w":"continue","e":"Please continue reading the text while I check your homework.","t":"我检查作业的时候，请大家**继续**读课文。"},
52343:{"w":"Christmas","e":"My cousins come to our house for dinner every Christmas.","t":"每年**圣诞节**，表兄妹们都会来我们家吃饭。"},
52344:{"w":"snow","e":"The children played in the snow until it got dark.","t":"孩子们在**雪**地里一直玩到天黑。"},
52345:{"w":"miss","e":"I will miss my friends a lot when I move to a new city.","t":"搬到新城市后，我会非常**想念**我的朋友们。"},
52346:{"w":"tap","e":"Remember to turn off the tap after you wash your hands.","t":"洗完手后，记得关上**水龙头**。"},
52347:{"w":"object","e":"The teacher asked us to name the objects on the table in English.","t":"老师让我们用英语说出桌上**物品**的名称。"},
52348:{"w":"Olympic","e":"My brother wants to take part in the Olympic Games someday.","t":"我哥哥想有一天能参加**奥林匹克**运动会。"},
52349:{"w":"invite","e":"She invited all her classmates to her birthday party.","t":"她**邀请**了所有同学来参加她的生日聚会。"},
52350:{"w":"mind","e":"Do you mind if I open the window?","t":"你**介意**我打开窗户吗？"},
52351:{"w":"win","e":"Our team hopes to win the football match on Saturday.","t":"我们队希望星期六**赢下**这场足球比赛。"},
52352:{"w":"glove","e":"It was so cold that I wore a thick pair of gloves to school.","t":"天太冷了，我戴了一副厚**手套**去上学。"},
52353:{"w":"president","e":"The president of our book club welcomed three new members.","t":"我们读书俱乐部的**会长**欢迎了三位新成员。"},
52354:{"w":"bell","e":"The bell rang just as we finished the last question.","t":"我们刚做完最后一道题，**铃**就响了。"},
52355:{"w":"pill","e":"She drank a glass of water to help swallow the pill.","t":"她喝了一杯水，好把**药片**咽下去。"},
52356:{"w":"medicine","e":"The doctor gave me some medicine for my cold and told me to rest.","t":"医生给我开了一些治感冒的**药**，让我多休息。"},
52357:{"w":"though","e":"Though he was very tired, he stayed up late to finish his homework.","t":"**虽然**他很累，他还是熬夜完成了作业。"},
52358:{"w":"lift","e":"The lift was broken, so we had to climb the stairs to the tenth floor.","t":"**电梯**坏了，我们只好爬楼梯到十楼。"},
52359:{"w":"message","e":"I left a message on his phone, but he has not called me back.","t":"我在他的手机上**留言**了，但他还没有回电话。"},
52360:{"w":"repair","e":"My father spent the whole afternoon trying to repair our broken washing machine.","t":"我父亲花了整个下午试图**修理**我们坏掉的洗衣机。"},
52361:{"w":"god","e":"In the old story, a god lives on the mountain.","t":"在这个古老的故事里，有一位**神**住在山上。"},
52362:{"w":"run","e":"He runs a small bookshop near the school and knows all his customers.","t":"他在学校附近**经营**着一家小书店，认识所有的顾客。"},
52363:{"w":"the","e":"I found the blue pen you left on my desk.","t":"我找到了你落在我桌上的**那**支蓝笔。"},
52364:{"w":"ship","e":"We could see a big ship coming into the port.","t":"我们看到一艘大**船**正在驶进港口。"},
52365:{"w":"invent","e":"Do you know who invented the telephone more than one hundred years ago?","t":"你知道一百多年前是谁**发明**了电话吗？"},
52366:{"w":"special","e":"My grandmother made a special cake for my birthday last week.","t":"上周，奶奶为我的生日做了一个**特别的**蛋糕。"},
52367:{"w":"population","e":"The population of the town grew when the new factory opened.","t":"新工厂开办后，小镇的**人口**增加了。"},
52368:{"w":"condition","e":"The old house is in good condition, so we can move in at once.","t":"这所旧房子**状况**良好，我们可以马上搬进去。"},
52369:{"w":"sell","e":"My aunt sells fresh fruit and vegetables at the market every morning.","t":"我阿姨每天早上在市场上**卖**新鲜水果和蔬菜。"},
52370:{"w":"usual","e":"He arrived at school earlier than usual this morning.","t":"今天早上他比**平常**早到学校。"},
52371:{"w":"wolf","e":"The farmer built a high fence to keep the wolf away from his sheep.","t":"农民建了一道高高的栅栏，防止**野狼**靠近他的羊。"},
52372:{"w":"offer","e":"The shop offers free delivery to customers who live nearby.","t":"这家商店为住在附近的顾客**提供**免费送货。"},
52373:{"w":"around","e":"There were around fifty students in the hall.","t":"礼堂里有**大约**五十名学生。"},
52374:{"w":"water","e":"I filled my bottle with water before leaving for school.","t":"出门上学前，我把瓶子装满了**水**。"},
52375:{"w":"accept","e":"He gladly accepted our invitation to the party.","t":"他欣然**接受**了我们的聚会邀请。"},
52376:{"w":"instead","e":"Tom was ill, so his sister went to the meeting instead.","t":"汤姆生病了，所以他姐姐**代替**他去开了会。"},
52377:{"w":"rice","e":"We had rice with chicken and green beans for dinner.","t":"晚餐我们吃了**米饭**，配了鸡肉和四季豆。"},
52378:{"w":"here","e":"You can sit here and wait for your friend to arrive.","t":"你可以坐在**这儿**等朋友来。"},
52379:{"w":"rain","e":"We stayed inside until the rain stopped in the afternoon.","t":"我们一直待在屋里，直到下午**雨**停。"},
52380:{"w":"pick","e":"We went to the farm to pick strawberries on Saturday.","t":"星期六我们去农场**采**草莓。"},
52381:{"w":"anybody","e":"I can't see anybody in the garden.","t":"我在花园里看不到**任何人**。"},
52382:{"w":"teach","e":"My aunt teaches English at a middle school.","t":"我姑姑在一所中学**教**英语。"},
52383:{"w":"far","e":"Is the post office far from here?","t":"邮局离这儿**远**吗？"},
52384:{"w":"hope","e":"I hope the weather will be fine for our trip tomorrow.","t":"我**希望**明天天气晴朗，适合我们出游。"},
52385:{"w":"history","e":"We learned about the history of our town at school.","t":"我们在学校了解了镇上的**历史**。"},
52386:{"w":"comma","e":"Put a comma after each name except the last one.","t":"除了最后一个名字，每个名字后面都加一个**逗号**。"},
52387:{"w":"furniture","e":"We bought some new furniture for the living room, including a sofa and two chairs.","t":"我们给客厅买了一些新**家具**，包括一张沙发和两把椅子。"},
52388:{"w":"comedy","e":"We watched a comedy last night and laughed the whole time.","t":"我们昨晚看了一部**喜剧**，从头笑到尾。"},
52389:{"w":"expert","e":"The museum invited an expert to tell visitors about the history of the old paintings.","t":"博物馆请了一位**专家**给参观者讲解这些古画的历史。"},
52390:{"w":"our","e":"Our classroom has a big window that faces the playground.","t":"**我们的**教室有一扇朝向操场的大窗户。"},
52391:{"w":"duty","e":"It is the duty of every citizen to obey the law.","t":"遵守法律是每个公民的**责任**。"},
52392:{"w":"building","e":"The tallest building in our town has a clock on top.","t":"我们镇上最高的**楼**顶上有一座钟。"},
52393:{"w":"important","e":"It is important to drink enough water every day.","t":"每天喝足够的水很**重要**。"},
52394:{"w":"model","e":"I made a model of a plane from old paper.","t":"我用旧纸做了一个飞机**模型**。"},
52395:{"w":"mistake","e":"I made a mistake in the last question of the test.","t":"我在测验的最后一道题上犯了一个**错误**。"},
52396:{"w":"they","e":"My sisters are hungry because they missed lunch at school.","t":"我两个姐姐在学校没吃午饭，所以**她们**饿了。"},
52397:{"w":"instrument","e":"She plays three musical instruments, including the piano and the flute.","t":"她会演奏三种**乐器**，包括钢琴和长笛。"},
52398:{"w":"coach","e":"Our coach showed us how to pass the ball quickly.","t":"我们的**教练**教我们怎样快速传球。"},
52399:{"w":"call","e":"I got a call from my cousin while I was having dinner.","t":"我吃晚饭时接到了表弟的**电话**。"},
52400:{"w":"fireman","e":"A brave fireman climbed the ladder and carried the child out of the burning building.","t":"一位勇敢的**消防队员**爬上梯子，把孩子从着火的楼里抱了出来。"},
52401:{"w":"rainbow","e":"After the storm, a beautiful rainbow appeared in the sky over the lake.","t":"暴风雨过后，湖面上空出现了一道美丽的**彩虹**。"},
52402:{"w":"note","e":"She left a note on the table before she went out.","t":"她出门前在桌子上留了一张**便条**。"},
52403:{"w":"doll","e":"She put the doll on the bed next to her pillow.","t":"她把**洋娃娃**放在床上的枕头旁边。"},
52404:{"w":"below","e":"The temperature fell below zero last night, and the lake froze.","t":"昨晚气温降到零度**以下**，湖面结冰了。"},
52405:{"w":"kill","e":"Cold weather killed most of the flowers in our garden last winter.","t":"去年冬天的寒冷天气**冻死**了我们花园里的大部分花。"},
52406:{"w":"discuss","e":"We will discuss the plan for the school trip at tomorrow's class meeting.","t":"我们将在明天的班会上**讨论**学校旅行的计划。"},
52407:{"w":"peace","e":"People all over the world hope for peace.","t":"全世界的人都希望**和平**。"},
52408:{"w":"good","e":"That was a good film, and I want to see it again.","t":"那部电影真**好**看，我还想再看一遍。"},
52409:{"w":"toy","e":"My little brother takes his favourite toy everywhere he goes.","t":"我弟弟不管去哪儿都带着他最喜欢的**玩具**。"},
52410:{"w":"final","e":"This is the final bus of the day, so we must hurry.","t":"这是今天的**最后**一班公共汽车，我们得快点。"},
52411:{"w":"none","e":"I asked three friends for help, but none of them were free.","t":"我向三个朋友求助，但他们**没有一个人**有空。"},
52412:{"w":"even","e":"Even our youngest players knew how to follow the new rules.","t":"**连**我们最小的队员都知道怎么遵守新规则。"},
52413:{"w":"winter","e":"We sometimes get enough snow to go skiing in winter.","t":"**冬天**有时雪下得够多，我们就能去滑雪。"},
52414:{"w":"party","e":"We planned a surprise party for our teacher on Friday.","t":"我们为老师安排了一场周五的惊喜**聚会**。"},
52415:{"w":"opinion","e":"In my opinion, this film is better than the book.","t":"在我**看来**，这部电影比那本书好。"},
52416:{"w":"guess","e":"Can you guess how old my grandmother is?","t":"你能**猜**出我奶奶多大年纪吗？"},
52417:{"w":"pool","e":"The children jumped into the pool as soon as it opened.","t":"刚一开放，孩子们就跳进了**泳池**。"},
52418:{"w":"explore","e":"We took a map to explore the town after lunch.","t":"午饭后，我们带着地图去**探索**这个小镇。"},
52419:{"w":"money","e":"How much money did you save for the school trip?","t":"你为学校组织的旅行存了多少**钱**？"},
52420:{"w":"do","e":"Please do your homework carefully before you watch television tonight.","t":"今晚看电视之前，请认真地**做**作业。"},
52421:{"w":"watermelon","e":"We ate cold watermelon after playing outside on a hot day.","t":"那天天气很热，我们在外面玩完后吃了冰**西瓜**。"},
52422:{"w":"have","e":"I have two brothers and a younger sister.","t":"我**有**两个兄弟和一个妹妹。"},
52423:{"w":"protect","e":"These trees protect the garden from the strong winter wind.","t":"这些树挡住了冬天的强风，**保护**了花园。"},
52424:{"w":"build","e":"They plan to build a new bridge across the river next year.","t":"他们计划明年在这条河上**建造**一座新桥。"},
52425:{"w":"birth","e":"We put the date of our daughter's birth in her photo book.","t":"我们把女儿的**出生**日期记在她的相册里。"},
52426:{"w":"swim","e":"We swim in the lake every summer when we visit my grandparents.","t":"每年夏天去看爷爷奶奶时，我们都会在湖里**游泳**。"},
52427:{"w":"praise","e":"Our teacher praised the class for keeping the classroom clean.","t":"因为我们把教室打扫得很干净，老师**表扬**了全班。"},
52428:{"w":"husband","e":"My aunt and her husband are coming to dinner this evening.","t":"我姑姑和她的**丈夫**今晚要来吃饭。"},
52429:{"w":"farm","e":"We visited a farm and helped feed the chickens there.","t":"我们去了一家**农场**，还帮忙喂了鸡。"},
52430:{"w":"well","e":"My brother plays the guitar very well, and he often performs at school.","t":"我哥哥吉他弹得很**好**，经常在学校演出。"},
52431:{"w":"thirsty","e":"After playing basketball for two hours, the boys were hot and thirsty.","t":"打了两个小时篮球后，男孩们浑身发热，**口渴**难耐。"},
52432:{"w":"mess","e":"After the party, the living room was in a terrible mess, with cups and plates everywhere.","t":"聚会结束后，客厅里**一片狼藉**，到处都是杯子和盘子。"},
52433:{"w":"culture","e":"Learning a foreign language is a good way to understand the culture of another country.","t":"学习外语是了解另一个国家**文化**的好方法。"},
52434:{"w":"meal","e":"We shared a hot meal after a long walk in the rain.","t":"我们冒雨走了很久，之后一起吃了**一餐**热乎的饭。"},
52435:{"w":"silly","e":"My little brother made a silly face and made everyone laugh.","t":"我弟弟做了个**傻乎乎的**鬼脸，把大家都逗笑了。"},
52436:{"w":"grandpa","e":"My grandpa taught me how to grow tomatoes in our garden.","t":"我**爷爷**教我怎么在自家花园里种西红柿。"},
52437:{"w":"blind","e":"The old man has been blind since he was a child, but he plays the piano well.","t":"这位老人从小就**失明**，但钢琴弹得很好。"},
52438:{"w":"elementary","e":"My little sister is in her second year at the elementary school near our home.","t":"我妹妹在家附近的**小学**读二年级。"},
52439:{"w":"talented","e":"My talented cousin can play the piano and write her own songs.","t":"我表姐很**有才华**，会弹钢琴，还能自己写歌。"},
52440:{"w":"mixture","e":"Pour the mixture into the pan and cook it slowly.","t":"把**混合料**倒进锅里，用小火慢慢煮。"},
52441:{"w":"stream","e":"The leaves were washed by rain into streams and rivers.","t":"树叶被雨水冲进了**小溪**与河流中。"},
52442:{"w":"fold","e":"Please fold the letter before you put it into the envelope.","t":"请把信**折好**再放进信封里。"},
52443:{"w":"insist","e":"My mother insisted that I wear a coat because it was very cold outside.","t":"外面很冷，妈妈**坚持**要我穿上外套。"},
52444:{"w":"grandchild","e":"Her first grandchild was born on a cold winter morning.","t":"她的第一个**孙辈**出生在一个寒冷的冬日清晨。"},
52445:{"w":"solid","e":"Water becomes solid when it freezes.","t":"水结冰时会变成**固体**。"},
52446:{"w":"Mars","e":"Mars looks red when we see it in the night sky.","t":"在夜空中，**火星**看起来是红色的。"},
52447:{"w":"structure","e":"The structure of the bridge helps it stay strong in storms.","t":"这座桥的**结构**使它在暴风雨中也很牢固。"},
52448:{"w":"homeland","e":"Many years later, he returned to his homeland to see his family again.","t":"许多年后，他回到**祖国**，再次见到了家人。"},
52449:{"w":"pleasant","e":"We spent a pleasant afternoon last Sunday walking by the river.","t":"上周日我们在河边散步，度过了一个**愉快**的下午。"},
52450:{"w":"secretary","e":"The secretary answered the phone and wrote down my name.","t":"**秘书**接了电话，记下了我的名字。"},
52451:{"w":"prince","e":"The young prince lived in a large house with the king.","t":"年轻的**王子**和国王住在一座大房子里。"},
52452:{"w":"princess","e":"The princess opened the door and invited us to dinner.","t":"**公主**打开门，邀请我们一起吃晚饭。"},
52453:{"w":"during","e":"Please keep quiet during the exam.","t":"考试**期间**请保持安静。"},
52454:{"w":"try","e":"Let's try to finish our homework before we go out.","t":"我们**试着**在出门前做完作业吧。"},
52455:{"w":"get","e":"I hope I can get a good score in the final exam.","t":"我希望期末考试能**得到**好成绩。"},
52456:{"w":"write","e":"Please write your name at the top of the page before you start the test.","t":"开始考试之前，请先把你的名字**写**在这页的最上面。"},
52457:{"w":"hall","e":"The whole school met in the hall to hear the headmaster's speech.","t":"全校师生聚集在**礼堂**里听校长讲话。"},
52458:{"w":"guard","e":"Soldiers guard the gate day and night.","t":"士兵们日夜**看守**着大门。"},
52459:{"w":"fine","e":"It was a fine day, so we had a picnic by the river.","t":"那天天气**晴朗**，所以我们在河边野餐。"},
52460:{"w":"spirit","e":"The team showed a strong spirit and never gave up.","t":"这支队伍表现出顽强的**精神**，从不放弃。"},
52461:{"w":"front","e":"The front door was open, so we walked straight into the hall.","t":"**前**门开着，所以我们径直走进了门厅。"},
52462:{"w":"sound","e":"Your idea sounds great, so let's try it this weekend.","t":"你的主意**听起来**很棒，我们这个周末就试试吧。"},
52463:{"w":"wild","e":"Wild flowers cover the hills in spring, and many tourists come to see them.","t":"春天，**野**花开满山丘，许多游客前来观赏。"},
52464:{"w":"snake","e":"A long green snake lay on a warm rock by the river.","t":"一条长长的绿**蛇**躺在河边一块暖和的石头上。"},
52465:{"w":"consider","e":"We should consider all the facts before we make a decision.","t":"做决定之前，我们应该**考虑**所有的事实。"},
52466:{"w":"foreign","e":"Many students at our school are learning a foreign language.","t":"我们学校有很多学生在学一门**外国**语言。"},
52467:{"w":"myself","e":"I taught myself to ride a bike when I was eight.","t":"我八岁时**自己**学会了骑自行车。"},
52468:{"w":"passenger","e":"The driver waited for the last passenger to get on the bus.","t":"司机等着最后一名**乘客**上车。"},
52469:{"w":"clean","e":"Please put the clean cups back on the table.","t":"请把**干净**的杯子放回桌上。"},
52470:{"w":"situation","e":"The situation was serious, so we called the police at once.","t":"**情况**很严重，所以我们立刻报了警。"},
52471:{"w":"look","e":"You look tired, so you should go to bed early tonight.","t":"你**看起来**很累，今晚应该早点睡觉。"},
52472:{"w":"baseball","e":"My cousin in America plays baseball with his friends every weekend in the park.","t":"我在美国的表哥每个周末都和朋友在公园里打**棒球**。"},
52473:{"w":"over","e":"A bird flew over our house and landed on the old tree.","t":"一只鸟从我们的房子**上方**飞过，落在那棵老树上。"},
52474:{"w":"become","e":"My sister wants to become a doctor when she grows up.","t":"我妹妹长大后想**成为**一名医生。"},
52475:{"w":"surface","e":"It seems like a difficult problem on the surface, but in fact it is easy to solve.","t":"这个问题**表面**上看起来很难，但实际上很容易解决。"},
52476:{"w":"mountain","e":"We climbed the mountain and saw the whole town below us.","t":"我们爬上**山**，看见了下方的整座小镇。"},
52477:{"w":"black","e":"I wear my black shoes to school on rainy days.","t":"下雨天我穿着**黑色**的鞋子去上学。"},
52478:{"w":"hour","e":"We waited for an hour before the next bus came.","t":"我们等了一**小时**，下一班公交车才来。"},
52479:{"w":"found","e":"The school was founded in 1950 by a group of teachers.","t":"这所学校是1950年由一群教师**创办**的。"},
52480:{"w":"often","e":"My grandfather often takes a walk in the park after dinner.","t":"我爷爷晚饭后**经常**去公园散步。"},
52481:{"w":"trust","e":"I trust my brother because he has never broken a promise to me.","t":"我**信任**我哥哥，因为他从没对我食言。"},
52482:{"w":"past","e":"I have been very busy during the past week.","t":"**过去**这一周我一直很忙。"},
52483:{"w":"food","e":"We took enough food for three days on our trip.","t":"我们带了够在旅途中吃三天的**食物**。"},
52484:{"w":"cover","e":"Snow covered the whole town by morning.","t":"到早上，大雪已经**覆盖**了整个小镇。"},
52485:{"w":"square","e":"Many people were sitting in the square, enjoying the sunshine.","t":"许多人坐在**广场**上，享受着阳光。"},
52486:{"w":"girl","e":"The girl put her schoolbag down and sat by the window.","t":"**女孩**放下书包，坐在窗边。"},
52487:{"w":"worst","e":"That was the worst storm our town had seen in years.","t":"那是我们镇多年来遇到的**最糟**的一场暴风雨。"},
52488:{"w":"someone","e":"Someone left a red umbrella in the classroom after school.","t":"放学后，**有人**把一把红伞落在了教室里。"},
52489:{"w":"force","e":"Please do not force your brother to do your homework.","t":"请别**强迫**你弟弟帮你做作业。"},
52490:{"w":"weather","e":"The weather was so bad that we had to stay at home all weekend.","t":"**天气**太糟糕了，我们整个周末只好待在家里。"},
52491:{"w":"police","e":"Someone called the police after they saw the broken window.","t":"有人看见窗户碎了，就打电话叫了**警察**。"},
52492:{"w":"kind","e":"What kind of music do you like to listen to when you study?","t":"学习时你喜欢听哪**一种**音乐？"},
52493:{"w":"feed","e":"I feed my dog before I leave for school each morning.","t":"我每天早上出门上学前都会**喂**狗。"},
52494:{"w":"railway","e":"The railway runs through the hills between the two towns.","t":"这条**铁路**穿过两座小镇之间的群山。"},
52495:{"w":"different","e":"The twins look the same, but their characters are very different.","t":"这对双胞胎长得一样，但性格却很**不同**。"},
52496:{"w":"healthy","e":"My grandpa walks every day to stay strong and healthy.","t":"我爷爷每天散步，让身体保持强壮和**健康**。"},
52497:{"w":"windy","e":"It was so windy that I had to hold my hat.","t":"那天**风大**得我不得不按住帽子。"},
52498:{"w":"shorts","e":"He wore shorts and a T-shirt to play football after school.","t":"放学后，他穿着**短裤**和T恤去踢足球。"},
52499:{"w":"cooperate","e":"We must cooperate to finish this class project by Friday.","t":"我们得**合作**，才能在周五前完成这个班级项目。"},
52500:{"w":"would","e":"She said that she would visit us next week.","t":"她说她下周**会**来看我们。"},
52501:{"w":"lovely","e":"What a lovely day! Let's have a picnic by the river.","t":"多么**美好**的一天啊！我们去河边野餐吧。"},
52502:{"w":"costume","e":"I wore a rabbit costume in the school play last week.","t":"上周，我穿着兔子**戏服**参加了学校的演出。"},
52503:{"w":"major","e":"Traffic is a major problem in our town during the summer.","t":"夏天，交通是我们镇的一个**主要**问题。"},
52504:{"w":"legend","e":"My grandma told me a legend about a king and his horse.","t":"奶奶给我讲了一个关于国王和他的马的**传说**。"},
52505:{"w":"agent","e":"The travel agent helped us find a hotel near the beach.","t":"旅行社的**代理人**帮我们在海边找了一家酒店。"},
52506:{"w":"gallery","e":"We saw some beautiful paintings at the gallery last Saturday.","t":"上周六，我们在**美术馆**看到了一些漂亮的画。"},
52507:{"w":"regard","e":"Many people regard this old bridge as the symbol of our town.","t":"许多人把这座老桥**视为**我们小镇的象征。"},
52508:{"w":"confident","e":"She felt confident about the interview because she had practised a lot.","t":"她对面试很有**自信**，因为已经练习了很多次。"},
52509:{"w":"worldwide","e":"Millions of children worldwide read this book in their own languages.","t":"**世界各地**数以百万计的孩子用自己的语言阅读这本书。"},
52510:{"w":"citizen","e":"Every citizen has the right to vote when he or she is eighteen.","t":"每个**公民**年满十八岁就有投票权。"},
52511:{"w":"search","e":"The police began to search the forest for the missing boy.","t":"警方开始在森林里**搜寻**那个失踪的男孩。"},
52512:{"w":"chopsticks","e":"Many foreign tourists are learning to use chopsticks in Chinese restaurants.","t":"许多外国游客正在中餐馆里学用**筷子**。"},
52513:{"w":"we","e":"We usually walk to school together on sunny days.","t":"晴天**我们**通常一起走路上学。"},
52514:{"w":"mutton","e":"My dad cooked mutton with carrots and potatoes for dinner.","t":"晚饭我爸爸做了胡萝卜土豆炖**羊肉**。"},
52515:{"w":"marry","e":"My cousin is going to marry her boyfriend next spring in their hometown.","t":"我表姐明年春天要在老家**嫁给**她男朋友。"},
52516:{"w":"shut","e":"Please shut the window because it is getting cold.","t":"天越来越冷了，请**关**上窗户。"},
52517:{"w":"picnic","e":"We had a picnic by the lake after a long walk.","t":"我们走了很远的路，到了湖边**野餐**。"},
52518:{"w":"hers","e":"This schoolbag is hers, so please give it back to her.","t":"这个书包是**她的**，请还给她。"},
52519:{"w":"with","e":"I went to the cinema with my friends.","t":"我**与**朋友们一起去了电影院。"},
52520:{"w":"benefit","e":"Everyone in the town will benefit from the new library.","t":"镇上的每个人都将从新图书馆中**受益**。"},
52521:{"w":"sing","e":"She likes to sing songs in the shower.","t":"她喜欢在洗澡时**唱**歌。"},
52522:{"w":"mix","e":"Mix the flour and the eggs together, then add a little milk.","t":"把面粉和鸡蛋**搅拌**在一起，然后加一点牛奶。"},
52523:{"w":"postman","e":"The postman brought a letter from my aunt this morning.","t":"今天早上，**邮递员**送来一封姨妈的信。"},
52524:{"w":"smell","e":"Something in the kitchen smells wonderful.","t":"厨房里有什么东西**闻起来**很香。"},
52525:{"w":"live","e":"My grandparents live in a small village near the sea.","t":"我的祖父母**居住**在海边的一个小村子里。"},
52526:{"w":"likely","e":"It is likely to rain this afternoon, so you should take an umbrella with you.","t":"今天下午**可能**会下雨，所以你应该带把伞。"},
52527:{"w":"deaf","e":"My grandfather is a little deaf, so I have to speak loudly to him.","t":"我爷爷有点**耳聋**，所以我得大声跟他说话。"},
52528:{"w":"thought","e":"After some thought, she decided to join the music club.","t":"经过一番**思考**，她决定加入音乐社团。"},
52529:{"w":"sir","e":"Excuse me, sir, could you tell me where the library is?","t":"打扰一下，**先生**，请问图书馆在哪里？"},
52530:{"w":"those","e":"Could you please put those books back on the shelf?","t":"请把**那些**书放回书架上，好吗？"},
52531:{"w":"dry","e":"The ground was dry again two hours after the rain stopped.","t":"雨停两小时后，地面又**干**了。"},
52532:{"w":"save","e":"I save ten yuan a week so that I can buy a new football.","t":"我每周**存**十块钱，这样就能买一个新足球。"},
52533:{"w":"baby","e":"The baby fell asleep while her dad read a story.","t":"爸爸读故事时，那个**婴儿**睡着了。"},
52534:{"w":"responsible","e":"She is a responsible student who always finishes her homework on time.","t":"她是个**有责任感的**学生，总是按时完成作业。"},
52535:{"w":"that","e":"That bag on the chair is mine, not yours.","t":"椅子上的**那个**包是我的，不是你的。"},
52536:{"w":"nation","e":"China is a nation with a long history.","t":"中国是一个历史悠久的**国家**。"},
52537:{"w":"surprise","e":"Her sudden visit was a big surprise to all of us.","t":"她的突然来访对我们大家来说是个大**惊喜**。"},
52538:{"w":"mother","e":"My mother reads a book with me every night before bed.","t":"每天晚上睡前，我**妈妈**都会和我一起读书。"},
52539:{"w":"soft","e":"The cat likes to sleep on the soft bed by the window.","t":"那只猫喜欢睡在窗边**柔软**的床上。"},
52540:{"w":"computer","e":"I use a computer to talk to my friends after school.","t":"放学后，我用**电脑**和朋友聊天。"},
52541:{"w":"together","e":"We walked home together after the basketball game.","t":"篮球赛结束后，我们**一起**走路回家。"},
52542:{"w":"long","e":"It was a long way home, so we took the bus.","t":"回家的路很**长**，所以我们坐了公交车。"},
52543:{"w":"dragon","e":"The story is about a brave girl who saves her village from a fierce dragon.","t":"这个故事讲的是一个勇敢的女孩从一条凶猛的**巨龙**手中救下了村子。"},
52544:{"w":"strange","e":"It is strange that he did not answer his phone all day.","t":"他一整天都没接电话，真**奇怪**。"},
52545:{"w":"decide","e":"After a long talk, we decided to visit my aunt on Sunday.","t":"长谈之后，我们**决定**星期天去看望姑姑。"},
52546:{"w":"row","e":"We sat in the front row so that we could see the stage clearly.","t":"我们坐在前**排**，这样就能把舞台看清楚。"},
52547:{"w":"as","e":"Tom uses an old box as a chair.","t":"汤姆用一个旧箱子**当作**椅子。"},
52548:{"w":"large","e":"The hotel has a large garden where guests can sit and enjoy the view.","t":"这家酒店有一座**大**花园，客人可以坐在那里欣赏风景。"},
52549:{"w":"wrong","e":"I wrote the wrong answer to the last question on the test.","t":"我把考试最后一道题的答案写**错**了。"},
52550:{"w":"film","e":"We watched a film about two children who found a lost dog.","t":"我们看了一部讲两个孩子找到一只走失的狗的**电影**。"},
52551:{"w":"yours","e":"That red umbrella by the front door is yours, isn't it?","t":"前门边那把红伞是**你的**，对吧？"},
52552:{"w":"safety","e":"For your safety, please wait behind the yellow line.","t":"为了您的**安全**，请在黄线后等候。"},
52553:{"w":"lot","e":"We saw a lot of birds by the river this morning.","t":"今天早上，我们在河边看到了**许多**鸟。"},
52554:{"w":"download","e":"Before the trip, I will download a map of the city.","t":"出发前，我会**下载**一张这座城市的地图。"},
52555:{"w":"PE","e":"We often play basketball in PE on sunny days.","t":"天气好的时候，我们常在**体育课**上打篮球。"},
52556:{"w":"basic","e":"Learning basic first aid can help you save lives.","t":"学习**基本的**急救知识能帮你挽救生命。"},
52557:{"w":"awful","e":"The food at the restaurant was awful.","t":"这家饭店的食物很**糟糕**。"},
52558:{"w":"nearby","e":"We had dinner at a nearby restaurant because we were too tired to cook.","t":"我们太累了，不想做饭，就在**附近的**一家餐馆吃了晚饭。"},
52559:{"w":"native","e":"Our teacher asked us to learn about the native culture of the island.","t":"我们的老师让我们了解这座岛上的**本土**文化。"},
52560:{"w":"original","e":"We went back to our original plan and took the train.","t":"我们还是按**原先**的计划坐了火车。"},
52561:{"w":"purse","e":"She opened her purse and took out some coins to pay for the bus ticket.","t":"她打开**钱包**，拿出几枚硬币买了公交车票。"},
52562:{"w":"discussion","e":"After a long discussion, the class decided to hold the party on Friday.","t":"经过长时间的**讨论**，全班决定星期五举行聚会。"},
52563:{"w":"court","e":"We met at the basketball court after school on Friday.","t":"周五放学后，我们在篮球**场**见了面。"},
52564:{"w":"bow","e":"The dancers will bow to the crowd after their show.","t":"演出结束后，舞者会向观众**鞠躬**。"},
52565:{"w":"sauce","e":"My mother makes a delicious tomato sauce for the noodles every Sunday.","t":"每个星期天，妈妈都会给面条做一种美味的番茄**酱汁**。"},
52566:{"w":"fetch","e":"Please go and fetch a chair from the next room.","t":"请去隔壁房间把椅子**取来**。"},
52567:{"w":"calculator","e":"I used a calculator to check my answer to the last question.","t":"我用**计算器**检查了最后一题的答案。"},
52568:{"w":"zebra","e":"We saw a zebra eating grass at the zoo yesterday.","t":"昨天我们在动物园看到一只**斑马**在吃草。"},
52569:{"w":"criticize","e":"The teacher never criticizes students in front of the class when they make mistakes.","t":"学生犯错时，这位老师从不当着全班的面**批评**他们。"},
52570:{"w":"exhibition","e":"We visited an art exhibition at the city museum last weekend.","t":"上周末我们参观了市博物馆的一个艺术**展览**。"},
52571:{"w":"avenue","e":"Our bus goes down the wide avenue near the park.","t":"我们的公交车沿着公园旁那条宽阔的**大街**行驶。"},
52572:{"w":"conjunction","e":"The conjunction “and” joins the two names in this sentence.","t":"在这个句子里，**连词** and 把两个名字连了起来。"},
52573:{"w":"tradition","e":"It is a tradition in our family to eat dumplings together on New Year's Eve.","t":"除夕一起吃饺子是我们家的**传统**。"},
52574:{"w":"mean","e":"What does this word mean, and how do you use it in a sentence?","t":"这个单词是什么**意思**，你怎么在句子里用它？"},
52575:{"w":"sign","e":"Please sign your name at the bottom of the page before you hand it in.","t":"交上来之前，请在页面底部**签上**你的名字。"},
52576:{"w":"minute","e":"Can you wait here for a minute while I get my bag?","t":"我去拿包，你能在这里等一**分钟**吗？"},
52577:{"w":"require","e":"This job requires good English and a lot of patience.","t":"这份工作**要求**有良好的英语和很大的耐心。"},
52578:{"w":"unless","e":"You will not pass the exam unless you start studying harder right now.","t":"**除非**你现在开始更努力地学习，否则考试会不及格。"},
52579:{"w":"allow","e":"My parents allow me to play games after I finish my homework.","t":"我做完作业后，爸妈**允许**我玩游戏。"},
52580:{"w":"discover","e":"We hope to discover something new on our walk through the forest.","t":"我们希望在穿过森林时**发现**一些新东西。"},
52581:{"w":"lightning","e":"We saw a flash of lightning and then heard loud thunder over the hills.","t":"我们看到一道**闪电**，接着听到山那边传来响亮的雷声。"},
52582:{"w":"stage","e":"Our teacher asked us to stand on the stage and sing.","t":"老师请我们站到**舞台**上唱歌。"},
52583:{"w":"student","e":"The new student sat next to me in English class today.","t":"今天英语课上，那位新来的**学生**坐在我旁边。"},
52584:{"w":"pay","e":"I will pay for the tickets, and you can buy the drinks.","t":"我来**付**票钱，你去买饮料。"},
52585:{"w":"beach","e":"We walked along the beach and picked up small shells.","t":"我们沿着**海滩**散步，捡了些小贝壳。"},
52586:{"w":"believe","e":"I believe that hard work will lead to success in the end.","t":"我**相信**努力最终会带来成功。"},
52587:{"w":"stick","e":"He used glue to stick the pieces together.","t":"他用胶水把碎片**黏**在一起。"},
52588:{"w":"chore","e":"Washing the dishes is the chore I hate most, so I usually cook instead.","t":"洗碗是我最讨厌的**家务活**，所以我一般负责做饭。"},
52589:{"w":"hair","e":"I like to tie my hair back before playing football.","t":"我喜欢在踢足球前把**头发**扎起来。"},
52590:{"w":"each","e":"Each student has to bring a pen and a notebook.","t":"**每个**学生都要带一支笔和一个笔记本。"},
52591:{"w":"fork","e":"Could you bring me a fork for my salad, please?","t":"能给我拿把**叉子**吃沙拉吗？"},
52592:{"w":"shame","e":"It is a shame that you can't come to my birthday party.","t":"你不能来参加我的生日聚会，真是**遗憾**。"},
52593:{"w":"land","e":"The plane will land in Beijing at noon.","t":"飞机将于中午**降落**在北京。"},
52594:{"w":"introduce","e":"Let me introduce you to my sister before we go inside.","t":"我们进去之前，我先把你**介绍**给我姐姐。"},
52595:{"w":"lock","e":"Don't forget to lock the door when you leave.","t":"离开时别忘了**锁**门。"},
52596:{"w":"return","e":"He returned the books to the library before they were due.","t":"他在到期前把书**归还**给了图书馆。"},
52597:{"w":"fan","e":"My brother is a big fan of this football team.","t":"我哥哥是这支足球队的忠实**球迷**。"},
52598:{"w":"popular","e":"Football is very popular among the students in our school.","t":"足球在我们学校的学生中很**受欢迎**。"},
52599:{"w":"aunt","e":"My aunt lives next door to my grandparents in a small town.","t":"我**姑妈**住在一个小镇上，就住在我爷爷奶奶隔壁。"},
52600:{"w":"gym","e":"I go to the gym after work three times a week to keep fit.","t":"我每周下班后去三次**健身房**锻炼身体。"},
52601:{"w":"rest","e":"You look tired, so you should take a rest after lunch.","t":"你看起来很累，午饭后应该**休息**一下。"},
52602:{"w":"half","e":"I gave my brother half of my apple at lunch.","t":"午饭时，我把苹果的**一半**给了弟弟。"},
52603:{"w":"tiny","e":"A tiny bird sat on the wall outside my window.","t":"一只**很小**的鸟停在我窗外的墙上。"},
52604:{"w":"complete","e":"I need an hour to complete my homework.","t":"我需要一个小时来**完成**作业。"},
52605:{"w":"whole","e":"She ate the whole cake by herself and felt ill afterwards.","t":"她一个人吃完了**整个**蛋糕，后来觉得不舒服。"},
52606:{"w":"earth","e":"The earth goes around the sun once every year.","t":"**地球**每年绕太阳转一圈。"},
52607:{"w":"sorry","e":"I am sorry I lost the book you lent me.","t":"我很**抱歉**，把你借我的书弄丢了。"},
52608:{"w":"be","e":"I want to be a teacher when I grow up.","t":"我长大以后想**当**老师。"},
52609:{"w":"flag","e":"Our class made a blue and yellow flag for sports day.","t":"我们班为运动会做了一面蓝黄相间的**旗帜**。"},
52610:{"w":"later","e":"I came home first, and my brother came home ten minutes later.","t":"我先到家，十分钟**后**我弟弟才回来。"},
52611:{"w":"wonderful","e":"We had a wonderful time at the beach with our friends last summer.","t":"去年夏天我们和朋友们在海滩度过了一段**美妙**的时光。"},
52612:{"w":"therefore","e":"It was raining heavily that morning; therefore, the school sports day was put off.","t":"那天上午下着大雨，**因此**学校运动会推迟了。"},
52613:{"w":"eye","e":"She closed one eye to look through the small hole.","t":"她闭上一只**眼睛**，透过小孔往里看。"},
52614:{"w":"moon","e":"The moon was bright enough for us to see the road.","t":"**月亮**很亮，我们能看清路。"},
52615:{"w":"Mr","e":"Mr Brown teaches English at our school on Monday mornings.","t":"布朗**先生**周一上午在我们学校教英语。"},
52616:{"w":"seldom","e":"My grandfather seldom watches TV because he prefers reading.","t":"我爷爷**很少**看电视，因为他更喜欢读书。"},
52617:{"w":"guitar","e":"My brother plays the guitar in a small band at his university.","t":"我哥哥在大学的一个小乐队里弹**吉他**。"},
52618:{"w":"worker","e":"The new worker showed me how to use the machine.","t":"那位新来的**工人**教我怎么用这台机器。"},
52619:{"w":"training","e":"All new workers must receive training before they start the job.","t":"所有新员工开始工作前都必须接受**培训**。"},
52620:{"w":"player","e":"Every player on the team brought a bottle of water.","t":"队里每个**选手**都带了一瓶水。"},
52621:{"w":"toast","e":"I usually have toast with butter and a glass of milk for breakfast.","t":"我早餐通常吃抹了黄油的**烤面包**，再喝一杯牛奶。"},
52622:{"w":"retire","e":"My grandmother plans to retire at the end of this year.","t":"我奶奶打算今年年底**退休**。"},
52623:{"w":"popularity","e":"The growing popularity of this game surprised our teacher.","t":"这款游戏越来越**受欢迎**，让我们老师很意外。"},
52624:{"w":"realistic","e":"We need a realistic plan to finish the work by Friday.","t":"我们需要一个**可行**的计划，才能在周五前完成这项工作。"},
52625:{"w":"wheat","e":"Farmers grow wheat in the fields around our village.","t":"农民在我们村周围的田里种**小麦**。"},
52626:{"w":"lookout","e":"A lookout stood on the wall and watched the road below.","t":"一名**守望者**站在墙上，观察下面的路。"},
52627:{"w":"prevent","e":"A strong fence can prevent the sheep from getting out.","t":"一道结实的栅栏能**防止**羊跑出去。"},
52628:{"w":"seek","e":"You should seek help if you cannot solve the problem alone.","t":"如果你自己无法解决这个问题，就该**寻求**帮助。"},
52629:{"w":"misleading","e":"The title was misleading because the story was not about dogs.","t":"标题**误导**了读者，因为故事根本不是讲狗的。"},
52630:{"w":"barbecue","e":"We had a barbecue in the garden with our friends.","t":"我们和朋友一起在花园里**烧烤**。"},
52631:{"w":"singular","e":"In English, the singular form of \"children\" is \"child\", which many beginners forget.","t":"在英语中，children 的**单数**形式是 child，很多初学者会忘记。"},
52632:{"w":"aggressive","e":"Our neighbor's dog is quite aggressive and often barks at people passing by.","t":"邻居家的狗很**好斗**，经常冲着路人叫。"},
52633:{"w":"forbid","e":"The school rules forbid students to use their mobile phones during the exam.","t":"校规**禁止**学生在考试时使用手机。"},
52634:{"w":"crowded","e":"The bus was so crowded that we could not sit down.","t":"公交车上太**拥挤**了，我们找不到座位。"},
52635:{"w":"pie","e":"My dad made an apple pie for my birthday yesterday.","t":"爸爸昨天为我的生日做了一个苹果**馅饼**。"},
52636:{"w":"stomach","e":"I had a pain in my stomach after eating too much.","t":"吃得太多后，我的**胃**很疼。"},
52637:{"w":"burn","e":"The dry wood burns quickly, so be careful with the fire.","t":"干木头**燃烧**得很快，所以用火要小心。"},
52638:{"w":"delicious","e":"My grandmother makes delicious dumplings every time we visit her during the Spring Festival.","t":"每年春节我们去看奶奶，她都会包**美味的**饺子。"},
52639:{"w":"perform","e":"Our class will perform a short play for the school festival.","t":"我们班将在学校节庆活动上**表演**一个短剧。"},
52640:{"w":"along","e":"We walked along the river until we reached the old bridge.","t":"我们**沿着**河走，一直走到那座老桥。"},
52641:{"w":"might","e":"It might rain this afternoon, so take an umbrella with you.","t":"今天下午**可能**会下雨，所以带把伞吧。"},
52642:{"w":"trade","e":"Trade between the two countries has grown quickly in recent years.","t":"近年来，两国之间的**贸易**增长很快。"},
52643:{"w":"drama","e":"Our class will perform a drama about friendship at the school festival next month.","t":"下个月我们班将在学校艺术节上表演一部关于友谊的**戏剧**。"},
52644:{"w":"power","e":"The power of the storm destroyed several houses in our small village.","t":"风暴的**力量**摧毁了我们小村庄里的几座房子。"},
52645:{"w":"least","e":"She did the least of all of us, but she still got the same prize.","t":"我们中她做得**最少**，却得了同样的奖。"},
52646:{"w":"cheat","e":"You should never cheat on a test, even if it is hard.","t":"就算考试很难，也绝对不能**作弊**。"},
52647:{"w":"train","e":"We took the train to Beijing and arrived in the evening.","t":"我们坐**火车**去北京，晚上到的。"},
52648:{"w":"focus","e":"The teacher asked us to focus on the first question and ignore the rest.","t":"老师让我们把注意力**集中**在第一道题上，先不管其他的。"},
52649:{"w":"compete","e":"Many students compete for a place in the school basketball team.","t":"许多学生**竞争**学校篮球队的一个名额。"},
52650:{"w":"taxi","e":"We took a taxi home because the last bus had left.","t":"末班车已经开走了，所以我们坐**出租车**回家。"},
52651:{"w":"uniform","e":"My school uniform is blue, but my brother's is green.","t":"我的**校服**是蓝色的，我哥哥的是绿色的。"},
52652:{"w":"describe","e":"Can you describe what you saw on your way home?","t":"你能**描述**一下你在回家路上看见了什么吗？"},
52653:{"w":"sad","e":"She felt sad when her best friend moved to another city.","t":"她最好的朋友搬去了另一座城市，她很**难过**。"},
52654:{"w":"careless","e":"It was careless of me to leave my phone on the bus.","t":"把手机落在公交车上，我真**粗心**。"},
52655:{"w":"human","e":"We learned about the human body in science class today.","t":"今天科学课上，我们学习了**人**体知识。"},
52656:{"w":"promise","e":"I promise to call you when I get to the station.","t":"我**保证**到了车站就给你打电话。"},
52657:{"w":"however","e":"I wanted to go outside. However, it was still raining.","t":"我想出去。**可是**雨还在下。"},
52658:{"w":"stand","e":"Please stand up when the teacher comes in.","t":"老师进来时请**站**起来。"},
52659:{"w":"low","e":"The wall is low enough for us to see over it.","t":"这堵墙很**矮**，我们能看见墙那边。"},
52660:{"w":"visit","e":"We plan to visit the Great Wall this weekend.","t":"我们打算这个周末去**参观**长城。"},
52661:{"w":"car","e":"We put our bags in the car and drove to the beach.","t":"我们把包放进**汽车**里，开车去了海滩。"},
52662:{"w":"operate","e":"The lift didn't operate.","t":"电梯不**运转**了。"},
52663:{"w":"bully","e":"Nobody should bully younger children just because they are smaller.","t":"任何人都不该因为年幼的孩子个子小就**欺负**他们。"},
52664:{"w":"jacket","e":"Take a jacket with you because it gets cold at night.","t":"带一件**夹克衫**吧，晚上会变冷。"},
52665:{"w":"cheese","e":"I put a little cheese on my bread for lunch.","t":"午饭时，我在面包上放了一点**奶酪**。"},
52666:{"w":"satisfy","e":"A short answer would not satisfy the teacher, so I explained more.","t":"老师不会对这么简短的回答**满意**，所以我又多解释了几句。"},
52667:{"w":"free","e":"The museum is free on Sundays, so we often go there.","t":"博物馆星期天**免费**，所以我们常去。"},
52668:{"w":"housework","e":"My brother and I share the housework every weekend.","t":"每个周末我和哥哥一起分担**家务**。"},
52669:{"w":"born","e":"She is a born singer, and everyone loves her voice.","t":"她是个**天生的**歌手，大家都喜欢她的嗓音。"},
52670:{"w":"air","e":"Open the window and let some fresh air into the room.","t":"打开窗户，让新鲜**空气**进来。"},
52671:{"w":"how","e":"How did you solve such a difficult math problem so quickly?","t":"你是**怎样**这么快就解出这么难的数学题的？"},
52672:{"w":"read","e":"I read a story before I go to sleep every night.","t":"我每天晚上睡觉前都会**读**一个故事。"},
52673:{"w":"left","e":"Turn left at the corner, and you will see the post office.","t":"在拐角处向**左**转，你就会看到邮局。"},
52674:{"w":"say","e":"What did he say about the new school rules?","t":"关于新校规，他**说**了什么？"},
52675:{"w":"book","e":"I borrowed a book about animals from the school library.","t":"我从学校图书馆借了一本关于动物的**书**。"},
52676:{"w":"in","e":"Your keys are in the blue bag by the door.","t":"你的钥匙在门边的蓝包**里**。"},
52677:{"w":"raise","e":"Please raise your hand if you know the answer to this question.","t":"如果你知道这个问题的答案，请**举**手。"},
52678:{"w":"era","e":"These old photos show life in an era before cars.","t":"这些老照片展示了还没有汽车的那个**时代**的生活。"},
52679:{"w":"kick","e":"He kicked the ball so hard that it flew over the wall.","t":"他把球**踢**得很用力，球飞过了墙。"},
52680:{"w":"between","e":"The small village lies between two high mountains, so it is very quiet.","t":"这个小村庄位于两座高山**之间**，所以非常安静。"},
52681:{"w":"cookie","e":"I saved one cookie for my brother to eat after school.","t":"我给弟弟留了一块**曲奇饼**，等他放学回来吃。"},
52682:{"w":"outgoing","e":"Lucy is an outgoing girl who makes new friends easily.","t":"露西是个**外向**的女孩，很容易结交新朋友。"},
52683:{"w":"bored","e":"I felt bored during the long speech, so I kept looking at my watch.","t":"在那场冗长的演讲中我觉得很**无聊**，不停地看表。"},
52684:{"w":"elbow","e":"He hurt his elbow when he fell off his bike.","t":"他从自行车上摔下来，伤到了**胳膊肘**。"},
52685:{"w":"useful","e":"This map will be useful when we walk around the city.","t":"我们在城里走的时候，这张地图会很**有用**。"},
52686:{"w":"competition","e":"Our class won first place in the school singing competition.","t":"我们班在学校歌唱**比赛**中得了第一名。"},
52687:{"w":"terrorist","e":"In the film, the police caught the terrorist at the airport.","t":"影片中，警察在机场抓住了那名**恐怖分子**。"},
52688:{"w":"bookcase","e":"We moved the bookcase closer to the window this morning.","t":"今天早上，我们把**书柜**挪得离窗户更近了。"},
52689:{"w":"loving","e":"She sent a loving message to her son before bed.","t":"睡前，她给儿子发了一条**充满爱意**的消息。"},
52690:{"w":"elevator","e":"We took the elevator to the top floor of the hotel.","t":"我们坐**电梯**到了酒店顶楼。"},
52691:{"w":"fax","e":"I sent a fax to the hotel to book a room for next week.","t":"我给酒店发了一份**传真**，预订下周的房间。"},
52692:{"w":"mysterious","e":"We heard a mysterious sound coming from behind the door.","t":"我们听到门后传来一种**神秘**的声音。"},
52693:{"w":"climate","e":"The climate here is mild, with warm summers and cool, wet winters.","t":"这里的**气候**温和，夏季温暖，冬季凉爽多雨。"},
52694:{"w":"magic","e":"The children watched a magic show at the school fair.","t":"孩子们在学校集市上看了一场**魔术**表演。"},
52695:{"w":"lay","e":"She laid the baby gently on the bed.","t":"她轻轻地把婴儿**放**在床上。"},
52696:{"w":"friend","e":"I met my best friend on my first day at school.","t":"我在上学第一天遇到了我最好的**朋友**。"},
52697:{"w":"case","e":"In this case, we should ask the teacher for help.","t":"在这种**情况**下，我们应该向老师求助。"},
52698:{"w":"recommend","e":"Can you recommend a good book for me to read?","t":"你能给我**推荐**一本好书读吗？"},
52699:{"w":"heavy","e":"This bag is too heavy for me to carry upstairs.","t":"这个包太**重**了，我搬不上楼。"},
52700:{"w":"easy","e":"The first question was easy, so I answered it quickly.","t":"第一道题很**容易**，所以我很快就答完了。"},
52701:{"w":"dictionary","e":"I looked up the new word in my English dictionary.","t":"我在英语**词典**里查了这个生词。"},
52702:{"w":"meeting","e":"Our class meeting starts at two in the afternoon today.","t":"我们班的**会议**今天下午两点开始。"},
52703:{"w":"your","e":"Please put your bag under the desk before the test.","t":"考试前请把**你的**包放在桌子底下。"},
52704:{"w":"survey","e":"Our class did a survey to find out what students read.","t":"我们班做了一项**调查**，想了解同学们都读些什么。"},
52705:{"w":"appear","e":"A rainbow appeared in the sky just after the rain.","t":"雨刚停，天空就**出现**了一道彩虹。"},
52706:{"w":"possible","e":"Is it possible to finish the project by Friday?","t":"周五之前**可能**完成这个项目吗？"},
52707:{"w":"salad","e":"For lunch I had a big bowl of salad with tomatoes, eggs and cheese.","t":"午饭我吃了一大碗加了西红柿、鸡蛋和奶酪的**色拉**。"},
52708:{"w":"another","e":"I finished my apple and asked Dad for another one.","t":"我吃完了苹果，又向爸爸要了**一个**。"},
52709:{"w":"wash","e":"Please wash your hands with soap before you eat anything.","t":"吃东西之前，请用肥皂**洗**手。"},
52710:{"w":"passport","e":"Don't forget to bring your passport when you travel abroad.","t":"出国旅行时别忘了带上你的**护照**。"},
52711:{"w":"aid","e":"The school offered aid to families after the big storm.","t":"那场大风暴过后，学校向一些家庭提供了**援助**。"},
52712:{"w":"science","e":"Science is my favourite subject because we do many interesting experiments.","t":"**科学**是我最喜欢的科目，因为我们做很多有趣的实验。"},
52713:{"w":"gun","e":"The toy gun in the shop window was bright green.","t":"橱窗里的玩具**枪**是亮绿色的。"},
52714:{"w":"research","e":"Scientists are doing research on how bees find flowers.","t":"科学家们正在**研究**蜜蜂是怎样找到花的。"},
52715:{"w":"farmer","e":"The farmer grows potatoes in the field behind his house.","t":"这位**农民**在自家屋后的田里种土豆。"},
52716:{"w":"prepare","e":"My parents are busy preparing dinner for twelve guests tonight.","t":"爸妈正忙着为今晚的十二位客人**准备**晚饭。"},
52717:{"w":"hero","e":"The firefighter became a local hero after he saved three children from the fire.","t":"这位消防员从大火中救出了三个孩子，成了当地的**英雄**。"},
52718:{"w":"remind","e":"Please remind me to bring my books back to school.","t":"请**提醒**我把书带回学校。"},
52719:{"w":"passage","e":"Read the passage about space before you answer the questions.","t":"回答问题前，先读一读这**段**关于太空的文字。"},
52720:{"w":"and","e":"My sister and I take the bus to school every day.","t":"我**和**姐姐每天坐公交车上学。"},
52721:{"w":"corner","e":"There is a small café on the corner of our street.","t":"我们这条街的**拐角**处有一家小咖啡馆。"},
52722:{"w":"cat","e":"The little cat is sleeping in a box by the door.","t":"那只小**猫**正在门边的箱子里睡觉。"},
52723:{"w":"nor","e":"He did not call, nor did he send me a message.","t":"他没有打电话，**也没有**给我发消息。"},
52724:{"w":"recycle","e":"We recycle our old bottles instead of throwing them away.","t":"我们把旧瓶子**回收**起来，不把它们扔掉。"},
52725:{"w":"trip","e":"We took a trip to the mountains last summer holiday.","t":"去年暑假我们去山里**旅行**了。"},
52726:{"w":"which","e":"Which of these two coats do you like better?","t":"这两件外套里，你更喜欢**哪一件**？"},
52727:{"w":"background","e":"There are some trees in the background of the picture.","t":"这幅画的**背景**里有几棵树。"},
52728:{"w":"night","e":"We could see many bright stars in the sky at night.","t":"**夜里**我们能看到天空中有许多明亮的星星。"},
52729:{"w":"physics","e":"My brother is studying physics at university and wants to become a scientist.","t":"我哥哥在大学里学**物理**，想成为一名科学家。"},
52730:{"w":"lab","e":"We keep the door of the science lab closed after class.","t":"下课后，我们把科学**实验室**的门关着。"},
52731:{"w":"screen","e":"We watched the football game on a big screen at school.","t":"我们在学校的大**屏幕**上看了这场足球赛。"},
52732:{"w":"dirty","e":"Your shoes are dirty, so please take them off outside.","t":"你的鞋**脏**了，请在外面脱掉。"},
52733:{"w":"average","e":"How many hours a day on average do you watch TV?","t":"你**平均**每天看几个小时电视？"},
52734:{"w":"level","e":"The water level in this river rises after heavy rain.","t":"下大雨后，这条河的**水位**会上升。"},
52735:{"w":"poet","e":"The young poet wrote a short poem about her hometown.","t":"那位年轻的**诗人**写了一首关于家乡的短诗。"},
52736:{"w":"welcome","e":"Our school will welcome about two hundred new students next month.","t":"下个月我们学校将**欢迎**约两百名新生。"},
52737:{"w":"hungry","e":"I felt hungry after swimming for an hour this morning.","t":"今天早上游了一小时泳后，我觉得很**饿**。"},
52738:{"w":"social","e":"Many teenagers spend hours every day on social media talking with their friends.","t":"许多青少年每天花好几个小时在**社交**媒体上和朋友聊天。"},
52739:{"w":"smoke","e":"We could see thick smoke rising from the roof of the old house.","t":"我们看到浓**烟**从老房子的屋顶升起。"},
52740:{"w":"customer","e":"The shop assistant helped the customer find a gift for her mother.","t":"店员帮**顾客**挑选送给她妈妈的礼物。"},
52741:{"w":"combine","e":"The school plans to combine the two classes into one next year.","t":"学校计划明年把这两个班**合并**成一个。"},
52742:{"w":"waiter","e":"The waiter brought us water before we ordered our food.","t":"我们点餐前，**服务员**给我们端来了水。"},
52743:{"w":"chase","e":"The little dog chased a ball across the school yard.","t":"小狗**追着**球跑过了学校的院子。"},
52744:{"w":"sink","e":"The heavy stone sank to the bottom of the pond.","t":"那块沉重的石头**沉**到了池塘底部。"},
52745:{"w":"disadvantage","e":"Living far from school is a disadvantage in bad weather.","t":"天气不好时，住得离学校远是个**不利条件**。"},
52746:{"w":"assistant","e":"The shop assistant helped me find the right shoe size.","t":"**店员**帮我找到了合适的鞋码。"},
52747:{"w":"zigzag","e":"We followed a zigzag path up to the hilltop.","t":"我们沿着一条**曲折**的小路走上山顶。"},
52748:{"w":"treatment","e":"The little dog needed treatment after hurting its back leg.","t":"那只小狗的后腿受伤了，需要**治疗**。"},
52749:{"w":"airplane","e":"The airplane landed safely in spite of the strong wind and heavy rain.","t":"尽管风大雨急，**飞机**还是安全降落了。"},
52750:{"w":"super","e":"We had a super time at the school party last night.","t":"昨晚的学校聚会上，我们玩得**非常开心**。"},
52751:{"w":"cupboard","e":"Please put the clean plates and bowls back in the kitchen cupboard after dinner.","t":"晚饭后请把洗干净的盘子和碗放回厨房的**橱柜**里。"},
52752:{"w":"telephone","e":"The telephone rang just as we sat down to dinner.","t":"我们刚坐下吃晚饭，**电话**就响了。"},
52753:{"w":"escalator","e":"We took the escalator to the second floor of the shop.","t":"我们乘**扶梯**到了商店二楼。"},
52754:{"w":"surf","e":"My cousin learned to surf at the beach last summer.","t":"去年夏天，我表哥在海边学会了**冲浪**。"},
52755:{"w":"vocabulary","e":"Reading English stories every day is a good way to build your vocabulary.","t":"每天读英语故事是扩大**词汇量**的好方法。"},
52756:{"w":"writer","e":"The writer came to our school to talk about her books.","t":"那位**作家**来到我们学校，和我们聊她的书。"},
52757:{"w":"escape","e":"The rabbit escaped when I left the cage door open.","t":"我没关笼门，兔子就**逃跑**了。"},
52758:{"w":"spider","e":"A small spider was making a web in the corner of the window.","t":"一只小**蜘蛛**正在窗户角落里结网。"},
52759:{"w":"ocean","e":"We could see the ocean from our room that morning.","t":"那天早上，我们从房间里就能看见**大海**。"},
52760:{"w":"wonder","e":"I wonder why the little bird keeps coming back here.","t":"我**想知道**那只小鸟为什么总飞回来。"},
52761:{"w":"electric","e":"My dad rides an electric bike to work every morning.","t":"爸爸每天早上骑**电动**自行车去上班。"},
52762:{"w":"what","e":"What did you have for lunch at school today?","t":"你今天在学校午饭吃了**什么**？"},
52763:{"w":"tie","e":"He tied the boat to a post so that it would not float away.","t":"他把船**拴**在柱子上，这样它就不会漂走了。"},
52764:{"w":"both","e":"Both of my parents work at the hospital, and they often come home late.","t":"我父母**都**在医院工作，经常很晚才回家。"},
52765:{"w":"lazy","e":"Our lazy dog slept on the same chair all afternoon.","t":"我们那只**懒**狗在同一把椅子上睡了一下午。"},
52766:{"w":"rocket","e":"We watched the rocket rise into the sky on TV.","t":"我们在电视上看着**火箭**升上天空。"},
52767:{"w":"saw","e":"I saw two white rabbits in the park this morning.","t":"今天早上，我在公园里**看见**两只白兔。"},
52768:{"w":"real","e":"Is this a real diamond or just a piece of glass?","t":"这是**真的**钻石，还是只是一块玻璃？"},
52769:{"w":"speak","e":"Could you speak more slowly? I can't follow what you are saying.","t":"你能**说**得慢一点吗？我跟不上你说的话。"},
52770:{"w":"begin","e":"The film begins at seven, so we should leave now.","t":"电影七点**开始**，所以我们现在该走了。"},
52771:{"w":"slim","e":"My brother is slim because he does sports every day.","t":"哥哥每天做运动，所以身材很**苗条**。"},
52772:{"w":"pepper","e":"I put a little pepper in my soup at lunch.","t":"午饭时，我在汤里放了点**胡椒粉**。"},
52773:{"w":"weather","e":"I hope the weather stays warm for our picnic tomorrow.","t":"我希望明天野餐时**天气**还是这么暖和。"},
52774:{"w":"tennis","e":"We often play tennis together after school on Friday afternoons.","t":"周五下午放学后，我们经常一起打**网球**。"},
52775:{"w":"ice","e":"She put some ice in her glass of orange juice.","t":"她往自己的那杯橙汁里放了些**冰块**。"},
52776:{"w":"plan","e":"We plan to visit the science museum next Tuesday with our class.","t":"我们**打算**下周二和全班同学一起去参观科学馆。"},
52777:{"w":"height","e":"The school nurse checked my height and wrote it down.","t":"学校护士量了我的**身高**，并把它记了下来。"},
52778:{"w":"clear","e":"The teacher's instructions were clear, so everyone knew what to do.","t":"老师的指示很**清楚**，所以每个人都知道该做什么。"},
52779:{"w":"century","e":"This bridge was built at the end of the nineteenth century.","t":"这座桥建于十九**世纪**末。"},
52780:{"w":"spare","e":"Thank you very much for sparing so much of your time to talk with me.","t":"非常感谢您**抽出**这么长的时间与我谈话。"},
52781:{"w":"difficult","e":"This maths problem is too difficult for me.","t":"这道数学题对我来说太**难**了。"},
52782:{"w":"festival","e":"Our town holds a music festival in the park every July.","t":"我们镇每年七月都在公园举办音乐**节**。"},
52783:{"w":"home","e":"I went straight home after school to feed my dog.","t":"放学后，我直接回**家**给狗喂食。"},
52784:{"w":"behave","e":"The children behaved well on their trip to the museum.","t":"孩子们去博物馆参观时**表现**很好。"},
52785:{"w":"medical","e":"Free medical care is offered to all the students.","t":"所有学生都能享受免费的**医疗**服务。"},
52786:{"w":"hamburger","e":"I had a hamburger and a glass of orange juice for lunch.","t":"午饭我吃了一个**汉堡包**，喝了一杯橙汁。"},
52787:{"w":"anyone","e":"Is there anyone here who can help me find my bag?","t":"这儿有**人**能帮我找一下我的包吗？"},
52788:{"w":"after","e":"We went for a short walk after dinner last night.","t":"昨晚吃**过**晚饭，我们出去走了一会儿。"},
52789:{"w":"enough","e":"We have enough time to finish the project before dinner.","t":"我们有**足够**的时间在晚饭前完成这个项目。"},
52790:{"w":"common","e":"This kind of bird is common in parks near my home.","t":"这种鸟在我家附近的公园里很**常见**。"},
52791:{"w":"he","e":"My brother said he would wait for us outside the shop.","t":"我哥哥说，**他**会在商店外面等我们。"},
52792:{"w":"his","e":"Jack put on his coat and ran out of the house.","t":"杰克穿上**他的**外套，跑出了家门。"},
52793:{"w":"shock","e":"The bad news shocked everyone in the room.","t":"这个坏消息让屋里的每个人都很**震惊**。"},
52794:{"w":"disease","e":"Doctors are working hard to find a cure for this disease.","t":"医生们正努力寻找治愈这种**疾病**的方法。"},
52795:{"w":"need","e":"You need to drink more water when the weather is hot.","t":"天气热的时候，你**需要**多喝水。"},
52796:{"w":"last","e":"The concert will last about two hours, with a short break.","t":"音乐会将**持续**大约两个小时，中间有短暂的休息。"},
52797:{"w":"drink","e":"You should drink plenty of water after playing sports in hot weather.","t":"在炎热的天气里运动后，你应该多**喝**水。"},
52798:{"w":"hug","e":"My grandfather always gives me a hug when I visit him.","t":"我去看望爷爷时，他总会给我一个**拥抱**。"},
52799:{"w":"number","e":"Please write your phone number at the top of the page.","t":"请把你的电话**号码**写在页面顶部。"},
52800:{"w":"progress","e":"Tom has made great progress in English since he joined the speaking club.","t":"汤姆加入口语俱乐部以后，英语**进步**很大。"},
52801:{"w":"town","e":"There is a big market in our town every Saturday.","t":"我们**镇**上每周六都有一个大集市。"},
52802:{"w":"light","e":"Please turn off the light when you leave the classroom.","t":"离开教室时请关**灯**。"},
52803:{"w":"yard","e":"The children played in the yard while their parents cooked dinner.","t":"父母做晚饭时，孩子们在**院子**里玩。"},
52804:{"w":"appointment","e":"I have an appointment with the dentist at three o'clock tomorrow afternoon.","t":"我明天下午三点和牙医有个**预约**。"},
52805:{"w":"symphony","e":"We listened to a famous symphony at the concert hall last night.","t":"昨晚我们在音乐厅听了一首著名的**交响乐**。"},
52806:{"w":"announce","e":"The school announced that classes would start an hour later on Monday.","t":"学校**宣布**星期一的课程将推迟一小时开始。"},
52807:{"w":"chest","e":"He took a deep breath and felt his chest rise.","t":"他深吸了一口气，感到自己的**胸口**鼓了起来。"},
52808:{"w":"gentle","e":"The nurse spoke in a gentle voice to calm the crying child.","t":"护士用**温柔**的声音安抚哭泣的孩子。"},
52809:{"w":"injure","e":"Three people were injured in the car accident, but luckily nobody was killed.","t":"有三人在这起车祸中**受伤**，幸好没有人死亡。"},
52810:{"w":"spoken","e":"Her spoken English is much better than her written English.","t":"她的英语**口语**比书面英语好得多。"},
52811:{"w":"establish","e":"The teachers helped us establish a new club at school.","t":"老师们帮我们在学校**建立**了一个新社团。"},
52812:{"w":"rank","e":"Our school ranks first in the town for girls' football.","t":"我们学校的女子足球在全镇**排名**第一。"},
52813:{"w":"helicopter","e":"The helicopter flew over the sea to look for the missing boat.","t":"**直升机**飞过大海，寻找失踪的船。"},
52814:{"w":"stair","e":"She ran up the stairs to get her school bag.","t":"她跑上**楼梯**去拿自己的书包。"},
52815:{"w":"serious","e":"The doctor looked serious when he read the test results.","t":"医生看检查结果时神情**严肃**。"},
52816:{"w":"certain","e":"I'm certain that I put my keys on the table.","t":"我**确信**我把钥匙放在桌子上了。"},
52817:{"w":"illness","e":"Ben missed his first day at school because of illness.","t":"本因**病**错过了开学第一天。"},
52818:{"w":"word","e":"I didn't understand the last word in the sentence, so I looked it up.","t":"我没看懂句子里的最后一个**单词**，就查了词典。"},
52819:{"w":"control","e":"The teacher found it hard to control the noisy class on the last day.","t":"最后一天，老师很难**控制**吵闹的班级。"},
52820:{"w":"will","e":"The train will arrive in ten minutes, so please get ready.","t":"火车十分钟后**将**到站，请大家做好准备。"},
52821:{"w":"madam","e":"May I help you carry that bag to your car, madam?","t":"**女士**，我可以帮您把那个包拿到车上吗？"},
52822:{"w":"really","e":"Did you really make this cake all by yourself today?","t":"今天这个蛋糕**真**的是你自己做的吗？"},
52823:{"w":"report","e":"The newspaper reported that the new bridge would open next month.","t":"报纸**报道**说，新桥将于下个月通车。"},
52824:{"w":"dad","e":"My dad took me to the park on his day off.","t":"**爸爸**休息那天带我去了公园。"},
52825:{"w":"loud","e":"The music was so loud that I couldn't hear you.","t":"音乐声太**响**了，我听不到你说话。"},
52826:{"w":"basketball","e":"We play basketball in the school gym on rainy days.","t":"下雨天，我们在学校的体育馆打**篮球**。"},
52827:{"w":"jeans","e":"He usually wears jeans and a T-shirt when he goes out with friends.","t":"他和朋友出去时通常穿**牛仔裤**和T恤。"},
52828:{"w":"gate","e":"Let's meet at the school gate at half past seven.","t":"我们七点半在学校**大门**口见。"},
52829:{"w":"ant","e":"A tiny ant was carrying a piece of bread home.","t":"一只小**蚂蚁**正搬着一小块面包回家。"},
52830:{"w":"courage","e":"It takes great courage to speak in front of the whole school.","t":"在全校师生面前讲话需要很大的**勇气**。"},
52831:{"w":"there","e":"My uncle has lived there since he moved to Shanghai ten years ago.","t":"自从十年前搬到上海，我叔叔就一直住在**那里**。"},
52832:{"w":"warm","e":"This coat will keep you warm on cold winter days.","t":"这件外套能让你在寒冷的冬日里保持**暖和**。"},
52833:{"w":"pack","e":"I need to pack my suitcase tonight, because we leave early tomorrow.","t":"我今晚得**整理**行李箱，因为明天要早走。"},
52834:{"w":"orange","e":"I peeled an orange and shared it with my friend.","t":"我剥了一个**橙子**，和朋友分着吃。"},
52835:{"w":"mad","e":"Dad was mad at me because I broke his favourite cup.","t":"爸爸很**生气**，因为我打碎了他最喜欢的杯子。"},
52836:{"w":"pet","e":"Her pet dog follows her to school every day.","t":"她的**宠物**狗每天跟着她去学校。"},
52837:{"w":"middle","e":"There is a big round table in the middle of the classroom.","t":"教室**中间**有一张大圆桌。"},
52838:{"w":"awake","e":"The baby was awake all night and cried a lot.","t":"宝宝整夜都**醒着**，哭得很厉害。"},
52839:{"w":"street","e":"Our school is on a quiet street near the river.","t":"我们学校在河边一条安静的**街**上。"},
52840:{"w":"you","e":"I have a little present for you in my bag.","t":"我包里有一份送给**你**的小礼物。"},
52841:{"w":"pocket","e":"My keys were in my coat pocket the whole time.","t":"我的钥匙一直在外套**口袋**里。"},
52842:{"w":"tall","e":"That tree is so tall we can't see the top.","t":"那棵树太**高**了，我们看不到树顶。"},
52843:{"w":"team","e":"My sister joined the school swimming team two months ago.","t":"我妹妹两个月前加入了校游泳**队**。"},
52844:{"w":"whatever","e":"You can choose whatever book you like from this shelf.","t":"这个书架上的书，**哪本**喜欢你就选哪本。"},
52845:{"w":"country","e":"She moved to another country when she was eight years old.","t":"她八岁时搬到了另一个**国家**。"},
52846:{"w":"belt","e":"He wore a black belt with his new school trousers.","t":"他穿着新校裤，系了一条黑色**皮带**。"},
52847:{"w":"seem","e":"You seem tired today, so you should go to bed early.","t":"你今天**似乎**很累，应该早点睡觉。"},
52848:{"w":"pull","e":"He had to pull hard to open the heavy wooden door.","t":"他得用力**拉**才能打开那扇沉重的木门。"},
52849:{"w":"afternoon","e":"We spent the whole afternoon reading books in the garden.","t":"我们整个**下午**都在花园里看书。"},
52850:{"w":"role","e":"He plays the role of a doctor in the school play.","t":"他在学校的戏剧里饰演一个医生的**角色**。"},
52851:{"w":"express","e":"She found it hard to express her feelings in a foreign language.","t":"她觉得用外语很难**表达**自己的感受。"},
52852:{"w":"sweep","e":"Please sweep the floor before our guests arrive this evening.","t":"今晚客人来之前，请**扫**一下地。"},
52853:{"w":"busy","e":"My mother is always busy in the morning, so she has little time for breakfast.","t":"我妈妈早上总是很**忙**，几乎没时间吃早饭。"},
52854:{"w":"steal","e":"Someone stole my bike while I was in the library.","t":"我在图书馆时，有人**偷**走了我的自行车。"},
52855:{"w":"regret","e":"I regret not studying harder when I was in middle school.","t":"我**后悔**初中时没有更努力地学习。"},
52856:{"w":"tidy","e":"Her room is always clean and tidy, with every book in its place.","t":"她的房间总是干净**整洁**，每本书都放在该放的地方。"},
52857:{"w":"attend","e":"More than two hundred people attended the school concert last night.","t":"昨晚有两百多人**参加**了学校音乐会。"},
52858:{"w":"bye","e":"She waved and said bye as the bus drove away.","t":"车开走时，她挥手说了声**再见**。"},
52859:{"w":"exactly","e":"The cake took exactly thirty minutes to bake in the oven.","t":"蛋糕在烤箱里**正好**烤了三十分钟。"},
52860:{"w":"scissors","e":"I used a pair of scissors to cut the paper in half.","t":"我用**剪刀**把纸剪成了两半。"},
52861:{"w":"lively","e":"The town square was lively, with people dancing and singing.","t":"镇上的广场很**热闹**，人们又唱又跳。"},
52862:{"w":"action","e":"We must take action now to protect our rivers and lakes from pollution.","t":"我们必须现在就采取**行动**，保护河流和湖泊免受污染。"},
52863:{"w":"lemon","e":"I like to drink warm water with a slice of lemon every morning.","t":"我喜欢每天早上喝一杯加了一片**柠檬**的温水。"},
52864:{"w":"corn","e":"We ate hot corn with a little butter at lunch.","t":"午饭时，我们吃了加了一点黄油的热**玉米**。"},
52865:{"w":"chairman","e":"The chairman opened the meeting and thanked everyone for coming.","t":"**主席**宣布会议开始，并感谢大家到场。"},
52866:{"w":"dozen","e":"She bought a dozen eggs at the market this morning.","t":"今天早上她在市场买了**一打**鸡蛋。"},
52867:{"w":"musician","e":"The young musician played the piano so well that everyone stood up to clap.","t":"那位年轻的**音乐家**钢琴弹得太好了，大家都站起来鼓掌。"},
52868:{"w":"twin","e":"My twin brother and I were born five minutes apart.","t":"我和**双胞胎**哥哥的出生时间只差五分钟。"},
52869:{"w":"underwater","e":"We watched the fish swimming underwater through the glass wall.","t":"我们透过玻璃墙看鱼在**水下**游动。"},
52870:{"w":"prediction","e":"Her prediction that our team would win the game came true.","t":"她**预言**我们队会赢得比赛，后来果然应验了。"},
52871:{"w":"feature","e":"The best feature of this phone is its clear screen.","t":"这部手机最好的**特点**是屏幕清晰。"},
52872:{"w":"penny","e":"I found a penny in the pocket of my coat.","t":"我在外套口袋里找到了一**便士**。"},
52873:{"w":"dormitory","e":"We share a small room in the school dormitory.","t":"我们合住在学校**宿舍**的一间小房间里。"},
52874:{"w":"recite","e":"Every student had to recite a short poem in front of the whole class.","t":"每个学生都要在全班同学面前**背诵**一首短诗。"},
52875:{"w":"anxious","e":"She felt anxious about the test results and could not sleep.","t":"她为考试成绩感到**忧虑**，睡不着觉。"},
52876:{"w":"understand","e":"I did not understand the question, so I asked the teacher to explain it.","t":"我不**懂**这道题，所以请老师给我讲解。"},
52877:{"w":"wake","e":"My little sister woke early on her birthday this year.","t":"今年过生日那天，我妹妹很早就**醒**了。"},
52878:{"w":"ball","e":"She kicked the ball across the grass to her brother.","t":"她把**球**踢过草地，传给了哥哥。"},
52879:{"w":"menu","e":"I looked at the menu and chose the tomato soup.","t":"我看了**菜单**，选了番茄汤。"},
52880:{"w":"adult","e":"Children under twelve must be with an adult when they swim in this pool.","t":"十二岁以下的儿童在这个泳池游泳时必须有**成年人**陪同。"},
52881:{"w":"fair","e":"It isn't fair that some students get more time than others.","t":"有些学生比别的学生时间多，这不**公平**。"},
52882:{"w":"thin","e":"The paper is so thin that you can see the words on the other side.","t":"这张纸那么**薄**，你能看到另一面的字。"},
52883:{"w":"my","e":"This is my favourite book to read on the bus.","t":"这是**我**坐公交车时最爱读的一本书。"},
52884:{"w":"brain","e":"Your brain needs time to rest after a long day.","t":"忙了一整天，你的**大脑**也需要休息一会儿。"},
52885:{"w":"quite","e":"The test was quite difficult, but most of the students passed it.","t":"这次测验**十分**难，但大多数学生都通过了。"},
52886:{"w":"realise","e":"He soon realised that he had made a big mistake.","t":"他很快就**认识到**自己犯了一个大错。"},
52887:{"w":"match","e":"Why do people spend their money on a football match?","t":"为什么人们会花钱看足球**赛**呢？"},
52888:{"w":"side","e":"Please write your name on this side of the paper.","t":"请在纸的这**一面**写上你的名字。"},
52889:{"w":"opera","e":"We went to see a famous Italian opera at the new theater last weekend.","t":"上周末我们去新剧院看了一部著名的意大利**歌剧**。"},
52890:{"w":"bit","e":"There was a bit of paper under my desk today.","t":"今天我桌子底下有一小**片**纸。"},
52891:{"w":"host","e":"The host of the TV show asked the young singer a few funny questions.","t":"电视节目的**主持人**问了这位年轻歌手几个有趣的问题。"},
52892:{"w":"hostess","e":"The hostess welcomed all the guests at the front door.","t":"**女主人**在大门口迎接了所有客人。"},
52893:{"w":"handsome","e":"The boy in the film grew up to be handsome.","t":"电影里的男孩长大后很**英俊**。"},
52894:{"w":"anyway","e":"The shop was closing, but we decided to go anyway.","t":"商店快关门了，但我们**还是**决定去。"},
52895:{"w":"quarter","e":"The bus leaves in a quarter of an hour from now.","t":"公交车还有**一刻钟**就出发。"},
52896:{"w":"choice","e":"You can make your own choice about which book to read.","t":"读哪本书，你可以自己**选择**。"},
52897:{"w":"round","e":"The children sat round the fire and told stories.","t":"孩子们**围着**火堆坐着讲故事。"},
52898:{"w":"lake","e":"We walked around the lake after lunch on Sunday afternoon.","t":"星期天下午吃过午饭后，我们绕着**湖**走了一圈。"},
52899:{"w":"ability","e":"She has a special ability to remember names after hearing them once.","t":"她有一种特别的**能力**，名字听一遍就能记住。"},
52900:{"w":"unit","e":"Each unit of the textbook has four reading passages.","t":"这本教科书的每个**单元**都有四篇阅读文章。"},
52901:{"w":"their","e":"The students put their bags on the shelves before class.","t":"上课前，学生们把**自己的**书包放到了架子上。"},
52902:{"w":"best","e":"This is the best apple pie I have ever tasted.","t":"这是我吃过的**最好**吃的苹果派。"},
52903:{"w":"modern","e":"Modern cities are full of tall buildings and busy roads.","t":"**现代**城市里到处是高楼和繁忙的道路。"},
52904:{"w":"kite","e":"We flew a kite in the park on a windy day.","t":"有风的那天，我们在公园放了**风筝**。"},
52905:{"w":"tomato","e":"I cut a tomato into thin slices for my sandwich.","t":"我切了几片**番茄**放进三明治里。"},
52906:{"w":"neck","e":"She wore a warm scarf around her neck at school.","t":"她在学校给**脖子**围了一条暖和的围巾。"},
52907:{"w":"much","e":"There isn't much milk left in the bottle this morning.","t":"今天早上瓶里剩的牛奶**不多**了。"},
52908:{"w":"wave","e":"The little girl waved goodbye to her father at the school gate.","t":"小女孩在校门口向爸爸**挥手**告别。"},
52909:{"w":"hat","e":"I wore a hat to keep the sun off my face.","t":"我戴了顶**帽子**，免得太阳晒到脸。"},
52910:{"w":"badminton","e":"My friends and I often play badminton in the school gym after class.","t":"我和朋友们下课后常在学校体育馆打**羽毛球**。"},
52911:{"w":"cheap","e":"We found a cheap pair of shoes at the market.","t":"我们在市场上找到了一双**便宜**的鞋。"},
52912:{"w":"paper","e":"He wrote his address on a small piece of paper.","t":"他把自己的地址写在一张小**纸**上。"},
52913:{"w":"fat","e":"I saw a fat cat sleeping on the kitchen floor.","t":"我看见一只**胖**猫在厨房地板上睡觉。"},
52914:{"w":"encourage","e":"Her teacher always encourages her to try new things.","t":"老师总是**鼓励**她尝试新事物。"},
52915:{"w":"touch","e":"Please do not touch the wet paint on this door.","t":"请别**碰**这扇门上没干的油漆。"},
52916:{"w":"spring","e":"Many colourful flowers begin to grow here in the spring.","t":"**春天**，这里会长出许多五颜六色的花。"},
52917:{"w":"plenty","e":"There is plenty of time, so don't rush to finish your breakfast.","t":"时间很**充足**，所以别急着吃完早饭。"},
52918:{"w":"concert","e":"We went to a concert in the park last night.","t":"昨晚我们去公园听了一场**音乐会**。"},
52919:{"w":"mobile","e":"I left my mobile at home when I went to school.","t":"我去上学时把**手机**落在家里了。"},
52920:{"w":"happy","e":"She was so happy to see her old friend again.","t":"她再次见到老朋友，心里很**高兴**。"},
52921:{"w":"China","e":"My cousin came back to China after a year in France.","t":"我表哥在法国待了一年后回到了**中国**。"},
52922:{"w":"Chinese","e":"Our new neighbour is learning Chinese at the local school.","t":"我们的新邻居正在当地学校学**中文**。"},
52923:{"w":"shiny","e":"She wore her shiny new shoes to the school party.","t":"她穿着**亮闪闪**的新鞋去了学校的聚会。"},
52924:{"w":"envelope","e":"Please write your address clearly on the front of the envelope before you post it.","t":"寄信之前，请在**信封**正面写清楚你的地址。"},
52925:{"w":"pollution","e":"Too many cars on the road can cause air pollution.","t":"道路上汽车太多会造成空气**污染**。"},
52926:{"w":"battery","e":"I put a new battery in the clock this morning.","t":"今天早上，我给时钟装了一节新**电池**。"},
52927:{"w":"sight","e":"My grandfather's sight is getting worse, so he needs new glasses.","t":"我爷爷的**视力**越来越差，需要配一副新眼镜了。"},
52928:{"w":"rural","e":"My grandparents live in a quiet rural area near the hills.","t":"我的祖父母住在山丘附近一处安静的**乡村**地区。"},
52929:{"w":"blank","e":"Write the missing word in the blank below the picture.","t":"把缺少的单词写在图片下方的**空格**里。"},
52930:{"w":"recipe","e":"My mother gave me her recipe for making tomato and egg soup.","t":"妈妈把她做西红柿鸡蛋汤的**食谱**给了我。"},
52931:{"w":"flight","e":"Our flight to Beijing leaves at nine tomorrow morning.","t":"我们飞往北京的**航班**明天早上九点起飞。"},
52932:{"w":"tense","e":"The players looked tense before the final game began.","t":"决赛开始前，队员们看上去很**紧张**。"},
52933:{"w":"pardon","e":"Pardon, could you say that again a little more slowly?","t":"**不好意思**，你能再慢一点说一遍吗？"},
52934:{"w":"T-shirt","e":"She wore a yellow T-shirt to the park on Sunday.","t":"星期天她穿了件黄色的**T 恤**去公园。"},
52935:{"w":"respect","e":"We should respect people even when we have different ideas.","t":"即使意见不同，我们也应该**尊重**别人。"},
52936:{"w":"factory","e":"My uncle works in a factory that makes school bags.","t":"我叔叔在一家生产书包的**工厂**工作。"},
52937:{"w":"classroom","e":"We opened the classroom windows before the first lesson started.","t":"第一节课开始前，我们打开了**教室**的窗户。"},
52938:{"w":"classmate","e":"A classmate helped me find the right page in my book.","t":"一位**同班同学**帮我找到了书上要看的那一页。"},
52939:{"w":"director","e":"The director of the film spent two years looking for the right actors.","t":"这部电影的**导演**花了两年时间寻找合适的演员。"},
52940:{"w":"patient","e":"The nurse was very patient with the old man who kept asking the same question.","t":"护士对那位一直问同一个问题的老人很**有耐心**。"},
52941:{"w":"till","e":"You can stay here till the rain stops this afternoon.","t":"今天下午，你可以在这儿待**到**雨停。"},
52942:{"w":"butterfly","e":"A colorful butterfly landed on the flower and stayed there for a moment.","t":"一只五彩的**蝴蝶**落在花上，停了一会儿。"},
52943:{"w":"vacation","e":"We are going to visit our grandparents during summer vacation.","t":"我们打算在暑**假**去看望祖父母。"},
52944:{"w":"cancer","e":"Eating well may help lower the risk of some cancers.","t":"吃得健康可能有助于降低患某些**癌症**的风险。"},
52945:{"w":"pilot","e":"The pilot told us why the plane was leaving late.","t":"**飞行员**告诉我们飞机为什么晚点起飞。"},
52946:{"w":"driver","e":"The bus driver waited for us to sit down before leaving.","t":"**司机**等我们在公交车上坐好才开车。"},
52947:{"w":"excited","e":"We were excited about going on our first school trip.","t":"想到要第一次参加学校组织的旅行，我们很**兴奋**。"},
52948:{"w":"exciting","e":"The last five minutes of the game were really exciting.","t":"比赛的最后五分钟真让人**激动**。"},
52949:{"w":"smooth","e":"The baby's skin is as smooth as silk, and it feels lovely to touch.","t":"宝宝的皮肤像丝绸一样**光滑**，摸起来很舒服。"},
52950:{"w":"paint","e":"We need to buy some white paint to cover the old wall.","t":"我们需要买些白色**油漆**来盖住旧墙面。"},
52951:{"w":"ice cream","e":"We bought some ice cream after walking around the zoo.","t":"逛完动物园，我们买了些**冰淇淋**。"},
52952:{"w":"palace","e":"We visited the king's old palace on our school trip.","t":"学校组织旅行时，我们参观了国王过去住过的**王宫**。"},
52953:{"w":"biscuit","e":"I had a biscuit with my tea after school today.","t":"今天放学后，我喝了杯茶，吃了块**饼干**。"},
52954:{"w":"grandma","e":"My grandma taught me how to make dumplings last winter.","t":"去年冬天，**奶奶**教我包饺子。"},
52955:{"w":"weigh","e":"Please weigh your bag before you put it on the bus.","t":"把包放上车前，请先**称**一下重量。"},
52956:{"w":"website","e":"You can find the school timetable on our school website.","t":"你可以在学校**网站**上查到课程表。"},
52957:{"w":"Ms","e":"Ms Green will teach our class English this school year.","t":"这个学年，格林**女士**会教我们班英语。"},
52958:{"w":"brush","e":"I always brush my teeth before I go to bed.","t":"我每天睡觉前都会**刷**牙。"},
52959:{"w":"hi","e":"She waved and said hi when she saw me outside.","t":"她在外面看见我时，挥手说了声**嗨**。"},
52960:{"w":"keyboard","e":"My cat likes to walk across the keyboard while I am typing my homework.","t":"我打作业的时候，我的猫喜欢在**键盘**上走来走去。"},
52961:{"w":"nearly","e":"It was nearly midnight when we finally got home after the long trip.","t":"长途旅行后我们终于到家时，已经**将近**午夜了。"},
52962:{"w":"goal","e":"My goal is to read ten English books this year.","t":"我今年的**目标**是读十本英文书。"},
52963:{"w":"no","e":"There are no buses from our village after nine at night.","t":"晚上九点后，就**没有**公交车从我们村出发了。"},
52964:{"w":"bedroom","e":"I left my school bag on the floor of my bedroom.","t":"我把书包落在了**卧室**的地板上。"},
52965:{"w":"advise","e":"My teacher advised me to read English newspapers every day.","t":"老师**建议**我每天读英文报纸。"},
52966:{"w":"nod","e":"She nodded to show that she agreed with me.","t":"她**点头**表示她同意我的看法。"},
52967:{"w":"boring","e":"The film was so boring that half of the people fell asleep before the end.","t":"这部电影太**无聊**了，一半的人没看完就睡着了。"},
52968:{"w":"technology","e":"New technology helps our class talk to students in other countries.","t":"新**技术**让我们班能和其他国家的学生交流。"},
52969:{"w":"feeling","e":"I had a strange feeling that someone was watching me in the dark.","t":"我在黑暗中有种奇怪的**感觉**，好像有人在看着我。"},
52970:{"w":"o'clock","e":"We got home at six o'clock and cooked dinner together.","t":"我们六**点**到家，然后一起做了晚饭。"},
52971:{"w":"trousers","e":"He got his trousers wet when he walked through the grass.","t":"他走过草地时把**裤子**弄湿了。"},
52972:{"w":"giraffe","e":"We saw a giraffe eating leaves from a tall tree.","t":"我们看见一只**长颈鹿**在吃高处的树叶。"},
52973:{"w":"Miss","e":"Miss Brown asked us to bring our books to class.","t":"布朗**小姐**让我们把书带到课堂上。"},
52974:{"w":"bean","e":"My mother bought some fresh green beans at the market and cooked them for dinner.","t":"妈妈在市场买了些新鲜的**豆角**，做了晚饭。"},
52975:{"w":"community","e":"Our local community has built a new library and a small park for children.","t":"我们当地的**社区**新建了一座图书馆和一个儿童小公园。"},
52976:{"w":"relationship","e":"I have a good relationship with my younger brother now.","t":"我现在和弟弟的**关系**很好。"},
52977:{"w":"Interesting","e":"Interesting stories help us learn a lot about other people.","t":"**有趣**的故事能让我们多了解别人。"},
52978:{"w":"pollute","e":"We must not pollute the river by throwing rubbish into it.","t":"我们不能把垃圾扔进河里，**污染**河水。"},
52979:{"w":"pale","e":"She looked pale and tired after staying up all night to study.","t":"熬夜学习了一整晚后，她看起来脸色**苍白**，很疲惫。"},
52980:{"w":"officer","e":"A police officer helped us find our way to the station.","t":"一位**警察**给我们指了去车站的路。"},
52981:{"w":"cartoon","e":"My little brother watches cartoons for an hour every evening after dinner.","t":"我弟弟每天晚饭后看一小时**动画片**。"},
52982:{"w":"personal","e":"Please keep your personal information safe when you go online.","t":"上网时请保护好你的**个人**信息。"},
52983:{"w":"winner","e":"The winner of the race got a new school bag.","t":"赛跑的**获胜者**得到一个新书包。"},
52984:{"w":"swing","e":"The children took turns on the swing in the park.","t":"孩子们轮流玩公园里的**秋千**。"},
52985:{"w":"clerk","e":"The clerk at the hotel gave us our room keys.","t":"旅馆的**接待员**把房间钥匙交给了我们。"},
52986:{"w":"solution","e":"It took time to find a solution to the problem.","t":"找到解决该问题的**方法**需要时间。"},
52987:{"w":"hunger","e":"The hot soup helped ease my hunger after school today.","t":"今天放学后，喝了碗热汤，我的**饥饿感**减轻了。"},
52988:{"w":"slipper","e":"I lost one slipper and found it under the bed.","t":"我丢了一只**拖鞋**，后来在床底下找到了。"},
52989:{"w":"turkey","e":"We had roast turkey, potatoes and cake for Christmas dinner.","t":"圣诞晚餐我们吃了烤**火鸡**、土豆和蛋糕。"},
52990:{"w":"verb","e":"Please write down the verb that shows what she did.","t":"请写下表示她做了什么的那个**动词**。"},
52991:{"w":"singer","e":"My favourite singer is coming to our town next month.","t":"我最喜欢的**歌手**下个月要来我们镇上。"},
52992:{"w":"creature","e":"The ocean is home to many strange creatures that people have never seen before.","t":"海洋里生活着许多人们从未见过的奇怪**生物**。"},
52993:{"w":"southeast","e":"We drove southeast along the coast to a small town.","t":"我们沿海岸向**东南**开车，到了一个小镇。"},
52994:{"w":"custom","e":"It is a custom in China to eat dumplings on New Year's Eve.","t":"在中国，除夕吃饺子是一种**习俗**。"},
52995:{"w":"scientific","e":"Our class did a scientific study of plants in the school garden.","t":"我们班对学校花园里的植物做了一项**科学**研究。"},
52996:{"w":"experiment","e":"In today's science class, we did an experiment with water and salt.","t":"今天的科学课上，我们用水和盐做了一个**实验**。"},
52997:{"w":"unfriendly","e":"The cat looked unfriendly, so we left it alone.","t":"那只猫看起来**不太友好**，我们就没去招惹它。"}
});
